<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="ACT" style="id">- Bu New Testament</book>
  <para style="rem">Copy right</para>
  <para style="h">Mi'shinkǝn</para>
  <para style="toc1">Kyautǝn ki mi'shinkǝn</para>
  <para style="toc2">Mi'shinkǝn</para>
  <para style="toc3">Ms</para>
  <para style="mt1">Kyautǝn ki mi'shinkǝn</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="ACT 1" />
  <para style="s">Yesu shilǝn tǝn mbǝ ki Yal ki mbatl ki Lya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 1:1" />Age lwatbati ki nǝm, Tiyapolos, na laci atǝn mus unnǝ Yesu gop pǝlti nǝ kushti u, <verse eid="ACT 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 1:2" />i mbǝl cin u nǝs kanti twalya u, kal ki ta bǝl zhili tu'ma Yal ki mbatl ki Lya ma mi'shinkǝn u nǝ'shinsi u. <verse eid="ACT 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 1:3" />Kal ki tle bǝnawasi immbǝl gawasi masi tǝn sǝ' mani kami tiɗa nǝ ndǝlti mul nalti, ati mbǝ ma'si dlepdlep mutti kutl kutl lǝbi upsi, ati dlǝp shilǝn ki libi ki gu' ki Lya. <verse eid="ACT 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 1:4" />Age cin won, ati ɗap ulki ɗami nesi, immbǝlsi zhil gu “Bǝs zǝga ɗǝ Ulushelima pa wai, sǝ' mbu' njikǝ' ki shilǝn u nǝ mul ban pǝli u, gunǝ' kumin abi i u, <verse eid="ACT 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 1:5" />Yahaya ɓo, nǝ mal kǝn tǝ pǝli mbalǝn batisma, amma kal ki mutti ten nǝ Yal ki mbatl ki Lya kǝn tǝ' pǝlikin batisma.”<verse eid="ACT 1:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Akan Yesu Twa lya i</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 1:6" />I mil shinkǝnwas domga ma'ti is gyemti, “Mulban, nǝgun u ki' palli Islaila gunta?” <verse eid="ACT 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 1:7" />I' ulsisu: “Mat cin ko hwon nǝ mulban guu Lya zi' tǝn ndǝltwasi gwakǝnkǝnwai. <verse eid="ACT 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 1:8" />Amma kǝn nje ndǝlti in Yal ki mbatl ki Lya a suikin suɗu; kǝn dǝmitǝn mi' yenti nǝ dwaɗi a Ulshelima, nǝ a Yahudiya nǝ Samaliya, nǝ pa'ti ki dǝp lǝɓa.” <verse eid="ACT 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 1:9" />Kal ki ta dlǝm gu i, i kanti twa lya atǝn dwaɗǝnwasǝn, i kukuti idlati, sa yenti nuwai. <verse eid="ACT 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 1:10" />Sǝge yallu twalya ati zǝ'ga, iki mbalǝn loppen kǝnngi ge' hwol luluti amalgunwasǝn. <verse eid="ACT 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 1:11" />Is ussu, “Mbalǝn ki Galili, yalakiɗa i' dlǝlni aki, aki ya'lu twalya ɗa? Nǝm Yesu u, nǝs kanti twalya u, tǝn palti kan u nǝs kanti taka ɗǝ ma'kini twalya u.”<verse eid="ACT 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">A ol Matiyes i Tǝ' njikǝn Shu ki Yahuza</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 1:12" />Iki i mi'shinkǝn paltya Ulshelima nǝs palsud tǝn zǝnga gunǝ ɗǝ mbetti ki Zǝnga Zaitun, gunǝ nja nǝ gadl ki Ulshelima lǝ' ki mil nǝm. <verse eid="ACT 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 1:13" />Nǝs mbǝci' u, is toge' kǝpsi ki lya gunǝ si dǝp a giɓi u. Ginǝ mbǝyi siki Bitlus, Yahaya, Yakubu nǝ Andalawus, Pilibus, nǝ Toma, Baltholomawus nǝ Matiyu, Yakubu yakǝn ki Halpa nǝ Siman Zaloti, nǝ Yahuza yakǝn ki Yakubu ɗaɗanu. <verse eid="ACT 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 1:14" />Mus is dom ga nǝ mbatl nǝm asi shilǝn nǝ Lya, ne' mudli yen nǝ Maliyamu dya ki Yesu, nǝ yelsǝni ki Yesu. <verse eid="ACT 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 1:15" />Age muttiyi Bitlus hillya gal adlom ki mil bǝtl Yesu kal (dopga ki mbalǝni kutl cen nǝm nǝ kutl lǝbi lop) <verse eid="ACT 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 1:16" />Kini “Yelsǝni ini mwani nǝ mudli, hwel kǝn tǝn njikǝn lwatbatu gunǝ Yal ki mbatl ki Lya shilǝni tu' bi ɗǝ Dauda teɗi tǝn Yahuza, gunǝ nde mi' gopti Yesu kina u. <verse eid="ACT 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 1:17" />Tima nǝmkǝni ge'mini teɗi gunǝ olti tǝppǝl kyautǝn ki Lya ne'mini u.” <verse eid="ACT 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 1:18" />(Nǝ ulnǝs bǝlti ki bezǝn kyautǝnwasi, Yahuza ul lu ɗa; a kikǝn tǝ nda nǝ ga, i tugwas mbutli, i mus o'twas bena. <verse eid="ACT 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 1:19" />I kowonngi a Ulushalima kumgu, iki is mbe lǝbisi nǝ biwasǝn Akaldama, iki, lu ki hwula.)<verse eid="ACT 1:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 1:20" />Bitlus usu, “Tǝn gaki ki laci ɗa ge' lwatbati ki Zabula:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 1:20">“ ‘Libi wasi nǝn dǝmti ko'ni,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 1:20">bǝ mulǝn dǝmgiɓiwai.’</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 1:20">‘Naltwasi tǝ mulǝn akami.’ ”<verse eid="ACT 1:20" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 1:21" />“Nǝguɗa, hwel kǝni tǝn ollǝn mulǝn age' mbalǝn i nǝ ne'mini u, mus cin u nǝ Mulban inǝn Yesu ɗǝ dǝp ne'mini u, <verse eid="ACT 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 1:22" />Gopi tǝn batisma unǝ Yahaya pǝli u, i mbǝl cin u nǝs kan Yesu ɗǝma'mini u. Hwel kǝni nǝm age' mbalǝn gi, ti' pǝl yenti nǝ dwaɗǝn ki hillya ki Yesu ge' mi'mǝshti, ne'mini.” <verse eid="ACT 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 1:23" />Is mbo' tohtǝn mbalǝn lop: Yusupu gunǝ si mbeti ki Balsaba (si mbeti ɗaɗanu ki Yustus) nǝ Matiyes. <verse eid="ACT 1:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 1:24" />Iki is shilǝn nǝ Lya, is usu, “Mulban inǝn ki mul ma' mbalt ki mus mbalǝn. Age' mbalǝn lopi mbokimi tohtǝn gunǝ' oltu, <verse eid="ACT 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 1:25" />tǝ' dǝp mulshinkǝn ki kyautǝn gunǝ Yahuza zaki is zǝga ge'lu unǝ mbunnitu.” <verse eid="ACT 1:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 1:26" />Iki is pǝl olti, i ndatǝn Matiyes; i mbǝltǝn kutl nǝ nǝm mi.<verse eid="ACT 1:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="ACT 2" />
  <para style="s">Mbǝ ki Yal ki Mbatl ki Lya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 2:1" />Nǝ cinkǝ penticos mbǝ u, kummwasǝn mi'kushti asi gelu kǝnǝmi. <verse eid="ACT 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 2:2" />Sige nǝgu i kum otiluwon sullya, kǝnǝ mbǝ' ki bal yetǝl, i mbǝ i ikǝn libi u nǝ siki dǝmi giɓi u. <verse eid="ACT 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 2:3" />I uliyen kǝnǝ lǝga ki bǝlǝn utu i bwasi tya tǝn gawasǝn. <verse eid="ACT 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 2:4" />Kummwasǝn is ikǝn nǝ Yal ki batl ki Lya is gop shilǝn nǝ unndi biyen nǝ Yal ki batl ki Lya bǝlsi u. <verse eid="ACT 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 2:5" />Yahudawa yen ɗa mi' bǝtl zhil ki Musa, asi ki dǝmi a Ulushelima, nǝs pete'ge atlen ki dǝplǝɓa. <verse eid="ACT 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 2:6" />Nǝs kum o'tilu u, i dopga ki mbalǝn mani, ilu hwodǝli, tǝngaki kowonngi ɗǝ kupsi asi shilǝn nǝ bishilǝnwasǝn. <verse eid="ACT 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 2:7" />Iki is kum gagashinti, asi usu, “Mi' Galili ɗǝ shilǝn u waiwa? <verse eid="ACT 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 2:8" />Ya lakiɗa musinǝn mi kupsi ɗǝ shilǝn nǝ bi inǝn? <verse eid="ACT 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 2:9" />Mingu paltiyawani nǝ Madiyana nǝ Elamawa, mi' dǝp ki atl ki Bagadaza, nǝ ki Yahudiya nǝ ki Kapadokiya, nǝ ki Pantas nǝ ki Asiya, <verse eid="ACT 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 2:10" />nǝ ki Pilijiya, nǝ ki Bampiliya, nǝ ki Masal, nǝ kuma yanki Kulane ki atl ki Libiya nǝ sǝmbǝlsi te' Loma, wato mi ginǝ zǝmi ge' bǝtl Lya ki Yahudawa, nǝ mbalǝnyi nǝ tege' bǝtl Lya undi ki Yahudawa u, <verse eid="ACT 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 2:11" />nǝ Kalitawa nǝ Lalabawa, mus mi kupsi ɗǝ shilǝn ki bas lǝɓa ki Lya nǝ bi kige' gatlinǝn.” <verse eid="ACT 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 2:12" />Mus is kum gagashinti, is hwoɗǝli, is gop gyep yelsǝni, “Yakǝn ngu?” <verse eid="ACT 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 2:13" />I gyen, ngayisi shilǝn is usu, “Mal ki innabi si tle iye.”<verse eid="ACT 2:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">I Bitlus Shilǝn nǝ Mbalǝn Diɓǝli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 2:14" />Iki i Bitlus hilya nǝ kutl nǝ nǝm mi, i' tlǝl Yal i' shilǝn nǝ diɓǝl mbalǝn, i' usu, “Yelsǝni ini Yahudawa nǝ mus mi' dǝp a Ulshelima, hwe ta pikin shilǝn u; gakǝn kǝm ki zeki tǝn ulnǝ ta dlǝmi u. <verse eid="ACT 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 2:15" />Mbalǝn yi sǝ tle mal ki innabiwai, kan u nǝki zitini uwai, nǝgun dom ki nǝtapsi katl kinǝkyau! <verse eid="ACT 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 2:16" />Guki ulnǝ Joyel mul nje shinkǝn ki Lya shilǝn tǝnki u ti usu:<verse eid="ACT 2:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 2:17" />“ ‘Age pa'ti ki dǝp lǝɓa, Lya usu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:17">anbine' mus mbalǝn Yal ki mbatl ki Lya suɗi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 2:17">Millwakǝn mwani nǝ mudli sǝn shilǝnti nǝ ndǝtl ki Lya,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:17">tlu'ti nǝn mbi mil giɗǝnsiwakǝn,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:17">kolsiwakǝn sǝn tlu'ti.<verse eid="ACT 2:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 2:18" />Nǝguɗa, ge' muttu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:18">zhelsi ini mwani nǝ mudli anbine'si Yal ki mbatl ki Lya suɗi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:18">sǝn shilǝnti nǝ ndǝtl ki Lya ɗaɗanu.<verse eid="ACT 2:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 2:19" />Anpǝli'si ulki gagashinti a lya,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:19">nǝ lwaɗi su'atli,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:19">iki hwula, nǝ utu, nǝ hillya ki cil.<verse eid="ACT 2:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 2:20" />Kapǝn mbǝ ki Mulban balcin mul naltu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:20">cin nǝ patl dǝpshal</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:20">lyi nǝn patl hwula.<verse eid="ACT 2:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 2:21" />Age' cin u nǝn dǝmti mus mulnǝ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:21">mbe' shin ki Lya u tǝn mbi pe'ti.’ ”<verse eid="ACT 2:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 2:22" />“Kini yelsǝni ini Isla'ilawa gakǝn kǝm tǝn shilǝn u: Yesu mul Nazalat gunǝ Lya kǝni ma'kini tu tǝn, pǝl ulki ki gagashinti, nǝ ulki ngaptibi nǝ lwaɗi, gunǝ Lya pǝli ge' kini tumati, gunǝn yeninini nǝ dwaɗǝwakǝn u. <verse eid="ACT 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 2:23" />Mul gu, Lya nǝ gawasi ti bǝlkinti a toh wakǝn nǝ kan u nǝs zi nǝ mantiwasi nǝ ndǝ'twasi, kini nǝ ɗǝlki mil bezǝn lǝɓa, ki tolinti tǝn gadlǝnnga i' tloti. <verse eid="ACT 2:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 2:24" />Ngonǝ nǝgu i Lya tlǝlti ɗǝ ge' mi'mǝshti, tǝngaki mushti aman ngaptiwai. Lya tlǝlti ɗǝ ge' mi'mǝshti, tǝngaki mushti aman ngaptiwai. <verse eid="ACT 2:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 2:25" />Dauda shilǝn tǝnti i' usu:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 2:25">“ ‘Ko gaswukǝni Mulban akina ini,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:25">ti tǝn toh shimtini,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:25">tǝn gaki ɓa wuni.<verse eid="ACT 2:25" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 2:26" />Tǝngaki nǝgu mbatlini ɗǝ hwoltugi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:26">lǝga ini ɗǝ utl ulki hwoltugi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:26">dli ini nǝn dǝmti nǝ lati mbatli,<verse eid="ACT 2:26" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 2:27" />tǝngaki nǝgu tikǝn zati dli ini age zuɗiwai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:27">ki kǝn zati mulguntwagi apɓoswai.<verse eid="ACT 2:27" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 2:28" />Tǝn la'ti aman shitu ki mbadli.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:28">Tǝn ikǝntǝn nǝ hwoltugi akinawasi.’<verse eid="ACT 2:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 2:29" />“Yelsǝni ini Isla'ila, amma' pi'kin shilǝn bǝnǝ catl mbadlwai atǝn bwas ki bwasinǝn Dawuda. Dawuda ta mǝci, akupti. Zuɗiwasi ama'mini hal nǝguni. <verse eid="ACT 2:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 2:30" />Amma ti mul njeshinkǝn ki Lya kǝni timanini Lya apǝli' ndǝ'ti nǝ ndaltannaca, tǝn zǝ'nǝm ge' gǝswasi tǝn guntwasi. <verse eid="ACT 2:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 2:31" />Tun teɗi Dawuda a yenini, i' shilǝni tǝn hillya ki Almasihu ɗǝ ge' mi' mǝshti, tǝkǝn zatiti age zuɗiwai, dliwas kǝn ɓostwai. <verse eid="ACT 2:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 2:32" />I Lya tlilti Yesu ɗǝ ge mi' mǝshti, mussinǝn ɗaɗanu mi' yenti nǝ dwaɗǝn kǝni. <verse eid="ACT 2:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 2:33" />Ngo nǝnǝgu a nalti tǝn tohship ki Lya i, ta nje Yal ki mbatl ki zoki mul gunti ma bwasi, kan u nǝppǝl ndǝ'ti, tin bina' Yal ki mbatl ki Lya tǝn ga inǝn, i mbǝl ulnǝ yenini u nǝ ulnǝ kumini u. <verse eid="ACT 2:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 2:34" />Dawuda tolyawai, tinǝ gawasi, i' usu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 2:34">“ ‘Mulban ul mulban isu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:34">“dǝm a tohshimtini, <verse eid="ACT 2:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 2:35" />Sai nǝ ala' mi'ngeki agǝs asǝn wagi.” ’ <verse eid="ACT 2:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 2:36" />Tǝn gaki nǝgu, mus Isla'ila sǝnmanica Yesu u nǝ' tolti tǝn gadlǝnnga u, Lya apalti mulban nǝ Almasihu.” <verse eid="ACT 2:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 2:37" />Nǝ mbalǝn kumi nǝgu u, i shilǝnisi tǝnisi mbadli, is ul Bitlus nǝ na mi'shinkǝn usu, “Yelsǝni, yakǝn tǝn pǝlini?” <verse eid="ACT 2:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 2:38" />I Bitlus pisi, “Zakǝn pǝtl bezǝn lǝɓa a pǝlikin Batisma, kowonngi, ge' shinki Yesu Almasihu tǝn ti' paci kin bezǝn lǝɓawakǝnɗa. Kǝn mbi bǝlti ki Yal ki mbatl ki Lya ki zoki. <verse eid="ACT 2:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 2:39" />Ndǝ'tu kini pǝli kini nǝ milwakǝn nǝ ginǝ lolu, nǝ mus ginǝ mulban Lya nǝn mbessibi u.” <verse eid="ACT 2:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 2:40" />Nǝ shilǝn mul diɓǝtl kǝn ti dǝlisi kǝm; i' matisi, “Pekǝlǝn gawakǝn ɗǝge' besǝn hwon ki nǝguni.” <verse eid="ACT 2:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 2:41" />Ginǝ kum shilǝn u ipǝlisi Batisma, ge'cin u mbalǝn zangu maki mbǝltǝnsi.<verse eid="ACT 2:41" /></para>
  <para style="s">Dǝp ki mi'bǝtl Yesu kal</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="ACT 2:42" />Is ga'kǝm, tǝn kushti ki mi' shinkǝn ɗǝ pǝlti u, asi ma'ga nǝ yelsǝni, asi ɗamti gelu kǝnǝmi, asi shilǝn nǝ Lya. <verse eid="ACT 2:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="ACT 2:43" />Is kum ɓanti, nǝ ulki gagashin nǝ lwaɗi nǝ Lya pǝli ma mi' shinkǝn u. <verse eid="ACT 2:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="ACT 2:44" />Mus mi'bǝtl Yesu si ge'lu kǝnǝmi mus lǝɓawasǝn ge'lu kǝnǝmi. <verse eid="ACT 2:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="ACT 2:45" />Is ul lǝɓawasǝn taka nǝ nisiɗa u asi bwasi' yelsǝni wasǝn ulpisi ginǝ bǝnisi ɗawai u tǝn lyamtiwasǝn. <verse eid="ACT 2:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="ACT 2:46" />Ko gasiwukǝni si dopga age' libi ki Lya nǝ mbatl nǝm. Asi ɗap ulki ɗami a libiwasǝn ge'lu kǝnǝmi, si ɗapti asi tleti nǝ hwoltugi, nǝ ndǝti ki mbatli. <verse eid="ACT 2:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="ACT 2:47" />Is dǝmshot si ngep Lya asi mbi hwol hwula ma mbalǝn. Ko cin u kǝni a Lya ɗǝ mbǝl diɓǝltwasǝn tǝnki ginǝs pe'tu.<verse eid="ACT 2:47" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="ACT 3" />
  <para style="s">Bitlus Ndokǝl Dakǝl mul Ngeplu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 3:1" />Gasiwon Bitlus nǝ Yahaya silǝ' libi ki Lya cin ki shilǝn nǝ Lya, dom ki maki ki cin su'ti. <verse eid="ACT 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 3:2" />I ki mulǝn kǝn ngu gunǝs zǝ'ti dakǝl, si mbǝtlti a bidlabi libi ki Lya guni ɗǝ mbe'ti zeki, alǝbi si zǝ'ti ko anǝmi ɗǝ ngeplu ma' ginǝ ɗǝ te'ge libi ki Lya u. <verse eid="ACT 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 3:3" />Nǝ'yen ki Bitlus nǝ Yahaya u ɗǝ te' libi ki Lya u. I' ngemsi ɗǝ ulpi. <verse eid="ACT 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 3:4" />I Bitlus utti' dwaɗǝn, isi Yahaya. I Bitlus usu, “Yami!” <verse eid="ACT 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 3:5" />I mus i' ga'kisi kǝm, nǝ lati mbatli ki mbi ulǝn ma'si. <verse eid="ACT 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 3:6" />I Bitlus usu, “Upɓo ni ɗawai, tǝn gaki nǝgu ulnǝ ni ɗa u ita bǝlki. Ge shinki Yesu ki Nazalat, ɗaki lǝ.” <verse eid="ACT 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 3:7" />I ki i Bitlus ngap tohwasi ki tohshmti, i' tliltilya, nǝ dleuti asǝnwasi nǝ Yal asǝnwasi i ndǝli. <verse eid="ACT 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 3:8" />Nǝ dleuti ippe'lya tǝn asǝnwasi i' gop lǝti. Illǝ libi ki Lya ne'si, ati lǝti nǝ pe'ti lya ɗǝ natl Lya. <verse eid="ACT 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 3:9" />Nǝ mus mbalǝn yenti ɗǝ lǝti ati natl Lya u, <verse eid="ACT 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 3:10" />Is manti tikuɗǝ dǝb abidlabi libi ki Lya ɗǝ ngeplu, is ikǝn nǝ ulki ngaptibi nǝ ulki gagashinti atǝn ndo'twasi.<verse eid="ACT 3:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Shilǝn ki Bitlus a ge'libi ki Lya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 3:11" />Amuli ɗǝ bǝtl ki Bitlus kal nǝ Yohanna, Mus mbalǝn mbǝ nǝ kitǝl ma'si age' libi ki Lya gunǝ si mbettikǝ lu shu'ti ki Sulemanu u, asi ngapti bi. <verse eid="ACT 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 3:12" />Nǝ Bitlus yen gu u, i' ulsisu: “Yelsǝni ini Isla'ilawa, yalakiɗa ullu ɗǝ bǝtlkin ngaptibiɗa? Tǝngaki yakǝn ki ya'miɗa nǝgu, ki yenti ndǝltinǝn ko bǝtl Lya inǝn kǝn laki i mulu lǝ'ɗaya? <verse eid="ACT 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 3:13" />Lya ki Iblahim, nǝ Ishaku, nǝ Yakubu, Lya ki mi'zǝ mi'zǝ'mini, innal zheliwasi Yesu. I ngeti a kina ki Bilatus, nǝl lyami tǝs za'tu, gunǝ' bǝlǝnti is tloti. <verse eid="ACT 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 3:14" />I' ngeti mulguntu nǝ zo'mbatlu i' ngemini sǝ' zakikin mul tlo mbalǝn u. <verse eid="ACT 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 3:15" />I' tlo gǝs ki mbadli, iki i Lya tlǝlti ɗǝ ge' mi' mǝshti. Nǝgu mi yeni ndatǝn dwaɗǝn inǝn. <verse eid="ACT 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 3:16" />Nǝ la'ti mbatl ge' shin ki Yesu, mulu nǝ' yenintu, nǝ' manǝntu, mulnǝ bǝlti ndǝltu tiki Yesu, nǝ la'ti mbatl nǝ shinwasi tu'mati tǝmbi ndokǝl ti mul gu nǝ muswakǝn ki yetti u.<verse eid="ACT 3:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 3:17" />“Nǝgun, yelsǝnǝ ini Isla'ila amani ge' lǝshi ma' ulǝnkǝn ki tloti ɗa kan u nǝ mi'kina wakǝn pǝli u. <verse eid="ACT 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 3:18" />Ngonǝ nǝgu Lya a ikǝn ulnǝ' dlǝmi tun te'ɗu abi ki mus mi'nje shikǝn ki Lya, ɗǝ usu Almasihu wasi tǝn tle' bǝna. <verse eid="ACT 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 3:19" />Zakǝn pǝtl bezǝn lǝɓa, a' palnitai ma Lya, tǝngaki tǝ' santikin bezǝn lǝɓawakǝnɗa, an ndǝllikin mbadli, <verse eid="ACT 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 3:20" />i'shin Almasihu, gunǝ' olikini u tun te'ɗi, tiki Yesu. <verse eid="ACT 3:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 3:21" />Hwelkǝn tǝ Yesu dǝm twa lya hal gasi u nǝtǝ Lya patl mus usi pyale u, nǝ Lya dlǝl shilǝn tun te'ɗigi abi ɗǝ mi'nje shinkǝnwasu. <verse eid="ACT 3:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 3:22" />Musa usu, ‘Mulban Lya wakǝn nǝn tlǝli' kin mul njeshinkǝn ki Lya won kǝnǝ ami age mbalǝn wakǝn; hwelkǝn ki gakǝn kǝm tǝn mus ulnǝ ti' pikini u <verse eid="ACT 3:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 3:23" />Mulnǝ a nge gakitti kǝmu nǝn pe'kǝtlti ɗǝ ge' mbalǝnwasi.’<verse eid="ACT 3:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 3:24" />“Nǝguɗa, i gopi tun tǝn Sama'ila, i lǝtǝn ginǝ mbǝ kali is shilǝn tǝn mutti. <verse eid="ACT 3:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 3:25" />Kini ki gǝskǝ mi'njeshinkǝn, kini ki mi'nje ndǝti nǝ Lya pǝli mi'zǝ'mi'zǝ'kini. I' ul Iblahim su, ‘Tu'ma'gǝs ki mbalǝn wa'kǝn mus mbalǝn mi'dǝp lǝɓa nǝn mbin nalti.’ <verse eid="ACT 3:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 3:26" />Nǝ Lya a tlǝl zheli was suɗu, makini tishinti pa, tǝ zikin toh ki patl kowonngi tet taka ɗǝ tǝn shitu ki ɗashti ki tugi.”<verse eid="ACT 3:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="ACT 4" />
  <para style="s">Sǝ tǝla ki Bitlus isǝ Yahaya abidla ɗǝ mi'dlǝtl shilǝn</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 4:1" />Lǝɓasi, nǝ mi'kina ki ɓutti dlabi ki libi ki Lya nǝ Sadukiyawa is mbǝ ma' Bitlus nǝ Yahaya asi ge' shilǝn nǝ mbalǝn. <verse eid="ACT 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 4:2" />Is lyau mbadli nǝ mi' kushti ki Yesu tǝngaki si kulci' mbalǝn, tǝn hillya ki Yesu ge' mi' mǝshti. <verse eid="ACT 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 4:3" />Is gop ki Bitlus nǝ Yahaya is idlasi sai nǝ lu acili tǝngaki su' kǝn ɓali. <verse eid="ACT 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 4:4" />Amma ginǝ kum shilǝn ki Bitlus is ndǝ'nǝnali u; diɓǝltwasǝn sa tǝla zangu nantam. <verse eid="ACT 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 4:5" />Lu cilisi mi'kinawasǝn nǝ kolsiwasǝn nǝ mi'bǝtl lashti zhil ki Musa is ma a Ulshelima. <verse eid="ACT 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 4:6" />Nǝ Hanana bal lǝɓa ki Lya ti alǝbi nǝ Kayapa nǝ Yahaya nǝ Iskandali nǝ mus gǝskǝ ki bali ki bas lǝɓasi ki Lya, <verse eid="ACT 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 4:7" />Nǝs mbǝl ki Bitlus nǝ Yahaya akina u is gop ngepsi: “Nǝ ndǝltu kǝni ko nǝ shin u kǝn, ki pǝltin nǝgu?” <verse eid="ACT 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 4:8" />Bitlus, ki ikǝni nǝ Yal ki mbatl ki Lya, i' ulsisu: “Kini gumsisi nǝ kolsi! <verse eid="ACT 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 4:9" />Ki takimibi asǝti tǝn ki ngepmǝnmi tǝn ze' ulnǝ pǝli dakǝl mulu nǝ tu' imi kǝnti ndoɗa, <verse eid="ACT 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 4:10" />manǝnngu, kinǝ mus mbalǝn ki Isla'ila: Mul gu nǝ ki dlǝli kinawakǝn ki ndoki u nǝ shin ki Yesu almasihu Mulnazalat, gunǝ tolǝnti tǝn gadlǝnnga u guni Lya tlǝlti ɗǝ ge' mi'mǝshtu, <verse eid="ACT 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 4:11" />Yesu tiki,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 4:11">“ ‘Zǝnnga gunǝ kini mi'kǝpbi nge u,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 4:11">iddǝm zǝnnga ki zoki ki kǝpbi.’<verse eid="ACT 4:11" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 4:12" />Peti kǝn mbidli ma mulunwai, kuma shinwonɗawai guni bǝldli a lya nǝ atli nǝ ge' mbalǝn adǝplǝɓa hwel ma'ti tǝnmbi peti.” <verse eid="ACT 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 4:13" />Nǝs yen ndǝtl ki mbatl ki Bitlus nǝ Yahaya u, is mani sa pǝl lashtiwai, mi'lǝshi usun kǝni ɗaɗanu, is kum ngaptibi is mansi mbalǝn gi teɗi ne' Yesu siɗa. <verse eid="ACT 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 4:14" />Amma nǝs yen mulnǝs ndokǝltu ki dlǝli nesi u, is hwol ulki dlǝmi. <verse eid="ACT 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 4:15" />Ngo' nǝnǝgu is bǝlsi zhil ki sǝ'peki ɗǝ bidla nǝ sǝ'shilǝn nǝ yelsǝni u, <verse eid="ACT 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 4:16" />is usu, “yakǝn tǝn pǝlin nǝ mbalǝnyi? Mus mi'dǝp a Ulshelima sǝ mani sa pǝlin ulki gagashinti, tu'imi kǝntǝn pǝlin nǝ mbalǝn i u mǝkǝn ma'ussu sa pǝl ulǝn wai. <verse eid="ACT 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 4:17" />Amma tǝngagi ɓa ulisi mbǝl du'tǝnki ge' mbalǝn, tǝn dǝlǝsi kǝm bǝs shilǝn nǝ mulin a ge' shin u nuwai.”<verse eid="ACT 4:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 4:18" />Iki is takisi bi te' ɗaɗanu is dǝlisi kǝm bǝs shilǝn ko kushti ge' shin ki Yesu nuwai. <verse eid="ACT 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 4:19" />Amma Bitlus nǝ Yahaya is pallisi shilǝn is usu, “Shilǝn ki Lya kǝn tǝn bǝliya ko gwakǝn? Dambǝlǝn kini. <verse eid="ACT 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 4:20" />Miɓo, mǝkǝn ma'dǝb shot tǝn ulnǝn yeni u nǝ ulnǝn kumi uwai.” <verse eid="ACT 4:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 4:21" />Kal ki samatisi i, is za'si, tǝngaki sahwol kan u nǝ si'hwotisi ishɗa u i tǝngaki mbalǝn, mus malǝn si natl Lya tǝngaki ulnǝ nda u. <verse eid="ACT 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 4:22" />Mul gu nǝ pǝli' ulki gagashinti ki ndokǝltu ta bǝl hwon kutl lǝbi upsi kali.<verse eid="ACT 4:22" /></para>
  <para style="s">I mi' bǝtl Yesu kal Shilǝn nǝ Lya</para>
  <para style="pi">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 4:23" />Nǝs za'ki Bitlus nǝ Yahaya u, is lǝma' mbalǝnwasǝn, is palisi shilǝn u nǝ lǝɓasi ne' mi'kina pisi u. <verse eid="ACT 4:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 4:24" />Si ɗaɗanu nǝ kumti nǝgu, is tlǝl yali musswasǝn nǝ mbatl nǝm asi shilǝn nǝ Lya, is usu, “Lya mulnalti,” ki pǝl lya nǝ atli nǝ bal mali, nǝ mus ulnǝ giɓi u. <verse eid="ACT 4:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 4:25" />Ki shilǝn tu'ma' Yal ki mbatl ki Lya nǝ tubi ki zheliwagi, bwasinǝn Dauda</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 4:25">“ ‘Yalakiɗa ginǝ bǝ Yahudawawai u imbatl lewisi? Mbalǝn ɗaɗanu is dambǝl ulnǝ ɗa baliwai u? <verse eid="ACT 4:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 4:26" />Gumsi ki dǝp lǝɓa is kǝndǝ gǝski dlati, Mi'kǝndǝdlom is maga, is nge Lya, nǝ Almasihuwasi ɗaɗanu.’<verse eid="ACT 4:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 4:27" />“Bali nǝguɗa Hilidus nǝ Buntus Bilatus sa maga i age' gatlu ne' ginǝ ba Yahudawai u nǝ mbalǝn ki Isla'ila si dutu' nǝ Yesu zheli wagi mul guunti, gunǝ' palti Almasihu u. <verse eid="ACT 4:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 4:28" />Sa domga i tǝngaki sǝppǝl mus ulnǝ kǝndǝ tǝn ndǝltwagi nǝ lyamtiwagi tǝnda u. <verse eid="ACT 4:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 4:29" />Nǝguni, Lya, yani si lyap hane'mi kyautǝn, bǝtl zhelisiwagi ndǝtl ki mbadli ki dlǝp shilǝnwagi nǝ ndǝtl ki mbatli, <verse eid="ACT 4:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 4:30" />ta' tohwagi ki ndokǝtl mbalǝn, apǝl ulki gagashinti nǝ lwaɗi tu'ma' shinki zheliwagi guu Yesu.” <verse eid="ACT 4:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 4:31" />Kalki sa shilǝn nǝ Lya i, lu u nǝs domga u igo' nyapti. I mus is ikǝnsi nǝ Yal ki mbatl ki Lya, is gop dlǝp shilǝn ki Lya bǝ nǝ ɓantwai.<verse eid="ACT 4:31" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mi'bǝtl Yesu kal la' Koyanngi wasǝn idǝm Nǝm</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 4:32" />Mus dopga ginǝ ɗǝ duk nǝ Yesu u, ko yangiwasǝn nǝm kǝnǝ, mbadlwasǝn nǝm, mulǝn ɗa tǝ' usu ulkǝ tohwasi gwaskǝn nǝ gwaswai, koyangni mus gwasǝn kǝni. <verse eid="ACT 4:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 4:33" />I mi'shinkǝn ndakina nǝ dlǝmi'mbalǝn ɗaɗanu tǝnpatl ki Yesu kami ndǝ'ti ki shilǝn mul ndǝlti tǝn hillya ki mulban Yesu ge' mi'mǝshti. Ulkǝ zo'ki mul nalti tǝn kowon ngi ge'si, <verse eid="ACT 4:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 4:34" />hal ma mul hwol ulǝn ɗa ge'siwai, tǝngaki mus mi'gu ko libi sa ulitaka i, is mbǝl ulpisi, <verse eid="ACT 4:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 4:35" />is zi' akina ɗǝ mi'shikǝn, i bwasi kowonngi nda'ce nǝ ulkipǝliwasi. <verse eid="ACT 4:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 4:36" />Age nǝgu iki Yusupu, mul Balawiye, gǝswasi mul ki tsibilin Kublus, gunǝ mi'shinkǝn ɗǝ mbetti ki Balnaba, (ikǝ mul ndǝtl mbadli), <verse eid="ACT 4:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 4:37" />i' ul guwastaka, immbǝl ulpisi i'zi akina ɗǝ mi'shikǝn.<verse eid="ACT 4:37" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="ACT 5" />
  <para style="s">Hananiya nǝ Sapilatu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 5:1" />Amma mulǝn mul shin Hananiya, nǝ kǝliwasi Sapilatu, i' ul ulǝn ginǝ nidɗa u taka. <verse eid="ACT 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 5:2" />Isǝ' kǝliwasi is hwundǝl nami age' ulpisi, iki is mbǝl na ulpisi akina ɗǝ milshinkǝn. <verse eid="ACT 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 5:3" />I Bitlus usu, “Ki, Hananiya, tu' imi kǝn Shaiɗa ikkǝn mbatlwagi, hal i lǝge Yal ki mbatl ki Lya, i' hwundǝl na up ki gu wa'ɗa? <verse eid="ACT 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 5:4" />Nǝ'uli taka u ɓo gu i ɓo gwa'kǝn waiya? Kal ki ka uli taka i ɗaɗanu, ulpisi gwakǝn waya? Yalaki i' dambǝlki i' pǝl unndi uluɗa? Mbalǝn kǝn ki ligesiwai Lya kǝn ki ligeti.” <verse eid="ACT 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 5:5" />Nǝ Hananiya kum gu u, i' nda atli alǝbi alǝbi immǝci. Mus ginǝ kumi u, i bal ɓa' gopsi. <verse eid="ACT 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 5:6" />I giɗǝnsiyen tlǝte'ɗi, is kan hwuni is lati ge' lumutti is gadǝlti, is kanti is pekǝlti taka, is le' guti. <verse eid="ACT 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 5:7" />Kal ki cimbǝlti ki dom maki i kǝliwasi teteɗi, bǝnǝ ma' ulnǝ nda uwai. <verse eid="ACT 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 5:8" />I Bitlus ul kǝli su, “Dlǝmini, nǝgu ki ulǝn gu u takawa?” Iki i' usu, “e nǝguni.” <verse eid="ACT 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 5:9" />I Bitlus ultisu, “Tu' imi kǝn ki manǝn bi ki cimbǝlǝn Yal ki mbatl ki mulban ɗa? Kum lǝ' ki ginǝ gwu' mwaniwagu, hal sambǝci dlabi i, sǝn ka'ki, as pe'nǝ hwunwagi.” <verse eid="ACT 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 5:10" />Alǝbi alǝbi in nda a kinawasi immǝci. Nǝ milgiɗǝsi i teteɗu, is mbiti mǝci, is kanti is pekǝlti taka, is guti ma'mwaniwasi. <verse eid="ACT 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 5:11" />Iki i bal ɓa' gop Ikilisiya musswasǝn, nǝ mus ginǝ kum shilǝn ki usi nǝ nda u.<verse eid="ACT 5:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Milshinkǝn ndokǝl mbalǝn diɓǝli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 5:12" />Milshikǝn pǝl lwaɗi nǝ ulki gagashinti mul diɓǝlti age' mbalǝn. Mi'bǝtl Yesu kal musswasǝn nǝ mbatl nǝm kǝn si mati age lu shu'ti ki Sulemanu. <verse eid="ACT 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 5:13" />Amma age' na mbalǝn gon apǝl ndǝtl ki mbatl ki te' ge'siwai, ngonǝnǝgu mbalǝn ɗǝ natlsi. <verse eid="ACT 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 5:14" />Mus nǝnǝgu mi' ndǝ'ti nǝti mwani nǝ mudli mbǝtltin ki siɗa ngǝtl ki kali. <verse eid="ACT 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 5:15" />Hal atala gunǝ si pekǝtl mi'gonti tǝn bishitu ɗǝ latisi tǝn lumutti ki dom nǝ lumutti tǝngaki Bitlus ɓal ɓeutu ko gwasǝnwas ma abǝli tǝn nami wasǝn. <verse eid="ACT 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 5:16" />Mbalǝn ɓo is gop dopga te'ge' gatlen nǝ ki gandǝli nǝ Ulshelima u, is gop mbǝtl mi'gonti nǝ ginǝ dumi'gatdli ɗǝ hwottisi u, musswasǝn is ndoki.<verse eid="ACT 5:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Milshinkǝn ɗǝ tle'bǝna</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 5:17" />Iki i bal lǝɓa ki Lya tlǝte' lya, nǝ musginǝ ne'tu, nǝ mi' ɗalika ki Sadukiyawa, si kub dutu' iye, <verse eid="ACT 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 5:18" />is gop milshinkǝn yi, is la'si gelu kǝndǝ'mbalǝn. <verse eid="ACT 5:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 5:19" />Amma age' gasi iki mul nje shinkǝn ki Lya kǝn ngu i' ɓub'ɓul dlabi ki lu kǝndǝ' mbalinisi, i' pekǝlsi toɗi, i' ulsisu, <verse eid="ACT 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 5:20" />“Zǝn ga, a' dlǝlni age' libi ki Lya, adlǝmi mus mbalǝn pyal shitu ki Lya.” <verse eid="ACT 5:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 5:21" />Nǝs kumi nǝgu u, is tege' libi ki Lya nǝ kyau, is go' kulci mbalǝn. Nǝ bal lǝɓa ki Lya ne' ginǝ si ne'tu mbǝ u, is taki mi' dlǝl shilǝn bi, nǝ mus mi'kina ki Isla'ilawa, is ta shinkǝn tya ge'lu kǝndǝ'mbalǝn sǝm mbǝlsi. <verse eid="ACT 5:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 5:22" />Amma nǝ mi' kǝnndǝ dlom mbǝkǝci ge'lu kǝndǝ'mbalǝn nisi u, sa mbisi lǝbiwai. Iki is palteɗi' is palsi shinkǝn, <verse eid="ACT 5:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 5:23" />Illǝ illembi lu kǝndǝ'mbalǝn nisi ki idle, mi' ɓutti dlabi sikǝ dlili abi dlabi, amma nǝn ɓuli u, ma mbi mulǝn agiɓiwai.” <verse eid="ACT 5:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 5:24" />Nǝ mi' kina ki ɓutti dlabi ki libi ki Lya nǝ bas laɓasi nǝs kumi nǝgu u, is hwodǝli iye tǝn gawasǝn, yakǝn tǝ ulu mbǝlli. <verse eid="ACT 5:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 5:25" />Iki i' mulǝn mbǝ i' usu, “Yanini! Mulu nǝ' lakǝnti gelu kǝndǝ'mbalǝn u si ngi ki dlǝli a libi ki Lya, si kulci' mbalǝn.” <verse eid="ACT 5:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 5:26" />Iki i mul kina ki mi'kǝndǝ'dlom nǝ mil kyautǝn wasi is lǝ is mbǝl milshikǝn nisi. Sa shimsi nǝ ngeswai gaki si ɓulti ɓa mbalǝn la'si nǝ zǝnnga. <verse eid="ACT 5:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 5:27" />Nǝs mbǝl milshinkǝn isi abidla shilǝn u, is dlǝlsi akina ɗǝ mi' dlǝlshilǝn. Iki i bal lǝɓa ngemsi, <verse eid="ACT 5:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 5:28" />i' usu, “Ma ndǝlinkin kǝm bǝ kulcin ge' shin u waiwa, in ngu kushtiwakǝn a dutya Ulshelima i, hal kilyamti ki zimi alhaki ki hwula ki mulu aga inǝn.” <verse eid="ACT 5:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 5:29" />I Bitlus ne' mi'kina is pallisi is usu, “Hwelkǝn tǝn kumi Lya bi ngǝtl mbalǝn. <verse eid="ACT 5:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 5:30" />Lya ki kolsisi inǝn ta tlǝl Yesu i, gunǝ tǝn gadlǝnnga ki tlwotu. <verse eid="ACT 5:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 5:31" />Ti Lya nalti a toh shimtwasi, mul kina nǝ mul pe'kǝtl mbalǝn, tǝngaki tǝ' ɓuli Isla'ila dlabi ki pe'ti ɗǝ ge bezǝn lǝɓa i, as mbi pashti ki bezǝn lǝɓawasǝn ɗa ɗaɗanu. <verse eid="ACT 5:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 5:32" />Mi ɓo mi'yenti nǝ dwuɗǝnwas kǝni atǝn usi, nǝgu ɗaɗanu Yal ki mbatl ki Lya, gunǝ Lya bǝl ginǝ ɗǝ pǝlitti kubbi u.” <verse eid="ACT 5:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 5:33" />Nǝs kumi nǝgu u, iki i mbatl lyewisi iye, asi lyamti kǝnǝ sǝ' tlosi. <verse eid="ACT 5:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 5:34" />Amma mul Palise won mul shin Gamaliyal, mul kushti zhil ki Musa, gunǝ mus mbalǝn ɗǝ natlti, i' hilya age' ludlǝtl shilǝn, ibbǝl zhil ki sǝ' pyakǝl mbalǝnisi swadla pa. <verse eid="ACT 5:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 5:35" />Aki kǝn tǝ usu, “Kini mil Isla'ilawa, pǝn ɗemɗem tǝn ulnǝ ki lyamti ki' pǝli mbalǝn gi u. <verse eid="ACT 5:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 5:36" />Hwon u nǝ ɓew u i mulun mbǝ, kise ti Tudas, ti patl gawasi ulǝn, mbalǝn kutl cen kutl lǝbi upsi ɗǝ bǝtlti, amma i tloti, i mi' bǝtlti dla'ga, is koni. <verse eid="ACT 5:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 5:37" />Kalwasi ɗaɗanu, imulǝn mul Galili mul shin Yahuza mbǝ age' hwon ki ɓǝtl mbalǝn, illa diɓǝl mbalǝn ɗǝ bǝtlti. Tima is tloti, mil bǝtlti mus is dla'ga. <verse eid="ACT 5:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 5:38" />Tǝngaki nǝgu, ulu tǝn ki ami pi'kin shilǝn, zakǝn mbalǝn sǝ zǝga, in ulnǝ si lyap pǝlti u ko kyautǝn wasǝn ki mbalǝn u, nǝn dlatiga. <verse eid="ACT 5:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 5:39" />Amma in ki Lya kǝn u, kikǝn ma'dlǝl mbalǝn iwai. Seko ki' dǝmni mi'nge'ulnǝ Lya pǝli u.” <verse eid="ACT 5:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 5:40" />Iki is bǝlshilǝn ki Gamaliyal, is taki milshinkǝn nisi bi is te' giɓi is li'si. Is matisi bǝs saka shilǝn ge' shin ki Yesu u nuwai, is za'si is zǝga. <verse eid="ACT 5:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 5:41" />I' milshinkǝn nisi hilya is peki a kina ki mi'dlǝlshilǝn, nǝ hol tugi tǝngaki sayeni i sakǝmi sǝ' tle bǝna tǝngaki shin ki Yesu i. <verse eid="ACT 5:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="ACT 5:42" />Hu cin u kǝni, a libi ki Lya nǝ a libi nǝ libi, saza' kulci' mbalǝn shilǝn ki Lya wai, si ussu Yesu tiki Almasihu.<verse eid="ACT 5:42" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="ACT 6" />
  <para style="s">Otl mbalǝn Ninngi Mi'pǝtl Kyautǝn</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 6:1" />A ge' muttu nǝ mi'kushti ɗǝ mbǝtltǝnki u, iki Yahudawa mi' kup Helinanci is gob nalǝn tǝn Iblaniyawa tǝngaki sǝɗa bǝtl mudli ginǝ mwani mǝcisi u ulki ɗami wai, kǝnǝ ngen wai, a ge' lu bwasti ulki ɗami ki ko cin u kǝni. <verse eid="ACT 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 6:2" />Iki kutl nǝ lopi is taki mus mbalǝn mi'bǝtl Yesu kal bi, is usu, “Ambuni, tǝnza' dlǝb shilǝn ki Lya wai tǝndǝm tǝn shilǝn ki ulki ɗami katla wai. <verse eid="ACT 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 6:3" />Yelsǝni mwani nǝ mudli, olǝn mbalǝn nǝnngi a ge' kini ginǝ' manǝnsi u sǝkǝ njikǝn nǝ Yal ki batl ki Lya nǝ ma' ulǝn, ginǝ tǝn bǝlǝnsi kyautǝn u. <verse eid="ACT 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 6:4" />Mini an bǝlǝn mba dlinǝn tǝn shilǝn nǝ Lya nǝ kushti shilǝn ki Yesu.” <verse eid="ACT 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 6:5" />Ulnǝs dlǝmi u i mus tǝmi mbalǝn bi, iki is ol Istipanus, mulnǝ ki ikǝni nǝ la'ti mbatl u nǝ Yal ki mbatl ki Lya mul gunti nǝ Pilibus, nǝ Bulokolas, nǝ Nikanal, nǝ Timan, nǝ Balminas, nǝ Nikolas mulkǝ Antakiya gunǝ teɗǝ ittege' atdini ki Yahudawa u. <verse eid="ACT 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 6:6" />Gi kǝn si mbǝlsi kina ki milshinkǝn. Kal ki sa shilǝn nǝ Lya i, is zisi toh. <verse eid="ACT 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 6:7" />Shilǝn ki Lya mbǝl tǝnki ɗa, dǝɓǝtl ki mi'bǝtl Lya ge' gatl ki Ulshelima mbǝtl tinki ɗa iye, lǝɓasi mi'diɓǝlti iye is ndǝ nǝ la'ti mbadl tǝn Yesu.<verse eid="ACT 6:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Agop Istipanus si</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 6:8" />Lya bǝl Istapanus, ze'lǝɓa wasi nǝ ndǝlti, ki pǝl ulki gagashinti mul nalti nǝ lwaɗi a ge' mbalǝn. <verse eid="ACT 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 6:9" />I genge' ginǝ pe'to' ge' ginǝ mbi gawsǝn. Sǝ pe'to' ge' gatl ki Yahudawa ki Sayilin nǝ Aleszandaliya, nǝ atl ki Silisiya nǝ Asiya, is gob shotibi ne' Istipanas, <verse eid="ACT 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 6:10" />Amma ko ten sa mbǝ'ci sǝ'sho' bi ne'twai tǝngaki ta pǝl shilǝn nǝ mallǝɓa i, nǝ Yal ki mbatl ki Lya ɗǝ dlotiti. <verse eid="ACT 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 6:11" />Is hom mbalǝn ki hwundǝli, si usu, “Mǝ kumi Istipanus ɗǝ byatl' Musa ati konnǝ shinkǝ Lya.” <verse eid="ACT 6:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 6:12" />Nǝnǝgu is tlǝli mbalǝn mbadli nǝ kolsi, nǝ mi'bǝtl lashti zhil ki Musa, sine is nde' ga, is gopti, is mbǝlti a kina ɗǝ mi' dlǝtl shilǝn. <verse eid="ACT 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 6:13" />Iki is mbǝl mi' dlǝb ulnǝ bǝ sayeniwai u, is usu, “Mulu tǝɗa bwastiti nǝ dlǝp du shilǝn tǝn libi ki Lya u wai, nǝ kushti ki Musa, <verse eid="ACT 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 6:14" />tǝn gaki mǝ kum Istipanus ti ussu Yesu mulnazalat nǝn batti lu u, at shot ulnǝ Musa zaki mini u.” <verse eid="ACT 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 6:15" />I mus mbalǝn ki bidla i is uti' Istipanus dwaɗǝn, is yen kinawasi kǝnǝ ki mul shinkǝn ki Lya.<verse eid="ACT 6:15" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="ACT 7" />
  <para style="s">Shilǝn ki Istipanus akina ɗǝ mi'dlǝl shilǝn</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 7:1" />I bal lǝɓa ki Lya ngem Istipanas, “Gu nǝgu ɗaya?” <verse eid="ACT 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 7:2" />Istipanas usu: “Yelsǝni ini nǝ mi'kina, gaki nǝn kǝm. Lya mul nalti i' mbǝlgawasi ma' mul zǝmini Iblahim, age muttu nǝ ti a Bagadaza u, bǝ ta dǝm a Halan uwai, <verse eid="ACT 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 7:3" />i' Lya ultisu, ‘Hilya ɗǝ ge' atlwakǝn, nǝ ɗǝge' yelsǝniwagi, ki lǝge' atlu nǝ ta mboki toh tǝnki u.’ <verse eid="ACT 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 7:4" />Iki i' hilya ɗǝ ge' atl ki Kaldiyawa, i' dǝm a Halam. Tyaka ɗaɗanu, kal ki mǝshti ki bwasi, i Lya bǝlti atlu nǝ nǝgun kini ki dǝmi alǝbi u. <verse eid="ACT 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 7:5" />Amma Lya a bǝlti, na' atl ko ki zi' asǝn wai aki, iki i Lya pǝlli' ndǝti ge' kalwasi tǝn bǝtlti atlisi ɗǝ gwasi, ge' cinisi amma Ibilahim yakǝn ni' ɗawai. <verse eid="ACT 7:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 7:6" />I Lya shilǝn nǝ Ibilahim: ‘Gǝswasi sǝn dǝmti sǝmbǝlsi ge' gatlu nǝ bǝ gwasǝn kǝn wai u, mbalǝn kige' gatli nǝn patlsi zheli as hwotisi bǝna hal hwon kutl cetl upsi.’ <verse eid="ACT 7:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 7:7" />I Lya usu, ‘amma an hwoti atlu nǝ palkin zhelu u bezǝn lǝɓa,’ kalki nǝgu sǝn pe'ti ɗǝ ge' gatlu as nallǝn agelu u.’ <verse eid="ACT 7:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 7:8" />Ta pǝli Ibilahim ndǝti ki sǝlkǝn. Nǝ Ibilahim zǝ' Ishayaku u mutti usǝpsi nǝ zǝ'ti is sǝlti. I Ishiyaku zǝ' Yakubu, i Yakubu zǝ mi'zǝ'mini kutl nǝ lopi.<verse eid="ACT 7:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 7:9" />“Mi'zǝ'miniyi ne, tǝngaki si dutugi nǝ Yusupu, is ulti taka, i talati Masal. Amma Lya nǝ ti, <verse eid="ACT 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 7:10" />i Lya pe'kǝlti ɗǝ ge' mus bǝnawasi. I' bǝl Yusupu ma'lǝɓa nǝ hwol hwula ma pil'auna Gu ki Masal. Ti Pil'auna ne i' palti mul gunti ki Masal, i kan mus mbalǝn ki libiwasi.<verse eid="ACT 7:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 7:11" />“Iki, i kuzǝn nde mus atl ki Masal nǝ Kan'ana, tǝngaki bezǝn bǝna u, hal mi'zǝ' mi'zǝ'mini is hol ulki ɗami. <verse eid="ACT 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 7:12" />Amma nǝ Yakubu kumi alkama ɗa a Masal u, lǝ'ki nǝn i' shin mi'zǝ' mi'zǝmini. <verse eid="ACT 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 7:13" />Ɗǝ lǝtwasǝn ki lop, i Yusupu ɓulisi gawasi ma' yelsǝnwasi, i Pil'auna man mbalǝn ki Yusupu. <verse eid="ACT 7:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 7:14" />Iki i Yusupu shinshinkǝn tǝn Yakubu bwasi tǝn mbǝ, nǝ mus yelsǝniwasi, mbalǝn kutl kutl lǝbi ningi nǝ namtam. <verse eid="ACT 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 7:15" />Iki i Yakubu lǝ Masal. Ti ne' mi'zǝ' mi'zǝmini a tya ka si mǝci. <verse eid="ACT 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 7:16" />Iki is yem hwun wasǝn te'ɗi is palsi tya Shekem, i la'si ge zǝɗi u nǝ Iblahim uli nǝ upki azulpa ama' mil ki Hamol aki a Shekem.<verse eid="ACT 7:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 7:17" />“Nǝ cin ɓalli Lya nja tǝ' ikǝni Iblahim pǝtl ndǝtwasu, dǝbǝtl ki mbalǝn nisi a Masal a mbǝltǝnkiyi iye. <verse eid="ACT 7:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 7:18" />I ki i pǝl pyal guu won a Masal, gunǝ bǝ'man wokǝn ki Yusupu wai u.’ <verse eid="ACT 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 7:19" />Guu u ta tlǝ dlǝ' mbalǝnyinǝn i', ati hwoti' mi'zǝmini ishi ati la'tisi sǝ' la' hwal mil gunǝ zǝsi u taka.<verse eid="ACT 7:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 7:20" />“Age' muttisi sǝ zǝ Musa, yakǝni mbunini. Lii maki a ɗǝ ngaptiti a libi ɗǝ bwasi. <verse eid="ACT 7:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 7:21" />Nǝ zǝti a dla u, yakǝn ki Pil'auna yakǝnkǝli it kanti it kyetǝlti kǝni yakuwasi. <verse eid="ACT 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 7:22" />Iki i kulci Musa mus ma' lǝɓa ki Masalawa, ti kuma mul ndǝtl kǝni age' shilǝn nǝ kautǝnwasi.<verse eid="ACT 7:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 7:23" />“Nǝ Musa pǝl hwon kutl lǝbi upsi u, i' kǝndi a mbatlwasi tǝ le' ya mbalǝnwasi, Isla'ilawa. <verse eid="ACT 7:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 7:24" />Nǝ' eni si hwoti yelsewas ishu, iki illǝ ɗǝ dǝtlti i' li' mul masali im mǝci. <verse eid="ACT 7:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 7:25" />Musa ɗǝ ziti mbalǝnwas mani tu mati tǝ Lya pǝl kautǝn ki pekǝtlsi, amma sima niwai. <verse eid="ACT 7:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 7:26" />Lu cili nǝ Musa mbǝ ma'lu u nǝ mi' Isla'ilawa lop ɗǝ dlatu. Il lyami tǝ masi tǝn shitu ki ussu, ‘Kini mbalǝn kǝnǝmini yalaki ki lyap kumi' yelsǝni ciwo ɗa?’<verse eid="ACT 7:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 7:27" />“Amma mulnǝ kumi yelsewas ciwo u i' jakǝn Musa i' ussu, ‘Wokǝn laki ɗǝ gunti nǝ pǝtl shilǝn tǝnmi? <verse eid="ACT 7:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 7:28" />Lyamti kiɗa ki tloni kǝnǝ gunǝ tlo mulmasal a hwuɗwa?’ <verse eid="ACT 7:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 7:29" />Nǝ Musa kumi nǝgu u, i' kitǝli ippǝl dǝpki sǝmbǝl tya Madayana, ge'lu u tǝ zǝ mil mwani lop. <verse eid="ACT 7:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 7:30" />Kalki hwon kutl kutl lǝbi upsi, i mul nje shinkǝn ki Lya mbǝ ma Musa ge bǝlǝn utu, ge dǝlgǝn nja nǝ zǝnga Sinai. <verse eid="ACT 7:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 7:31" />Nǝ Musa yen gu u, i' kum gagashinti nǝ unnǝ yeni u. Nǝ' sha'tya ɗǝ yati u, i' kum yalki Lya ɗǝ usu, <verse eid="ACT 7:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 7:32" />‘Ami ki Lya ki mul zǝ' mulzǝ' ki, Lya ki Iblahim nǝ Ishayaku nǝ Yakubu.’ Iki i dli ki Musa gop nyapti, ta pǝtl ndǝtl ki mbatl ki yatiwai. <verse eid="ACT 7:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 7:33" />Iki i' Lya ultisu, ‘Tus kapptilanwagi lu u nǝ kiɗa ki dlǝli u, lu mul gu'kǝni. <verse eid="ACT 7:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 7:34" />Balini, a en bezǝn lǝɓa u nǝ si pǝli' mbalǝn i'ni ki Masal u i, a kum kuluwasǝn i ki kup dli, a pe'sul lya i tǝngaki ta pekǝlsi. Nǝguni, mbǝ ta shinki tya Masal.’<verse eid="ACT 7:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 7:35" />“Ti Musa u nǝs ngetu asi ussu, ‘Okǝn laki ɗǝ mul kina inǝn nǝ mul pǝtl shilǝn?’ Ti Lya nǝ gawaskǝn shinti suɗi tǝ dǝm mul kina, nǝ mul pekǝtl mbalǝn, tuma' mul shikǝn ki Lya u nǝ mbǝ mati age dǝlgǝn ge' bǝlǝn utu. <verse eid="ACT 7:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 7:36" />Ti pekǝlsi ɗǝ Masal, kalki pǝtl ulki gagashinti nǝ lwaɗi a ge' atl ki Masal, nǝ ɗakǝshti gǝu dlǝlka, nǝ hwon kutl kutl lǝbi upsi a ge dǝlgǝn. <verse eid="ACT 7:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 7:37" />Guki Musa u nǝ ul Isla'ilawa usu, ‘Lya nǝn tlǝli'kin mul nje' shinkǝn ki Lya ge' yelsǝniwakǝn kǝni ami.’ <verse eid="ACT 7:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 7:38" />Ti ne'kini u age dǝlgǝn, nǝ mul nje shinkǝn ki Lya u nǝ shilǝn nǝti, tǝn zǝnnga Sinai u, ne' mi'zǝ'mi'zǝ'mini ɗaɗanu. Ti kan shilǝn mul bǝtl mbatli summa Lya im mbǝlli mini.<verse eid="ACT 7:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 7:39" />“Amma mi'zǝmi'zǝmini nge bǝli'ti, is ngeti i mbatlwasǝn pal tya Masal. <verse eid="ACT 7:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 7:40" />Is ul Haluna usu, ‘Pǝlimi lya gunǝ tǝn ndemi kina u. Tǝn gaki Musa u, nǝ' pekǝlmi te' Masal u, mǝman unnǝ ndanǝtiwuwai.’ <verse eid="ACT 7:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 7:41" />Age' cinisi iki is kǝn yakǝn tla. Is mbǝli' haɗaya is pǝl hwoltuki nǝ kautǝn u nǝs pǝli nǝ tohwasǝn u. <verse eid="ACT 7:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="ACT 7:42" />Tǝngaki nǝ gu i Lya bǝlsi kal, is zasi ɗǝ bǝtl cin nǝ lyi nǝ cadlǝl. Kan u nǝɗa ki laci ge' lwat bati ki mi'njeshinkǝn ki Lya u, i' usu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 7:42">“ ‘Kini Mbalǝn ki Isla'ila ami ki mbǝllinǝn haɗaya ki tlu ki ban hwon kutl kutl lǝbǝ upsi ge' dǝlgǝnya?<verse eid="ACT 7:42" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="ACT 7:43" />Ai, du'ni nǝ kǝs ki Molek nǝ lwa' cadlǝl ki Lapan,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 7:43">lya unǝ pǝlini aki ngepti u.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 7:43">Ami ne am patlkin tya kina ɗǝ Babila.’<verse eid="ACT 7:43" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="ACT 7:44" />“Mi'zǝmi'zǝmini si nǝ libi ki Lya amasi age' dǝlgǝn. Gunǝ pǝltli kan u nǝ Lya pi Musa u, kǝnǝ kan u nǝ' eni u. <verse eid="ACT 7:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="ACT 7:45" />Kal ki nje libi ki Lya, mi'zǝmi'zǝmini mbi is mbǝ nǝnali ge' atlu ge' hwon ki Joshuwa, kalki sa kan atlisi i mbalǝn ginǝ Lya katsi tǝn duwaɗǝnwasǝn u. Libi ki Lya u ɗa i mbǝl hwon ki Dawuda, <verse eid="ACT 7:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="ACT 7:46" />gunǝ mbi holhwula ma' Lya u i' gyemi tǝ pǝlli Lya ki Yakubu libi. <verse eid="ACT 7:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="ACT 7:47" />Amma Sulemanu kǝn kǝni' libi nisi. <verse eid="ACT 7:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="ACT 7:48" />Mus nǝ nǝgu mul nalti tǝn ɗa dǝp ge' libi i nǝ yakǝn mbalǝn kǝni nǝ tohwai. Kan u nǝ mul nje shikǝn ki Lya dlǝmi u: <verse eid="ACT 7:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="ACT 7:49" />Lya usu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 7:49">“ ‘Twa lya kǝn ki lu dǝptini ki guntini, a atl kǝn ki luzǝ' asǝn ini.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 7:49">Unndi libi u kǝn ki kǝninǝni?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 7:49">Ko kuma awu kǝn ki lushutini?<verse eid="ACT 7:49" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="ACT 7:50" />Ami nǝ gayikǝn a pǝl usi wai ya?’<verse eid="ACT 7:50" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="ACT 7:51" />“Kini mbalǝn mil ndǝtl ki ga, nǝ ndǝtl ki kǝm. Kǝnǝ mi'zǝmi'zǝkini kini ɗa: ko anǝmi ki pǝli Yal ki mbatl ki Lya natl ki ga. <verse eid="ACT 7:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="ACT 7:52" />Age' mi' nje shinkǝn ki Lya gukǝn mi'zǝmi'zǝkini a hwotisi bezǝn lǝbawai? Kuma is tlo ginǝ dlǝm shilǝn atǝn mbǝ ki mul ze' mbatlu, nǝ ngeti i tloti, <verse eid="ACT 7:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="ACT 7:53" />kini kamǝn zhil ma' mi' shinkǝn ki Lya, amma ka bǝliniwai.”<verse eid="ACT 7:53" /></para>
  <para style="s">A la' Istipanus nǝ Zǝnga i</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="ACT 7:54" />Nǝ mil dlǝl shilǝn kumi nǝgu u, is kum du tuki hal is ash bi ki hwoɗi tǝn gaki kup du tugi tǝnti. <verse eid="ACT 7:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="ACT 7:55" />Amma Istipanus, ki ikǝni nǝ Yal ki mbatl ki Lya ki gunti, i ut duwa ɗǝn twa lya, i' en natl ki Lya, a Yesu ki dlǝli tǝn toh shipti ki Lya. <verse eid="ACT 7:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="ACT 7:56" />I' usu, “Yanini, a en lya ki ɓuliyi yakǝn mbalǝn ki dlǝli atǝn tohship ki Lya.” <verse eid="ACT 7:56" /><verse number="57" style="v" sid="ACT 7:57" />Amma is ca kǝmwasǝn, is tlǝl yali, is nde ga nǝ mbatl nǝm, <verse eid="ACT 7:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="ACT 7:58" />is pekǝlti tya kal gatli is gop lalati nǝ zǝnga. Kuma, mil enti nǝ dwaɗǝn is zi lulutuwasǝn ma yakǝn giɗǝn siwon shinwasi Shawulu. <verse eid="ACT 7:58" /><verse number="59" style="v" sid="ACT 7:59" />Asi lalatiti nǝ zǝnga, a Istipanus ɗǝ shilǝn nǝ Lya, “Mulban Yesu, kan mbadlini.” <verse eid="ACT 7:59" /><verse number="60" style="v" sid="ACT 7:60" />Iki i' ngus nǝ ga hwulǝn i' tlil Yal nǝ dǝlti, i' usu, “Mul ban, bǝ zisi bezǝn lǝɓa u agawasǝnwai.” Nǝ usu nǝgu u, i' nde yenmbuɗi.<verse eid="ACT 7:60" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="ACT 8" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 8:1" />Shawulu ɗǝ bǝtlkal ki tlo' istipanus.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 8:1">Agasisi, i bal bǝna mbi Ikilisiya ki Ulshelima mus is dla'ga tyage' atl ki Yahudiya nǝ Samaliya, sai milshikǝn kǝn katl. <verse eid="ACT 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 8:2" />I mi'bǝtl Lya kalen gu Istipanus is kuli gawasi. <verse eid="ACT 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 8:3" />Amma i Shawulu go' pǝli' Ikilisiya bezǝn pǝlti. A ti bǝtl libi libi, ti dǝdl mwani nǝ mudli a ti la'tisi ge'lu kǝndǝ' mbalǝn.<verse eid="ACT 8:3" /></para>
  <para style="s">A dlǝm shilǝn ki Lya a Samaliya i</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 8:4" />Ginǝs dlakisi gayi is go' dlib shilǝn ki Lya mus lu unǝs lǝɗa u. <verse eid="ACT 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 8:5" />I Pilibus su ge' gatl ki Samaliya ti dlǝb shilǝn ki Almasihu. <verse eid="ACT 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 8:6" />Nǝ hwu' mbalǝn kumi is yen gagashintu nǝ Pilibus ɗǝ pǝlti u, i mus sǝpǝ ɗemɗem nǝ ulnǝ' dlǝmi u <verse eid="ACT 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 8:7" />Nǝ la'ti Yal i du mi'gatli pe' ɗǝge' mbalǝn diɓǝli, mi'tle ki dli ne' dakkǝlsi diɓǝli is mbi ndo'ti <verse eid="ACT 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 8:8" />I hwoltu' pǝldli bali a ge' gatli.<verse eid="ACT 8:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Saminu mul Yal lu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 8:9" />Mulǝnɗa mulshin Saminu, teɗi ti pǝtl gonti age' gatli, hal ɗǝ bǝtl mus mbalǝn ki Samaliyawa gagashinti. Ti ɗagagga ti usu ti bal mbalǝn kǝni, <verse eid="ACT 8:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 8:10" />Mus mbalǝn, bazi ni mil, is gakki' kǝm asi usu, “Mulu ɗǝ mbettiki dǝtl ki Lya mul nalti.” <verse eid="ACT 8:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 8:11" />Si bǝlti kal tǝngaki ta lǝndǝp ɗǝ pǝlisi gagashiti nǝ pǝltl gontwasu i. <verse eid="ACT 8:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 8:12" />Amma nǝs la'mbatl nǝ dlǝb shilǝn ki gu' ki Lya nǝ shin ki Yesu ki Pilibus, i pǝlisi baptisma mudli nǝ mwani. <verse eid="ACT 8:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 8:13" />Saminu gawasi illa' badli i pǝli' baptisma. Iki ibbǝl Pilibus kali, i' kup ɓanti nǝ ye' bal ulki gagashintu. <verse eid="ACT 8:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 8:14" />Nǝ milshikǝn ki Ulshelima kumi mi' Samaliya a ndǝ'nǝ shilǝn ki Lya u, is shin Bitlus nǝ Yahaya tya Samaliya. <verse eid="ACT 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 8:15" />Nǝs mbǝkǝci u, is shilǝn nǝ Lya gaki mi'pyal bǝtl Yesu kal gaki sǝmmbi Yal ki mbatl ki Lya ɗa, <verse eid="ACT 8:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 8:16" />Gaki Yal ki mbatl ki Lya a mbi gon wasǝn uwai; a pǝlisi baptisma i katl ge'shinki Yesu. <verse eid="ACT 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 8:17" />I Bitlus nǝ Yahaya zǝsi toh, is mbi Yal ki mbatl ki Lya. <verse eid="ACT 8:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 8:18" />Nǝ Saminu eni zǝttoh ki milshinkǝn ɗǝ bǝtl Yal ki mbatl ki Lya u, ibbǝlsi ulpi. <verse eid="ACT 8:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 8:19" />I' usu, “Amima bǝlǝnnǝn manti u gaki mus mulnǝ a zǝttoh u ammbi Yal mbatl ki Lya ɗa.” <verse eid="ACT 8:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 8:20" />I Bitlus ndǝgi i' usu: “Mǝshnǝ ulpwagi, gaki ki enti kǝn ma'ultl bǝlti ki Lya nǝ ulpa! <verse eid="ACT 8:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 8:21" />Ulǝn a lakki nǝ uluwai, gaki mbadlwa'ɗa nǝm akina ɗǝ Lya wai. <verse eid="ACT 8:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 8:22" />Gaki nǝgu za'pǝtl bezǝn lǝɓa a' ngem Lya ɗǝgon a' okǝlki ɗǝ ge' ulnǝ' ngapi ge' mbadlwa gu. <verse eid="ACT 8:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 8:23" />Gaki a eni i ka njikǝn nǝ ɗashti nǝ ngapti bezǝn lǝɓa i.” <verse eid="ACT 8:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 8:24" />I Saminu ndǝgi, “Ngemǝn Lya gayini gaki ulnǝ' dlimini u ɓa ndanǝ ami.” <verse eid="ACT 8:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 8:25" />Kalkǝ dlib shilǝn ki Lya wasǝn nǝ ndǝ'twasǝn nǝ Yesu, Bitlus nǝ Yahaya is paltya Ulshelima, si dlib shilǝn ki Lya ge' mil gatl ki Samaliya dǝɓili.<verse eid="ACT 8:25" /></para>
  <para style="s">Pilibus isǝ mul Habasha</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 8:26" />I mul shinkǝn ki Lya ul Pilibus su, “Lǝ tu'tǝn tona ki shitu dǝlgǝn gunǝ pe'te' Ulshelima ɗǝlǝ Gaza u.” <verse eid="ACT 8:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 8:27" />I' hilya ippeki, tǝn shitu wasi imma isǝ mul Habasha Ndami bal mbalǝn mul nalti, gu' ni'ɗa ge' gu' ki Kandakatu, tikǝ mul zi' lǝɓa (Kǝ “Salauniya ki Habasha”). Muli mbǝ Ulshelima ɗǝ ngep Lya, <verse eid="ACT 8:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 8:28" />Ti patl tya libi tiki dǝmi ge' Bǝsdomwasi, ti dlib lashti kǝge' lwabbat ki Ishaya. <verse eid="ACT 8:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 8:29" />I Yal ki mbatl ki Lya ul Pilibus su, “Sha'tya ma' Bǝsdomu.” <verse eid="ACT 8:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 8:30" />I Pilibus kitǝl tyage' Bǝsdomi, i' kum muli ɗǝ dlib lashti kǝge' lwabbat ki Ishaya. “Kimanǝn ulnǝ ki dlimti ge' lashti uwa?” Pilibus usu. <verse eid="ACT 8:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 8:31" />“A mani una,” i' usu, “Ai se nǝ mulǝn adlimini.” Immbe Pilibus bi sǝddǝm siti. <verse eid="ACT 8:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 8:32" />Gukǝ shilǝn ki Lya unǝ ti dlimti u: “A dǝlti kǝnǝ mbila ge' lu poshtiti, kǝnǝ kan unǝ bǝgǝmdla ɗa atoh ɗǝ mul swattiti u, nǝgu ta ɓulbiwai. <verse eid="ACT 8:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 8:33" />A ge' shidǝtlgawasi is nge bǝtlti baliwasi. Wokǝn matl dlib gǝs ki mbalǝnwasi? Akan dliwas taka ɗǝtǝn dǝb lǝɓa i.” <verse eid="ACT 8:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 8:34" />I bali i ngem Pilibus, “Dlimini, mul nje'shinkǝn ki Lya u, shilǝn ki o ti dlimti, gwasa ko ki mulǝn?” <verse eid="ACT 8:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 8:35" />I pilibus gob dlib shilǝn ki Lya itl dlimi' shilǝn ki Yesu. <verse eid="ACT 8:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 8:36" />Si ge' lǝti is mbǝkǝci ma' bal malon i bali i usu, “Ya mal kǝn ngu. Ya la'tiɗa bǝ kǝkkǝn pǝlitǝn baptisma wai?” <verse eid="ACT 8:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 8:37" />I pilibus usu, inka la'mbatlu, nǝ mbatl nǝm mu, nǝn pǝliki batisma.” I bali i ndǝgiti i' usu, “A ndǝgi Yesu yakǝn ki Lya kǝni.” <verse eid="ACT 8:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 8:38" />Ibbǝl zhil tǝ dlil bǝsdomi. Ndǝn wasǝn Pilibus isǝ Bali i is suge' mali i Pilibus pǝli' baptima. <verse eid="ACT 8:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 8:39" />Nǝs pe'todɗǝ ge' mali u, i Yal ki mbatl ki Lya kan Pilibus, Bali i a yenti nuwai. Izzǝga ati pǝtl hwoltugi. <verse eid="ACT 8:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 8:40" />Ngonǝnǝ gu i Pilibus lǝ' mbi gawasi a Azontus. Ibbǝl gatl tyai, a ti dlib shilǝn ki Lya mus ge' gatli hal immbǝcci Kaisaliya ɗa.<verse eid="ACT 8:40" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="ACT 9" />
  <para style="s">Palki shawulu ma' Lya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 9:1" />Shawulu ɗǝ ngalcik mi'bǝlt Lya kali, ti usu tǝn ti tlosi, i' lǝ ma' bali ki bas lǝɓasi, <verse eid="ACT 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 9:2" />i' gyebti ndǝgini ki laci lwabati ki gǝlu dopga ki yahudawa ki Dimaskus, gaki nǝgu in a mbi mil bǝlt shitu u mwani nǝ mudli, a mbǝlsi ge' galt ki Ulshelima a kǝndǝsi. <verse eid="ACT 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 9:3" />Ti lǝk kǝn ngu, nǝ' ɓal nja ma' Dimasku u, bǝnǝ man tiwasau swai chilton kǝn ngu sul lya ki ga ndǝli nǝti. <verse eid="ACT 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 9:4" />I' nda atli i' kum yalon ɗǝ usu “Shawulu, Shawulu ya lakiɗa ki ngalci tǝnɗa?” <verse eid="ACT 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 9:5" />Ti kuma i' usu, “Kiwokǝni Mulnalti?” I usu, “Amiki Yesu u nǝ ki ngalcitǝ u. <verse eid="ACT 9:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 9:6" />Amma hilya kǝlǝ ge' gatli, tya ka sǝ dlǝmi' ulnǝ ki pǝli u.” <verse eid="ACT 9:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 9:7" />Ellǝnsi u nǝ si lǝ ne'tu is hol ulki dlǝmi, si kup yali sayen mullan wai. <verse eid="ACT 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 9:8" />I Shawulu hilya, nǝ bul dwaɗǝn u taman yeluwai. Is nde' kina is sulti Dimasku. <verse eid="ACT 9:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 9:9" />Muttu maki bǝti ɗa yelluwai, bǝtiɗa ɗamtiwai bǝtiɗa tletiwai. <verse eid="ACT 9:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 9:10" />Mulan ɗa mul bǝlti a Dimasku shinwasi Hananiya. I Mulban shilniti age' dluti i' usu “Hananiya.” I' ndǝgi amingu Mulban.” <verse eid="ACT 9:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 9:11" />I mulban ultisu, “Hilya ki bǝl shitu u nǝ ɗǝ mbeti kitaki, a gyemi a libi ɗǝ Yahuza ko mul Talsus nǝn ki, mul shin Shawulu, ti ngu ɗǝ shilǝn nǝ Lya. <verse eid="ACT 9:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 9:12" />A ge' tlu'ti i' en mullǝn mul shin Hananiya i' zi' toh ga gaki tǝ' yelluɗa.” <verse eid="ACT 9:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 9:13" />Ngonǝnǝgu i Hananiya ndǝgi i'usu, “Mulban, a lǝm mutti ɗǝ kub shilǝn ki muluyi ma' mbalǝn di mbǝli, ti pǝli' mi'bǝtl Lya besǝn lǝɓa a Ulshelima. <verse eid="ACT 9:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 9:14" />In ngu bas lǝɓasi sa bǝlti ndǝti tǝ' gob mus mi' mbe shinwagi.” <verse eid="ACT 9:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 9:15" />Ngonǝnagu mulban i' ul Hananiya su, lǝma' mulna oltu tǝ'dlǝm shin ini ma' ginǝ bǝ Yahudawa wai u nǝ gumsi nǝ mbalǝn ki Isla'ila. <verse eid="ACT 9:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 9:16" />Ami nǝ ga ini an mbokiti toh tǝn mbǝna u nǝtǝ' tle u gaki shin ini.” <verse eid="ACT 9:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 9:17" />Iki Hananiya lǝ i' tege' libini i'zi shawulu toh ga, “Yelse ini Shawulu, mulban kǝn shinǝni, Yesu unǝ peki tǝn shitu u nǝ bǝli u, ti shinǝni gawagi ki yellu ɗa ɗaɗanu, a' nji kǝn nǝ Yal ki mbatl ki Lya ki gunti.” <verse eid="ACT 9:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 9:18" />Alǝbi alǝbi i ulǝn pekki Shawulu ɗǝ dwaɗǝn kǝnǝ kal pǝti, i'go' yellu ɗaɗanu. Iki i' hilya i pǝli' baptisma, <verse eid="ACT 9:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 9:19" />kal ki nǝ' ɗami u, i ndǝltwas pallǝbi.</para>
  <para style="s" vid="ACT 9:19">Shawulu a Damasku nǝ Ulshelima</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 9:19">Shawulu lǝm mutti a Damasku ne' mi'bǝdl Yesu kal. <verse eid="ACT 9:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 9:20" />Alǝbi alǝbi i' gop dlǝb shilǝn ki Lya age' lu dobga ki Yahudawa, tǝn Yesu yakǝn ki Lya kǝni. <verse eid="ACT 9:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 9:21" />Mus mi' ginǝ kumti is kum gagashinti is ngemi, “Tikǝ mul nǝ dlaki mi' shilǝn nǝ Lya ga nǝ shin u, a Ulshelima u waiwa? Tǝ mbǝnki gaki tǝ' tǝlasi akina ɗǝ bal lǝɓa ki kǝndi.” <verse eid="ACT 9:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 9:22" />I Shawulu mbǝl ndǝtl tǝnki, ti hwotti mbatl ki Yahudawa yi nǝ ɗǝ dǝb a Damasku, ti ussu Yesu tikǝ Almasihu. <verse eid="ACT 9:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 9:23" />Kal ki lǝb mutti i Yahudawa kǝndǝ bi tǝn sǝ' tloti. <verse eid="ACT 9:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 9:24" />Amma i Shawulu kum ulnǝs kǝndǝ u. Gasi nǝ dloncin asi ɓutti dlabi gatli gaki sǝ' tloti ɗa. <verse eid="ACT 9:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 9:25" />Amma a gasi i mil kushtiwas kanti is shimti ge' dǝsi is shimti swage' dlabiwon tǝn dli gatl bi.<verse eid="ACT 9:25" /></para>
  <para style="s">Shawulu a Ulshelima</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 9:26" />Nǝm mbǝ Ulshelima u i' hilya ɗǝ te'ge' mi' bǝtl Yesu kal, amma mus is kum ɓantwasi gaki sa la'mbatl nǝ ti mul bǝtl Yesu kal kǝn wai. <verse eid="ACT 9:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 9:27" />I Balnaba kanti it tǝlati ma' mi'shinkǝn. Ippisi kan unǝ Shawulu yen Lya tǝn shitu u, i Lya shilǝn nǝti, nǝ kan unǝ' dlǝm shilǝn ki Lya ge' shin ki Yesu bǝni ɓatwai a Damasku u. <verse eid="ACT 9:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 9:28" />I Shawulu dǝm ne'si ati du' ne'si a Ulshelima, a ti dlǝb shilǝn ki Lya nǝ mbatl nǝm age' shin ki Yesu. <verse eid="ACT 9:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 9:29" />Ti shilǝn ne' Yahudawa mil kup bi ki Helinawa, ti shotti bi ne'si, amma is gob ngau shitu ki tlotti. <verse eid="ACT 9:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 9:30" />Nǝ mi' bǝtl Yesu kal mani nǝgu u, is mbǝlti a Kaisaliya is shinti tya Talsus. <verse eid="ACT 9:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 9:31" />Iki i mus dobga ki mi' bǝtl Yesu kal ki atl ki Yahudiya, nǝkǝ Galili nǝkǝ Samaliya i mbi dǝb ki zoki, si pǝtl lǝɓawasǝn nǝ ɓanti Lya, a yal kǝ mbatl ki Lya ɗǝ ɗǝtlsi, is mbǝl tǝnki ɗa.<verse eid="ACT 9:31" /></para>
  <para style="s">I dokǝl Iniyasu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 9:32" />To nǝ Bitlus gandǝl atli mussu, illǝ ɗǝ shini' mbalǝn ki Lya mi'dǝb a Lidda. <verse eid="ACT 9:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 9:33" />Alǝbi tǝ mbi mulǝn mul shin Iniyasu, tinǝ tle' ki dli hwon usǝpsi tǝn lumutti. <verse eid="ACT 9:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 9:34" />I Bitlus ultisu “Iniyasu, Yesu Almasihu a ndokǝlki. Hilya ki gadǝl lumut twagi.” Alǝbi it hilya. <verse eid="ACT 9:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 9:35" />I mus mbalǝn ki Lidda nǝ ki atl ki Salona nǝs yentu, is pal temma Lya.<verse eid="ACT 9:35" /></para>
  <para style="s">Bitlus tlil Tabita lya ge' mi'mǝshti</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 9:36" />A Yapa mul bǝtl Yesu kalon ɗa mul shin Tabita gunǝ ɗǝ mbetti kǝ Dokas ɗaɗanu, ti pǝtl ulkǝ zoki ati ɗǝtl mi'gini bǝ ulǝn nisi ɗawai u. <verse eid="ACT 9:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 9:37" />I' goni immǝci, nǝs uti' malu, is zǝti twage' kǝps ki lya. <verse eid="ACT 9:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 9:38" />Lidda nja nǝ Yapa ɗa; Nǝ mi' bǝtl Yesu kal ki Lidda kumi Bitlus a Lidda u, is shin mbalǝn lop tya ma'ti, sǝ' ngemti, tǝtl dlewti tem ma'si. <verse eid="ACT 9:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 9:39" />I Bitlus zǝga ne'si, nǝm mbǝkǝci u is tolti twage' kǝps ki lya ni. Mudli i nǝ mwani wasǝn mǝci is dlil nja nǝti, asi kulu, asi mbo'ti toh tǝn lu'lǝgǝl gini Dokas pǝlisi teɗi nǝsi ne'tu. <verse eid="ACT 9:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 9:40" />Amma i Bitlus pyakǝlsi mus swadla, in ngus atli in ngem Lya. It juyati temma hwunisi, i' usu, “Tabita, hilya.” Ibɓul dwaɗǝn, i' en Bitlus, ih hilya iddǝm nǝ gǝsi. <verse eid="ACT 9:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 9:41" />It takit toh itl tlǝlti lya. Im mbe mi' ki Lya bi ne' mudli gini mwani wasǝn mǝcu ibbǝlsiti kami. <verse eid="ACT 9:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="ACT 9:42" />I gu mandli mus a Yapa, i mbalǝn diɓǝli la'mbatl nǝ Lya. <verse eid="ACT 9:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="ACT 9:43" />Illǝm mutti diɓǝli a Yapa a libi ɗǝ mul pǝtl bati mul shin Saminu.<verse eid="ACT 9:43" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="ACT 10" />
  <para style="s">Kaliniyas mbe Bitlus bi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 10:1" />A Kaisaliya i pǝl mulǝn mul shin Kaliniyas, mul kumti nǝ gawasi age' mi' dobga ki sojoji gunǝ ɗǝ mbetti ki dobga ki Ataliya. <verse eid="ACT 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 10:2" />Ti mulbǝlt Lya kǝni nǝ ɓulti Lya nǝ mbalǝn ki libiwasi ti bǝlt mbalǝn ulkǝ toh wasi nǝ mbalt nǝm, ati shilǝn ngwash ngwash nǝ Lya. <verse eid="ACT 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 10:3" />Gason dom maki ki su'ti, i' en mul shinkǝn ki Lya age' tluti, immbǝ i' ultisu, ki “Kaliniyas!” <verse eid="ACT 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 10:4" />Kaliniyas utti dwaɗǝn nǝ ɓanti, i' usu mulban yakǝni? I mul shinkǝn ki Lya ultisu, shilǝn nǝ Lya nǝ bǝlti wagi a mbǝ kina ɗǝ Lya i. <verse eid="ACT 10:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 10:5" />Nǝ gun u pǝl shinkǝn swa Yapa sǝ' taki Saminu bi gunǝ si mbetti ki Bitlus su. <verse eid="ACT 10:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 10:6" />Ishiti ma' Saminu mul motti bati guna libi was nja ma' bal malu.” <verse eid="ACT 10:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 10:7" />Nǝ mul shinkǝn ki Lya nǝ shin nitu zǝga u, i Kaniliyas taki zheli was lob bi, nǝ mul kǝndǝtl dlomon mul bǝtl shilǝn ki Lya ge' ginǝ ɗǝ pǝlliti kyautǝn hu gasi u kǝni. <verse eid="ACT 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 10:8" />Nǝdl dlimisi mus ulnǝ nda u is shinsi tya Yapa. <verse eid="ACT 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 10:9" />Lucili a dloncin ɓal nja i, sǝ ɓal nja nǝ gatlu ngu, i Bitlus toge' kǝpsi ki lya ɗǝ shilǝn nǝ Lya. <verse eid="ACT 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 10:10" />Kuzǝn a gobti, ti lyap ɗamti, amma ɗǝ pǝtl ulki ɗami i, i tluti mbiti. <verse eid="ACT 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 10:11" />I'en lya a ɓuli, ulǝn ɗǝ sussuɗi kǝnǝ bal ul idlam mbalǝn, ɗǝ shitti su' atli ge' zheltwas upsi. <verse eid="ACT 10:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 10:12" />A giɓi mus lǝɓa ki dǝlgǝn nǝki ban, nǝmi' dǝtl tugi, nǝ gala'sa nǝ yadli. <verse eid="ACT 10:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 10:13" />I yalon ultisu, “Bitlus hilya, ki' poci a' ɗami.” <verse eid="ACT 10:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 10:14" />Amma i Bitlus usu o o, a ɗam bezǝn ulǝn gason wai ko ulnǝ bǝ mbunwai u. <verse eid="ACT 10:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 10:15" />I' kum yali ɗaɗanu, ki lop, usu, “Ulnǝ Lya a li'ni' u, bǝ palli besniwai.” <verse eid="ACT 10:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 10:16" />I gu pǝ asǝn maki, alǝbǝ alǝbǝ i dǝl ulisi twalya. <verse eid="ACT 10:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 10:17" />Uli ɗǝ hwotti Bitlus kǝn ngu tǝn tlutu nǝs pǝlitu, iki i mbalǝn i nǝ Kaliniyas shinsi teɗu, tǝn dlabi, sa lǝge sa ngem libi ki Saminu i. <verse eid="ACT 10:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 10:18" />Is tabi is ngemi Saminu gunǝ ɗǝ mbetti ki Bitlus nǝn ɗawa. <verse eid="ACT 10:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 10:19" />Tun a Bitlus ɗǝ dambǝtlti tǝn tlutu, i Yal ki mbatl ki Lya ultisu, “I ngu mbalǝn maki ɗǝ ngauki. <verse eid="ACT 10:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 10:20" />Hilya ki' pe'swai, ki bǝlsi kali. Bǝkum ɓantwai, gaki ami shinsi teɗi. <verse eid="ACT 10:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 10:21" />I Bitlus pe'swa ma' mbalǝni, i' ulsisu, “Ami ki ngautǝma. Ya mbǝlkini?” <verse eid="ACT 10:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 10:22" />Mbalǝni usu, “Mǝ mbǝni te'ma' ndǝl mulǝn mul kina ki mil kǝndǝ dlom gǝni ɗǝ mbetti ki Kaliniyas, mul zo' mbadli, mul ɓanti Lya, gunǝ mus mbalǝn ki Yahudawa ɗǝ ndwa'titi, mul shinkǝn ki Lya mul gunti ultisu, ti ta shinkǝn, ki lǝ libi ɗakka, tǝ' kum ulnǝ ki' dlimi u.” <verse eid="ACT 10:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 10:23" />I Bitlus mbǝlsi a libini. Nǝ lucilu i' hilya is zǝga ne'si is dǝm sǝmbǝlswasi, ge' mi' bǝtl Yesu kal ki Yapa is la'ti shitu. <verse eid="ACT 10:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 10:24" />Lucili im mbǝkǝci a Kaisaliya. Kaliniyas ɗǝ la'ti mbatl ki mbǝ twasǝn, im mbe yelsǝni bi nǝ yelǝnsi wasi. <verse eid="ACT 10:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 10:25" />Bitlus ɗǝ te' libi ni ngu, i Kaliniyas njeti in nda kina ɗa'ka, in nalti. <verse eid="ACT 10:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 10:26" />Amma i Bitlus tlǝlti lya, i' usu, “Hilya, amima yakǝn mbalǝn kǝni.” <verse eid="ACT 10:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 10:27" />Nǝ Bitlus ɗǝ shilǝn situ, it te' giɓi in mbi mbalǝn diɓǝli a domga i. <verse eid="ACT 10:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 10:28" />I' ulsisu, “Kini nǝ gawakǝn ki manini, a mbunwai tǝ mul Yahudiya maga ko sǝl le' shinni mulnǝ bǝ biwas kǝn wai u. Amma Lya a mboki toh ba ul mulǝnsu mul bezǝn mbadlwai, ko mul ulkǝ ci'zhentwai. <verse eid="ACT 10:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 10:29" />Gaki nǝgu, nǝs ta shinkǝn ta mbǝ u, a ngewai. To nǝgun ami lyamti ta kumi ya laki i' takinǝn biɗa.” <verse eid="ACT 10:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 10:30" />I Kaliniyas usu, “Asǝti mutti maki ngu, lu nǝguni, ami shilǝn nǝ Lya ki dom maki ki su'ti a libi ɗa ka, bǝnǝ mantiwai sai mulǝn kǝn ngu ki dlili nǝ hwol lulǝgǝl akina ɗa ka. <verse eid="ACT 10:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 10:31" />I muli usu, Kaliniyas, Lya akum shilǝn nǝtiwagi, bǝlti wagi a dǝm ulki dambǝlti akina ɗǝ Lya. <verse eid="ACT 10:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 10:32" />Gaki nǝgu a' shin shinkǝ tya Yapa ti taki Saminu bi, gunǝ ɗǝ mbetti ki Bitlus su, am mbǝ a libi ɗǝ Saminu mul pǝtl bati abi bal mal.’ <verse eid="ACT 10:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 10:33" />Alǝbi alǝbi ya taki' shinkǝn, a mbuni ni' mbǝ u, to nǝguni i ngu mus ma mbǝ a kina ɗǝ Lya i, gaki tǝn kum undi zhili u nǝ Lya piku.” <verse eid="ACT 10:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 10:34" />I Bitlus pisi i' usu “Nǝgun amani balini Lya ɗa nge mbalǝnwai. <verse eid="ACT 10:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 10:35" />Amma mus mbalǝn milɓantiti nǝ mul pǝl ulki zoki ulkǝ kamini amatti. <verse eid="ACT 10:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 10:36" />Lya ta shinkǝn tu'ma' mbalǝn ki Isilaila, asi pitsi shilǝn multǝmti ki holtugi tu'ma' Yesu Almasihu, tikǝ Lya kǝ kowagi. <verse eid="ACT 10:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 10:37" />Kǝmanǝn shilǝn u nǝ dla'ga age' alt ki Yahudiya, tun te' Galili kal ki pǝli' mbalǝn batisma ki Yahaya atipi' mbalǝn shilǝn ki Lya <verse eid="ACT 10:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 10:38" />mǝkum shilǝn ki Yesu Banazalat gunǝ Lya swati nǝ Yal ki mbalt ki Lya kǝ zoki mul ndǝltti, i' gobduti ati pǝtl ulkǝ zoki, ati ndokǝl mus ginǝ sheɗan ɗǝ bǝlsi kalu gaki Lya matti. <verse eid="ACT 10:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 10:39" />Mine mi'enti nǝ dwaɗǝkǝni ki Yesu nǝ mus ulnǝ pǝli age' alt ki Yahudiya nǝ Ulshelima u. Iki is tlotti atǝn gadlǝtga, <verse eid="ACT 10:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 10:40" />Amma i Lya tlǝti age' mutti maki i' mbǝlgawas ge' mbalǝn. <verse eid="ACT 10:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 10:41" />Ma' mbalǝn mus kǝn tǝ mbǝlgawa swai, se mami' enti nǝ dwaɗǝnwasi ginǝ Lya oli tun te'ɗi wato mini u nǝn ɗamini i' tle ne' tu kal ki hilyawas ge' mi'mǝshti. <verse eid="ACT 10:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="ACT 10:42" />Ippimini tǝn dlǝmi mbalǝn shilǝn ki Lya, mini ne mi'enti nǝ dwaɗǝnwaskǝni tǝn ti Lya latti mul pǝli' mbalǝn mi'dli nǝ mi'mǝshti shilǝn. <verse eid="ACT 10:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="ACT 10:43" />Mus milnjeshinkǝn is pǝl enti nǝ dwaɗǝn ɗǝ ussu tu' ma shin wasi mus mulnǝ alambatl tu' ma'tu tǝn mbi' pekǝlti.” <verse eid="ACT 10:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="ACT 10:44" />Bitlus age' shilǝn kǝngu, i Yal ki mbatl ki Lya i nde mus mi' kubti suɗi. <verse eid="ACT 10:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="ACT 10:45" />I Yahudawa mi' ndǝti nǝ sǝlkǝn is mbǝ ne' Bitlus su is kub gagashiti hal ginǝ bǝ Yahudawa wai u is mbi bǝlti ki Yal ki mbatl ki Lya ki gunti. <verse eid="ACT 10:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="ACT 10:46" />Ama is kubmi si shilǝn nǝ bi diɓǝli asi natl Lya. I Bitlus usu, <verse eid="ACT 10:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="ACT 10:47" />“Mul ma' hana pǝlit mbalǝn i baptisma nǝ mal nǝn ɗaya? Sima sa mbi Yal ki mbalt ki Lya i kan u nǝn mbini u.” <verse eid="ACT 10:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="ACT 10:48" />I Bitlus bǝlsi zhil sǝpǝlisi Baptisma age' shin ki Yesu Almasihu is ngemti tǝdǝm kǝ mutti lob ne' si.<verse eid="ACT 10:48" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="ACT 11" />
  <para style="s">Bitlus a dlǝmi Mi' bǝtl Yesu kal ki Ulshelima shilin i</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 11:1" />Mi'shinkǝn ne' yelsǝni gini ge' atl ki Yahudiya nǝs kumi, mi' ginǝ bǝ Yahudawai u sa ndǝ' nǝ shilǝn ki Lya i. <verse eid="ACT 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 11:2" />Nǝ Bitlus mbǝ Ulshelima u, ginǝs ndǝ' nǝ sǝlkǝn u is shimi' shilǝn, <verse eid="ACT 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 11:3" />is usu, “I ngu ka te libi ɗǝ min ginǝ bǝ sa sǝlsiwai u i, i' ɗami ne'si.” <verse eid="ACT 11:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 11:4" />I Bitlus gop dlǝmissi mus shilǝn nisi, <verse eid="ACT 11:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 11:5" />“Ami, a ge' gatl ki Yapa ami shilǝn nǝ Lya, i tlu'ti mbi ni, yayen ulǝn sul lya ɗǝ sussuɗi kǝnǝ bal ul idla mbalǝn, tuge' malgǝn upsi, i mbǝ ma'kǝni. <verse eid="ACT 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 11:6" />Na wutti' dwaɗǝn u, yayen tlu ki dǝlgǝn nǝ ki ban mi' asǝn upsi ki ge dǝp lǝɓa, ne' mi'dǝl tugi, ne' yadlǝ a giɓi. <verse eid="ACT 11:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 11:7" />Ya kum yalon ah ulǝnsu i', ‘Bitlus. Hilya, ki' poci, aɗami.’ <verse eid="ACT 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 11:8" />Ya' usu, a nge i, mulban, gaki bezǝn lǝɓawon a tee bi gasonwai.’ <verse eid="ACT 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 11:9" />I Yal shilǝn sullya ki lop, i' usu, ‘Ulnǝ Lya a li'ni' u, bǝ mbe besniwai.’ <verse eid="ACT 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 11:10" />I pǝlgu asǝn maki, iki i dǝl uli twalya ɗaɗanu. <verse eid="ACT 11:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 11:11" />Bǝnǝ mantiwai he mbalǝn maki ngi ki dlǝli abidlabi u nǝ amiɗa u, sǝ shinǝnsi ma'kǝni te' Kaisaliya. <verse eid="ACT 11:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 11:12" />I Yal ki mbatl ki Lya ulǝnsu ta zǝga ne'si, bǝnǝ cetl mbadlwai. Yelsǝni gi mǝkka i is zǝga ne' kǝni, illǝ libi ɗǝ muli. <verse eid="ACT 11:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 11:13" />Itl dlǝmimi kan unǝ en mul shinkǝn ki Lya mbǝl gawasi a libi ɗakka u, ti ussu, ‘Pǝshinkǝn swa Yapa sǝttaki Saminu bi, gunǝ simbetti ki Bitlus, <verse eid="ACT 11:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 11:14" />Tǝh dlǝmikkin shilǝn u, nǝ ki nǝ mus libi wagi ki mbi pekǝtl ɗa.’ <verse eid="ACT 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 11:15" />“Nǝ gopti shilǝn ini, i Yal ki mbatl ki Lya ndesi suɗi, kan unǝ ndemi suɗi te' kalu. <verse eid="ACT 11:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 11:16" />Ya dambǝl shilǝn ki mulban, kan u' nǝ' usu, ‘Yahaya ɓo, nǝ mal kǝn ti pǝli' mbalǝn batisma, kini ɓo nǝ Yal ki mbatl ki Lya kǝn sǝppǝlikini.’ <verse eid="ACT 11:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 11:17" />Kan u nǝ Lya bǝlsi manti u ndace nǝ gunǝ bǝlǝnmini u, nǝ la'ti mbatl nǝ mulban Yesu Almasihu u, ami ki wongi ta dlǝli nǝ Lya!” <verse eid="ACT 11:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 11:18" />Nǝs kumi nǝgu u, is hol ulnǝ sǝdlǝmi u, is nal Lya is usu, “Ai, ginǝ' bǝ Yahudawa wai u Lya a bǝlsi pe'ti ɗǝ ge' bezǝn lǝɓa nǝ mbim mbatldli.”<verse eid="ACT 11:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Milbǝtl Lya a Antakiya ki Suliya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 11:19" />Ginǝ dla' ga tǝn gaki bǝna u nǝ nda gunǝ mbǝl tlo Istipanǝs su, is lǝ tyage' atl ki pinikiya, nǝ calgatl ki Kubulus, nǝ gatl ki Antakiya, sǝɗa dlǝmi' mulǝn shilǝn ki Lya wai Yahudawa katl. <verse eid="ACT 11:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 11:20" />Genwasǝn, mbalǝn ki Kubulus ne' ki Kulane, is lǝ Antikiya is go' dlǝmi' mi' ginǝ bǝ Yahudawa wai u, zo' shilǝn tǝn Yesu. <verse eid="ACT 11:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 11:21" />Toh ki Lya tǝnsi, i mbalǝn dǝɓǝli la'mbadli is pal temma' mulban. <verse eid="ACT 11:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 11:22" />I shilǝni mbǝ'ci ge'lu libi ki mi' bǝtl Lya kal ki Ulshelima, iki is shin Balnabas tya Antakiya. <verse eid="ACT 11:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 11:23" />Nǝn mbǝkǝci u i' en ulki zoki u nǝ Lya pǝlisi u, ippǝl hwol tugi, in ndǝllisi mbadli sǝ'dlil nǝ bali tǝn Lya nǝ mus mbadlwasǝn. <verse eid="ACT 11:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 11:24" />Ti mul zo' mbatl kǝni, ki njǝkǝni nǝ Yal ki mbatl ki Lya nǝ la'ti mbadli, i dǝɓǝl mbalǝn mbǝ ma' Mulban. <verse eid="ACT 11:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 11:25" />Iki i Balnabas lǝ tya Talsus ɗǝ ngau Shawulu, <verse eid="ACT 11:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 11:26" />Iki nǝm mbitu, im mbǝlti Antakiya, i hwon njikǝn ɗa Balnabas isi Shawulu asi ma'ga ge' libi ki Lya asi kulci' dǝɓǝl mbalǝn a Antakiya sǝ go' mbe' mi' bǝdl Yesu kal ki Kilista. <verse eid="ACT 11:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 11:27" />To a hwonisi mi'nje shikǝn kǝ Lya en pe'te' Ulshelima is mbǝ Antakiya. <verse eid="ACT 11:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 11:28" />Nǝm age' si, mul shin Agabus, i' hilya il dlǝmi nǝ ndǝl ki Yal ki mbatl ki Lya nǝn pǝtl bal kuzǝn won ge' atl ki gu' kǝ Lomawa. (Pǝlǝn dli ge' hwon ci' gu' ki Kalaudiyas.) <verse eid="ACT 11:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 11:29" />I milkushti dlilli, hu wonngi tǝn ndǝl twasi, tǝnma' ɗǝtl yelsǝni ginǝ ɗǝ dǝb a Yahudiya u. <verse eid="ACT 11:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 11:30" />Nǝgu sǝpǝli, is shin bǝltiwasǝn gaki ɗǝtl mi'kina tu'ma' Balnabas isi shawulu.<verse eid="ACT 11:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="ACT 12" />
  <para style="s">Gagashi' ki pe'ti ki Bitlus ɗǝ ge'lu Kǝndǝ Mbalǝn</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 12:1" />Age' cini i Guu Hilidus gop mil bǝtl Yesu kal tǝngaki tǝ' hwotisi bǝnaɗa. <verse eid="ACT 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 12:2" />Il laki i tlo Yakubu yelse ki Yahaya nǝ bal pǝga. <verse eid="ACT 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 12:3" />Nǝ' en gu a mbuni Yahudawa u, i' gob Bitlus ɗaɗanu. Gu ndani ge' hwon ki dobga ki daddaɓǝl ki ulki ɗami u nǝbǝ yis nidɗawai u. <verse eid="ACT 12:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 12:4" />Kal ki gobtiti, illa'ti ge'lu kǝndǝ mbalǝn, ibbǝl sojoji upsi upsi lǝbi upsi sǝ' ɓutti, lyamti ki Hilidus tǝm mbilti kina ɗǝ mbalǝn, kal ki daddaɓǝl ki ɗakǝshti. <verse eid="ACT 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 12:5" />Iki is zǝ Bitlus a ge'lu kǝndǝ' mbalǝn, dobga ki mi' bǝtl Yesu kal is go' shilǝn nǝ Lya gawasi. <verse eid="ACT 12:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 12:6" />A ge' gasu nǝ ǝnlu a cilu nǝ Hilidus ti lyabti tǝ pekǝlti kina dǝ mbalǝn, Bitlus ati nde'emmbuɗi ge' dlom ki mi' kǝndǝ dlom lop, ki kǝndǝ nǝ zhimdom lop, ami' ɓutti dlabi atǝn bidlabi. <verse eid="ACT 12:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 12:7" />I mul shinkǝn ki Lya won mbǝ i lu kǝndǝ mbalǝn ni cili. Illi' Bitlus tǝn malgǝn itl tlilti lya, i' usu, “Dleuki, ɗǝ tlǝl lya!” Iki zhim domi waki Bitlus ɗǝ toh. <verse eid="ACT 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 12:8" />I mul shinkǝn ki Lya ni ultisu, “La' lu'lǝgǝl a shim kaptalanwagi.” I Bitlus pǝli nǝgu. “Dla' ul idlakiwagi a' bǝlǝnkal,” <verse eid="ACT 12:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 12:9" />I Bitlus bǝlti kal is pe' ɗǝge' lu kǝndǝ mbalǝni, amma tǝman ulnǝ mul shinkǝn ki Lya ɗǝ pǝlti u kǝnǝ baliwai; enti tiɗa kǝnǝ tlu'ti. <verse eid="ACT 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 12:10" />Is ɗakǝsh mi' ɓutti ki nǝm nǝ ki lop is mbǝ tǝn dlabi ki dom ki te' ge' gatli. I dlabini ɓulisi nigawasi, is petya giɓi. Nǝs gollǝtu is mbǝkǝci lu unǝ bal shitu i pa'ɗa u, a lǝbi a lǝbi i mul shinkǝn ki Lya ni za'ti. <verse eid="ACT 12:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 12:11" />Nǝ Bitlus pal ge' dliwasu i' usu, “Nǝguni amani i, bǝnǝ bwasti mbadlwai Lya kǝn shin mul shinkǝn was suɗi tǝppe'kǝlǝn te' toh ɗǝ Hilidus nǝ mus ulnǝ Yahudawa ɗǝ la'ti mbatl ki ndatwa su.” <verse eid="ACT 12:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 12:12" />Nǝgu ndanǝti u, illǝ libi ɗǝ Maliyamu dyaki Yahaya, gunǝ ɗǝ mbetti ki Malkus ɗaɗanu, lu u'nǝ mbalǝn domga ɗǝ shilǝn nǝ Lya ɗa u. <verse eid="ACT 12:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 12:13" />I Bitlus du dlalabi ki dla, i zheli won mul shin Loda lǝte' ɗǝ ya' woki mul du' dlabi ni. <verse eid="ACT 12:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 12:14" />Nǝm mani yal ki Bitlus kǝn u, ta ɓul dlabi niwai i' kum hwoltugi ippal tya nǝ kal nǝ kitǝl itl dlǝmi, “Bitlus tǝn dlabi. <verse eid="ACT 12:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 12:15" />Is ultisu “Ama ga niki ɗawa. Nǝ'go' dlǝmissi nǝgu ɗa u, is usu, mul shinkǝnki Lya was kǝni.” <verse eid="ACT 12:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 12:16" />Amma i Bitlus go' du' dlabi ni, nǝs ɓul dlabi ni u is enti, is kum gagashinti. <verse eid="ACT 12:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 12:17" />I Bitlus u nisi toh sǝddǝm shot itl dlǝmisi kan unǝ Lya pekkǝlti ɗǝge' lu kǝndǝ mbalǝn u. I' usu, “Dlǝmi Yakubu ne' yelsǝni mwani nǝ mudli tǝn ulu,” is za'si illǝ ge' kundu lu. <verse eid="ACT 12:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 12:18" />Nǝ lu cilu i bal dlatl nda ge dlom ki mi' kǝndǝ dlom tǝn ulnǝ nda nǝ Bitlus su. <verse eid="ACT 12:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 12:19" />Kal ki nǝ Hilidus ngauti ta mbitwai u, i' gop pǝtl mi' ɓuttiti i nǝ shilǝn il laki tǝ tlosi. Iki i Hilidus za' Yahudiya illǝ Kaisaliya iddǝm tyaka.<verse eid="ACT 12:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mǝshti ki Hilidus</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 12:20" />Hilidus ɗǝ leuwi mbatl tǝn mbalǝn ki Taya nǝ Sidon; is maga is mbǝmati nǝ mbatl nǝm, kal ki ngau ɗǝtl ma' Bilastasa, zheli ki guu is ngau dǝp ki zoki, gaki tǝn atl ki guu nisi ɗǝ ga'tisi si mbǝ' ulki ɗami ɗa. <verse eid="ACT 12:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 12:21" />A tǝn cin unǝ zǝdli, i Hilidus la'lu'lǝgǝl guntwasi, it dǝmtǝn lu dǝmti ki gunti ippǝli mbalǝn shilǝn. <verse eid="ACT 12:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 12:22" />Is la'yali, “Guki Yal ki lya, ki mbalǝnwai.” <verse eid="ACT 12:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 12:23" />Alǝbi alǝbi, gaki Hilidus a nal Lya wai, imul shinkǝn ki Lya li'ti atli, i zhǝɓǝl gob ɗapti in mǝtci. <verse eid="ACT 12:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 12:24" />Amma iki shilǝn ki Lya gop mbǝtl tǝnki a ɗǝ ɓulti.<verse eid="ACT 12:24" /></para>
  <para style="s">Balnabas nǝ Shawulu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 12:25" />Balnabas nǝ Shawulu nǝs ngatl kautǝn wasǝn u, is palsu' Ulshelima, is mbǝ ne' Yahaya, gunǝ ɗǝ mbetti ki Malkus ɗaɗanu u.<verse eid="ACT 12:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="ACT 13" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 13:1" />Age' lu dobga ki mi'bǝtl Yesu kal ki Antakiya, mi'nje'shinkǝn ki Lya en ɗa nǝ mi'lashti: Balnabas, nǝ Saminu guni ɗǝ mbetti ki Baki, nǝ Lukiyas ki Kulane, nǝ Manayan gunǝs nal to'ɗi isǝ Guu Hilidus nǝ Shawulu. <verse eid="ACT 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 13:2" />Nǝsi natl Lya nǝ ngaptibi ɗaɗanu u, i Yal ki batl ki Lya ki gunti usu, “A'wolinǝn Balnabas nǝ Shawulu gaki kyautǝn u na mbesibi ɗa u.” <verse eid="ACT 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 13:3" />Kalki ngaptibi nǝ ngep Lya wasǝn, is zǝsi toh, is pallisi bi.<verse eid="ACT 13:3" /></para>
  <para style="s">Shilǝn ki Lya a Kubulus</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 13:4" />Si lopi, tǝn shitu wasǝn nǝ Yal ki batl ki Lya shinsi u, is lǝ Salukiya tyaka is tege' kundǝlǝn ki mal is lǝ Kubulus. <verse eid="ACT 13:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 13:5" />Nǝs mbǝkǝci a Salami u, is dlǝmisi shilǝn ki Lya ge'lu lu dobga ki Yahudawa, Yahaya ne'si ti ɗǝtlsi. <verse eid="ACT 13:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 13:6" />Is gadǝl cal gatli hal is mbǝ a Bapusa. A tyaka is mah ne' mul Yahude won mul pǝtl gonti, mul nje'shinkǝn ki lǝgati, mul shin Balyashuwa’ <verse eid="ACT 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 13:7" />gunǝ isǝ mukaddas Saljiyas Baulus, mul mallǝɓa, it taki ki Balnabas bi isǝ shawulu gaki ti lyap kup shilǝn ki Lya. <verse eid="ACT 13:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 13:8" />Amma Alimas mul idlatl dwaɗǝn u (gu iki shinwasi) in nge' shilǝnwasǝn, in ngayi tǝb bwas mukaddasiyi ɗǝ tǝn la'ti mbadlwasi nǝ Lya. <verse eid="ACT 13:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 13:9" />Iki Shawulu, gunǝ ɗǝ mbettiki Bulus ɗaɗanu u, ki njikǝnǝ, nǝ Yal ki batl ki Lya, i'uti Alimas dwaɗǝn i' usu, <verse eid="ACT 13:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 13:10" />“Ki yakan ki shedan kǝnǝ, mul dutuki, nǝ lǝɓa kizoki! Ka njikǝn i nǝ gǝdl mbalǝn nǝ shiptotugi. Kikǝn za'ti jitti shitu ki Lya waya? <verse eid="ACT 13:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 13:11" />In ngu toh ki Lya ɗǝ leuh mbatl nǝki. Kǝn dǝmti dwa ki lǝpdǝmti, ki kǝn ma'etcitl ki cinwai.” Alǝbi alǝbi i wolkǝnndi nǝ dǝmshal idlati, i'go' ngauti, tǝ mulǝn dǝllit toh. <verse eid="ACT 13:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 13:12" />Nǝmul mukaddasi yen ulnǝ nda u, illa' mbadlǝ, i' kum ngapti bi tǝn shilǝn ki Mulban.<verse eid="ACT 13:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Bulus nǝ Balnabas a Antakiya ki Bisidiya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 13:13" />A te' Basusa, Bulus ne' yelǝnsi wasi is tege' kundǝlǝn ki mali is mbǝkǝci Baliyata ki Bampiliya, alǝbi Yahaya za'si ippal tya Ulshelima. <verse eid="ACT 13:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 13:14" />A te' Baliyata is lǝ tya Bisidiya ge' atl ki Antakiya. Gas cinshu'ti is tege' ludopga ki Yahudawa is dǝm atli. <verse eid="ACT 13:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 13:15" />Kal ki dlǝmissi lashti zhil ki Musa nǝ lwatbat ki mi'nje' shinkǝn ki Lya, mi'kina ki lu dobga ki Yahudawa shin shinkǝn tǝnsi, is usu, “Yelsǝni, in shilǝn nikinɗa ki ndǝlli' mbalǝn mbadlu a' dlǝmini.” <verse eid="ACT 13:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 13:16" />I Bulus hilya i' unisi toh, i' usu kumǝnnǝni, “Kini Yelsǝni Isla'ilawa nǝ kini mi' bǝtl Lya ginǝ bǝ Yahudawa u. <verse eid="ACT 13:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 13:17" />Lya ki mi' Isla'ila i' ol mi'zǝ' mi'zinmini; in nal mbalǝn wasi nǝs dǝm a Masallu; nǝ ndǝtl ki naltwaskǝn tǝ pekkǝlsi ɗǝ ge'atli; <verse eid="ACT 13:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 13:18" />Hwon kutl kutl lǝbi upsi ati ngashtibi nǝsi age' dǝlgǝn; <verse eid="ACT 13:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 13:19" />Itl tlwa mbalǝn gatl ninngi a Kan'ana, ibbǝl mbalǝnwas atlwasǝn ɗǝ gwasǝn. <verse eid="ACT 13:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 13:20" />Musgi akan hwon kutl cen upsi nǝ kutl lǝbi nantam (450). “Kal kigu, i Lya bǝlsi mi'pǝtl shilǝn hal cin ki mbǝ ki Sama ila mul nje'shinkǝn ki Lya. <verse eid="ACT 13:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 13:21" />I mbalǝn ngawi tǝ bǝlsi gunti, Ibbǝlsi Saul yakǝn ki Kish, mulisi ge' bi ki Bilyaminu, ippǝl gunti ki hwon kutl kutl lǝbi upsi. <verse eid="ACT 13:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 13:22" />Kalki tusti Saul taka, ippal Dauda ɗǝ guu wasǝn. I Lya ndǝ'nǝti, i' usu, ‘A mbi Dauda i, yakǝn ki Jessi, mulnǝ ami lyapti ge' mbadli u; tǝn pǝtl mus ulnǝ ami lyamti tǝppǝli u.’ <verse eid="ACT 13:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 13:23" />Age' gǝskǝ mulgu Lya mbilli Isla ila mul pekkǝtl si Yesu, kan u nǝ dlǝlli u. <verse eid="ACT 13:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 13:24" />Kapǝn mbǝ' ki Yesu,Yahaya a dlǝmi Isla ilawa sǝ'za'pǝtl bezǝn lǝɓa appǝlisi baptisma muswasǝn. <verse eid="ACT 13:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 13:25" />Nǝ Yahaya ɓal nja ki ngwatlti kyautǝn wasu, i' usu: ‘Wokǝn ki paltǝni? Ami ki gunǝ ki ɓuttǝn uwa. Amma mulǝn ɗa ti mbǝ' ge' kalini gunǝ zhim kaptǝlan wasi akǝn mat tǝngǝltiwai.’ <verse eid="ACT 13:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 13:26" />“Kini mil ki Iblahim nǝ na mi'ɓantil Lya age' kini, mini shinimin shinkǝn ki pekkǝltu suɗi. <verse eid="ACT 13:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 13:27" />Mbalǝn ki Ulshelima ne' guumsisi wasǝn saman Yesu wai, ngo'nǝ konnǝtti u is njikǝn dlǝmti ki mi'nje'shinkǝn gunǝ ɗǝ dlipdli huh gas cin shu'tu. <verse eid="ACT 13:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 13:28" />Ko nǝbǝ sa mbiti nǝ bezǝn lǝɓa ki tlotwai u, is ngem Bilatus tǝtl tloti. <verse eid="ACT 13:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 13:29" />Nǝs njikǝn mus ulnǝ lashdli tǝntu, is shitti suɗɗǝ tǝn gǝdlǝnnga is la'ti ge' zuɗi. <verse eid="ACT 13:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 13:30" />Amma i Lya tlǝlti ɗǝge' mǝshti, <verse eid="ACT 13:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 13:31" />Mutti diɓǝli ati ɓǝtl gawasi ma' ginǝ mbǝ ne'ti a Ulshelima te Galili nǝguni siki mi' yenti nǝ dwaɗǝnwasi ma' mbǝlǝn i nǝn. <verse eid="ACT 13:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 13:32" />Mi dlǝmikin zo'shilǝn: Ki ndǝtu nǝ Lya pǝli' mi'zǝ'mi'zinmini u. <verse eid="ACT 13:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 13:33" />Ta njikǝnimini i, mini milwasi, tǝn tlǝtl Yesu lya. Kan unǝ ɗa ki laci u ge' Zabula ki lop:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 13:33">“ ‘Ki yakuyi kǝni;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 13:33">Asǝti adǝm bwagi.<verse eid="ACT 13:33" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 13:34" />Lya tlǝlti ge' mi'mǝshti tǝngaki tǝkǝn patl ge' shukǝ ɓostinuwai, Lya usu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 13:34">“ ‘An bǝtlkin albalka kizoki u na pǝli Dauda dlǝliti u.’<verse eid="ACT 13:34" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 13:35" />Tǝn gaki Zabula won a dlǝmini:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 13:35">“ ‘Kikǝn za'ti mul guntwagi tǝb ɓoswai.’<verse eid="ACT 13:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 13:36" />Dauda ɓo, i' pǝl ulnǝ Lya pitu age' hwonwasi, in nde yemmbuɗi; i guti ne'mi'ziǝ'mi'zitti i dliwas ɓosi. <verse eid="ACT 13:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 13:37" />Amma gu nǝ Lya tlǝlti ɗǝ ge' mi' mǝshtuwai ta ɓoswai. <verse eid="ACT 13:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 13:38" />“Gaki nugu yelǝnsiyini, ami lyamti ki'manini tu'ma' Yesu dlimi kini pashti bezǝn lǝɓa. <verse eid="ACT 13:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 13:39" />Tu' ma'ti mus mulnǝ ala' mbadlu ta mbi pekǝltu ngu ɗǝge' mus byaslǝɓa, gunǝ bǝ kushti ki Musa taman pekǝtl kiniwai u. <verse eid="ACT 13:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 13:40" />A' yanǝn lu gaki ɓa ulnǝ mi'nje'shinkǝn dlimi u ndanǝ kini.<verse eid="ACT 13:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 13:41" />“ ‘Ya nini, kini mi'mbǝtl lǝɓa.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 13:41">Kǝn pǝtl ga gashinti a gǝlni, an pǝtl ulǝn ge' hwonwakǝn gunǝ kǝkkǝn la'ti mbatl nǝ nali wai u, ko tǝ mulǝn dlimi kini.’ ”<verse eid="ACT 13:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="ACT 13:42" />Nǝki Bulus isǝ Balnabas ɗǝ pe'ti ɗǝge' lu dopga ki Yahudawa u, i mbalǝn mbesi bi sǝmmbil dlǝmisi shilǝn tǝn usi gas cin shuti mul mbǝti. <verse eid="ACT 13:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="ACT 13:43" />Nǝ dopga ki mbalǝn zǝgga u, Yahudawa dǝɓǝli ne' mi' ginǝ te'ge' undi bǝlti ki Yahudawa is bǝl ki Bulus kal isǝ Balnabas, sine is pisi shilǝn asi ndǝllisi mbadlǝ sǝcci kina ɗa, ge'alheli ki Lya. <verse eid="ACT 13:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="ACT 13:44" />Nǝ cin shuti mbǝ ɗaɗanu u kǝnǝ mus mbalǝn kige' gatli domga tǝngaki sǝ'kum shilǝn ki Lya. <verse eid="ACT 13:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="ACT 13:45" />Nǝ Yahudawa en hwu' mbalǝn u, is kum dutugi, is gob nge' ulnǝ Bulus ɗǝ dlǝmti u asi byatlti. <verse eid="ACT 13:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="ACT 13:46" />I Bulus isǝ Balnabas is ndǝgisi nǝ ndǝtl ki mbadli: “Kini mi' dlǝmikin shilǝn ki Lya pa. Amma tun nǝ' ka ngeni u, adǝmi ki ɗa lyap mbatl mul lǝshi pa'twai, mǝnpalti tya ma'gini bǝ Yahudawa wai u. <verse eid="ACT 13:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="ACT 13:47" />Tǝn gu Lya zimi zhil:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 13:47">“ ‘A la'ki, cili ge' mi'ginǝ bǝs man Lya wai u,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 13:47">gaki ki dǝm shitu mbi pe'kǝtl ki mbǝlǝn ɗa hal pa'ti ki dǝp lǝɓaɗa.<verse eid="ACT 13:47" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="ACT 13:48" />Nǝ ginǝ bǝ Yahudawa wai u kumgu u, is kum hwoltugi is nal shilǝn ki Lya; i mus mi'mbi dli unǝ bǝ kǝn mǝshtwai u is la'mbadli. <verse eid="ACT 13:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="ACT 13:49" />I shilǝn ki Lya mbǝl lǝllolu' tǝnki mus age' atli. <verse eid="ACT 13:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="ACT 13:50" />Amma Yahudawa gob hotti na mudli en mi'ɓantil Lya mi'bas lu kyautǝn ne' mi'kina kige' gatli. Is tlǝl ngashti tǝn Bulus isǝ Balnabas, is katsi ɗǝge' atlwasǝn. <verse eid="ACT 13:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="ACT 13:51" />Sine is bǝkǝt kushka ki asǝn wasǝn taka tǝ dǝm dǝtlkǝmɗa tǝnsi is lǝ tya Ikoniya. <verse eid="ACT 13:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="ACT 13:52" />Milkushtiwas njikǝn nǝ hwol tugi nǝ Yal ki batl ki Lya.<verse eid="ACT 13:52" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="ACT 14" />
  <para style="s">Bulus nǝ Balnas a Ikoniya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 14:1" />A Ikoniya Bulus isǝ Balnabas is tege' lu dobga ki Yahudawa kan u nǝs kuɗa u is dlǝm shilǝn ki Lya hal i hwu' Yahudawa ne' ginǝ bǝ Yahudawa wai u la'mbadli. <verse eid="ACT 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 14:2" />Amma Yahudawa ginǝ nge la'ti mbadli is ho' ginǝ bǝ Yahudawa wai u is kon nǝ dlomwasǝn ne' yelsǝniwasǝn. <verse eid="ACT 14:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 14:3" />I ki Bulus nǝ Balnabas is lǝmdǝp tyaka, si dlǝp shilǝn ki Lya nǝ ndǝtl ki mbadli, i' pǝl enti nǝ dwaɗǝn tǝn shilǝn ki alheli wasi gunǝ la'si ɗǝ pǝtl ulki gagashintu. <verse eid="ACT 14:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 14:4" />I mbalǝn ki ge' gatli bwassi; nami tǝn Yahudawa, genne si tǝn kal ki mi'shinkǝn. <verse eid="ACT 14:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 14:5" />I ki gyen ginǝ bǝ Yahudawa wai u nǝ Yahudawa ne' mi'kinawasǝn, is kǝndi sǝl la'si ge' sha as la'si nǝ zǝnga. <verse eid="ACT 14:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 14:6" />Amma nǝs kum shilǝn nǝ u, is kitǝl tyage' gatl ki Likoniya ki Listila nǝ Dalba, nǝ atl ki malgǝni. <verse eid="ACT 14:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 14:7" />Alǝbǝ sǝ mbǝl dlǝp shilǝn ki Lya tǝnki.<verse eid="ACT 14:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">A Listila nǝ Dalba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 14:8" />A Listila mulǝn ɗa ki dǝmi atli dakǝlkǝni, nǝgu sǝ'zǝtti ta lǝm lǝ' gason wai. <verse eid="ACT 14:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 14:9" />Ti ga'ki' shilǝn ki Bulus kǝm, i Bulus uti' dwaɗǝn, i' en la'ti mbatl ni'ɗa akǝm ki ndo'twasi, <verse eid="ACT 14:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 14:10" />it ultisu nǝ ndǝlti, “Hilya tǝn asǝnwagi!” Gaki nǝgu, i muli pe' lya i' gob lǝti. <verse eid="ACT 14:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 14:11" />Nǝ hwu' mbalǝn yen ulnǝ Bulus pǝli u, is la' yali nǝbi ki Likoniya is usu, “Inngu lya yen a ndemin suɗǝ kǝnǝ mbalǝn!” <verse eid="ACT 14:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 14:12" />Balnabas is mbekki Zapsa, tine Bulus is mbekki Hamisa gaki tikǝ mulkina ki shilǝn. <verse eid="ACT 14:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 14:13" />Iki i laɓa ki zapsa, gunǝ libi pǝtl gontwas a kal gatlu, immbǝl bas tla nǝ dwaɗǝn ki buzha pǝtti abidlabi gatli, gaki ti ne' mbalǝn si lyap pǝli'si hadaya. <verse eid="ACT 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 14:14" />Amma ki Balnabas isǝ Bulus, nǝs kumgu' u, is kyash lu'lǝgǝlwasǝn is te'ge' mbalǝni nǝ kitǝl, asi tlǝlyal: <verse eid="ACT 14:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 14:15" />“Yelǝnsi, ya laki i' pǝlǝn nǝ guɗa? Mima mbalǝnni, kǝnǝ kini. Shilǝn ki Lya kǝn mi mbǝlli' kini, ɗǝ utlkinsu ki' zakǝn ulnǝ bǝ mbunwai u, a' palni ma' Lya mul mbadli, gunǝ pǝl lya nǝ atlu, nǝ basmal, nǝ mus ulnǝ ge'si u. <verse eid="ACT 14:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 14:16" />Tini tun teɗi is za' mbalǝn sǝ' bǝl shitu u nǝ si lyamti u. <verse eid="ACT 14:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 14:17" />Ngo nǝnǝgu taza' gawas ba mi' enti nǝ dwaɗǝwai, tǝn gaki ti pǝli' alheli, ti gunǝ ɗǝ pǝli'kin mal ki lya ne' lǝɓa ki ge' gu ki watlin; ti bǝtlkin ulki ɗami iye, ti njǝkǝnkin nǝ hwoltugi.” <verse eid="ACT 14:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 14:18" />Mus nǝ shilǝngi, nǝ ngeskǝn sǝ hane mbalǝn hadaya gawasǝn. <verse eid="ACT 14:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 14:19" />I Yahudawa yen pe'te' Antakiya nǝ Ikoniya is shel mbalǝni. Is lalla' Bulus is dǝlti kal gatli, si yenti kǝnǝ ta mǝcci. <verse eid="ACT 14:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 14:20" />Amma i mi' bǝtl Yesu kal is dopga is gadǝlti, i' hilya ippaltya ge' gatli. Lucili is lǝ Dalba isǝ Balnabas.<verse eid="ACT 14:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Patl te' Antakiya age' Suliya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 14:21" />Is dlim shilǝn ki Lya a ge gatli is mbi mi' bǝtl Yesu kal diɓǝli. Iki is paltya Listila nǝ Ikoniya nǝ kuma Antakiya, <verse eid="ACT 14:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 14:22" />Si ndǝlli' mi' bǝtl Yesu kal mbadli, si dǝlissi kǝm sǝ' dlil tǝn la'ti mbalwasǝn. “Nǝ bǝna mul diɓǝtl kǝn tǝn ten ge' gu' ki Lya,” Is usu. <verse eid="ACT 14:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 14:23" />Bulus nǝ Balnabas is ollisi mi'kina hu lu dobga ki mi' bǝtl Yesu kalu kǝni, nǝ shilǝn nǝ Lya nǝ ngap tibi, is za'si a toh ɗǝ Lya, gunǝ tǝnti sǝ la' mbadlu. <verse eid="ACT 14:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 14:24" />Nǝs pa' du' a Bisidiya u, is mbǝ a Bampiliya. <verse eid="ACT 14:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 14:25" />Nǝs dlǝm shilǝn ki Lya a Baliyata u, is su Ataliya. <verse eid="ACT 14:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 14:26" />Te' Ataliya is paltya Antakiya ge' kudǝlǝn ki mal, ge' lu' u nǝ teɗi shilǝn nǝ Lya gawasǝn ɗa u is mbi alheli ki pa'ti kyautǝn ɗa. <verse eid="ACT 14:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 14:27" />Mbǝkǝshtiwasǝn tyaka, is domi mi' bǝtl Yesu kal ga is dlǝm mus ulnǝ Lya pǝli tu' ma'si u, nǝ kan unǝ' ɓuldlabi imi' gǝnǝ bǝ Yahudawai u mbi pe'tu. <verse eid="ACT 14:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 14:28" />Is lǝm dǝp tya ka ne' mi' bǝtl Yesu kal.<verse eid="ACT 14:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="ACT 15" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 15:1" />I mbalǝn yen pe'te' Yahudiya is mbǝ Antakiya si kulci' mi'bǝtl Yesu kal: si usu “In a sǝlkin kan u nǝ mbidli ma' Musa u wai u, kikǝn mbi' pe'kǝltwai.” <verse eid="ACT 15:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 15:2" />Tǝn shilǝn gu mbǝlli ki Bulus nǝ Balnabas shotti bi mul ndǝlti ne' si. Is la'ki tǝkǝ Bulus nǝ Balnabas, ne' mi'bǝtl Yesu kalen, sǝtto Ulushelima ma' milshinkǝn ne' kolsi tǝn shilǝ ni. <verse eid="ACT 15:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 15:3" />A si tǝn shitu wasǝn, kǝlǝ' tya pinikiya nǝ Samaliya, i Ikilisiya la'si shitu, asi dlib kan unǝ ginǝ bǝ Yahudawawai u bǝl Yesu kal. Shilǝn gu i laki mus mi'bǝtl Yesu kal is kum hwoltugi. <verse eid="ACT 15:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 15:4" />Nǝs mbǝkǝci Ulshelima u, i mil Ikilisiya nǝ mil shinkǝn nǝ kolsi ulisi ɗem, sine is dlimisi mus ulnǝ Lya pǝli tu'ma'si u. <verse eid="ACT 15:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 15:5" />Na mi'bǝtl Yesu kalen, mi'bǝtl ɗalika ki Palisiyawa is hilya is usu, “Ginǝ bǝ Yahudawa wai u nǝn sǝtlsi la'si nǝ ngesi amus sǝbbǝl zhil ki Musa.” <verse eid="ACT 15:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 15:6" />I milshikǝn ne' Kolsi is maga sǝ'ya shilǝn u. <verse eid="ACT 15:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 15:7" />Kal ki shotti bi wasǝn mul ndǝlti, i Bitlus hilya idlǝmisi shilǝn: “Yelsǝni, kimanini te' ge' cinyen te' ka Lya a wolin nǝn ge' kini, abi ɗaka ginǝ bǝ Yahudawa wai u sǝ'kum shilǝn ki Lya as la' mbadli. <verse eid="ACT 15:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 15:8" />Lya mul ma' mbadli, ta mbo toh i ta ndǝ'nǝsi i, hal ibbǝlsi Yal ki mbatl ki Lya mul gunti, kan unǝ' bǝlmi u. <verse eid="ACT 15:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 15:9" />Ta bwas dlominǝn ne'siwai, gaki ta okǝl mbadlwasǝn taka i gaki la'ti mbadlwasǝn. <verse eid="ACT 15:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 15:10" />Gaki nǝgu, ya lakiɗa iki lyap cimbǝtl Lya ɗa, ka zi mi'bǝtl Yesu kali kaya unnǝ mini ne' mi'zǝ' mi'zǝ'mini ma, mamanǝn kanti wai u? <verse eid="ACT 15:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 15:11" />Ma la' mbatli tǝn alheli ki Yesu mǝ mbi pe'kǝtl ɗa, kǝnǝ kan u nǝs mbi u.” <verse eid="ACT 15:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 15:12" />I mus hwu' mbalǝn i dǝm shot, si gakki' Balnabas isi Bulus kǝm, nǝsi dlǝmissi gagashintu nǝ Lya pǝli ge' ginǝ bǝ Yahudawawai u tu'ma'si. <verse eid="ACT 15:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 15:13" />Nǝs paki u, i Yakubu shilǝni. “Kini yelsǝni,” Kumǝnnǝni. <verse eid="ACT 15:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 15:14" />Bitlus dlimmimmi kan unǝ Lya gob likǝnti i otl mbalǝn ge'shin wasi te'ge' ginǝ bǝ Yahudawawai u. <verse eid="ACT 15:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 15:15" />Shilǝn ki mi'nje shinkǝn nda'ce kǝnɗa nǝgu, kan unǝ ɗaki laci' u:<verse eid="ACT 15:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 15:16" />“ ‘Kal ki gu an palti,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 15:16">ɗaɗanu akǝn libi ki Dauda gunǝ nda u.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 15:16">Ankǝnti a dlilli lǝbi.<verse eid="ACT 15:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 15:17" />Gaki tǝ mbalǝnyi nǝ sa' i, sǝ ngau Lya ɗa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 15:17">hal ne' ginǝ bǝ Yahudawawai u nǝɗǝ mbe'</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 15:17">shin i u, Lya usu, mulnǝ pǝl usi u.’<verse eid="ACT 15:17" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 15:18" />Lǝɓa ki Lya ki maniɗa mati tun teɗi.<verse eid="ACT 15:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 15:19" />“Gaki nǝgu, yenti ini, ginǝ bǝ Yahudawa wai u, a mbunwai tǝn zisi bal ulǝngawai mi'patl te'ma' Lya i. <verse eid="ACT 15:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 15:20" />Age' shuki nǝgu tǝn laccisi an dlimisi bǝs ɗam ulki ɗami ki lya ki mi'pǝtlgontwai, nǝ pǝtl kontwai, nǝ ɗab tlu'unǝ bǝ apocwai u, nǝ ɗab hwula. <verse eid="ACT 15:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 15:21" />Gaki shilǝn ki zhil ki Musa a dlimǝn dli mus ge'gatli tun teɗi, ɗǝ dlǝp lashti ge' lu dopga ki Yahudawa hwu gas cin shutu kǝnǝ.”<verse eid="ACT 15:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Shin kǝn ki mi'dlitl shilǝn</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 15:22" />I milshinkǝn, nǝ kolsi nǝ mus mi' Ikilisiya mus is kǝndǝ sǝppekǝl gen age' si as shinsi tya Antakiya nǝ Bulus isǝ Balnabas. Is pekkǝl Yahuza (gunǝɗǝ mbettiki Balsaba u) nǝ Sila, si mi'kinani ge' mi'bǝtl Yesu kal. <verse eid="ACT 15:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 15:23" />Is bǝlsi shinkǝn ki lwatbati mul ussu, Ma' yelsini wakǝn milshinkǝn nǝ kolsi, mil bǝtl Yesu kal, ma' yelsǝni inǝn ginǝ bǝ Yahudawawai u ki Antakiya, nǝ Suliya nǝ Kilikiya: shinniti. <verse eid="ACT 15:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 15:24" />Mǝ kumi gen pekki ɗǝ ge'mi bǝ nǝ ndǝtinǝnwai, si tlǝlinkin kin mbadli, ulnǝs dlimi u a ɗǝ hwoti kini. <verse eid="ACT 15:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 15:25" />In ndǝgi musinǝn tǝn pekkǝl gen inǝn an shinsi tya ma'kini nǝ yelǝnsi inǝn ki Balnabas nǝ Bulus, <verse eid="ACT 15:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 15:26" />mbalǝn ginǝ bǝlgawasǝn gaki shinkǝ Yesu Almasihu u. <verse eid="ACT 15:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 15:27" />Gaki nǝgu, mashin Yahuza nǝ Silas sǝ' dlimikin ulnǝn laci u nǝ biwasǝn. <verse eid="ACT 15:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 15:28" />Gaki a mbuni Yal ki mbatl ki Lya i nǝ mi, bǝn zikin ulǝn mul diɓǝtl aga tǝ ngǝtl ginǝ ɗǝ lyapdli u wai. <verse eid="ACT 15:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 15:29" />Bǝ ɗamǝn ulnǝs poci lya ki mi'pǝtlgontwai, nǝ ɗap tlu nǝ hwula giɓi, nǝ ɗap tlu u nǝs modǝli' yalu nǝ pǝttya ne' mbalǝn. Kǝn dǝmti lau ǝn ka zakǝn pǝtl undi gi u. Se agason. <verse eid="ACT 15:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 15:30" />Sine nǝs pallisi bi u, is su swa Antakiya, alǝbi is dom mi' Ikilisiya is bǝlsi lwabbati. <verse eid="ACT 15:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 15:31" />Nǝ mbalǝn dlǝm lashti u is kum hwol tu' nǝ shikǝn ki ndǝlli' si mbatlu. <verse eid="ACT 15:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 15:32" />Yahuza nǝ Silas, si ma gawasǝn mi'nje'shinkǝn kǝni, is dlǝm shilǝn ki ndǝlli' si mbadli iye. <verse eid="ACT 15:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 15:33" />Kal ki lǝp muttwasǝn tyaka, i mi'bǝtl Yesu kal pallisi bi nǝ hwoltugi, is paltwa ma'ginǝ shinsi suɗi. <verse eid="ACT 15:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 15:34" />Silas yeni ambuni tǝtdǝm lǝbi. <verse eid="ACT 15:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 15:35" />Amma Bulus nǝ Balnabas is dlil a Antakiya, alǝbi si ne' gen diɓǝli asi kulci'si shilǝn ki Lya.<verse eid="ACT 15:35" /></para>
  <para style="s">Bulus bwassi isǝ Balnabas</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 15:36" />Kal ki lǝpmutti i Bulus ul Balnabas usu, “Tǝn paltyai ma' mi'bǝtl Yesu kal ki ge'gatlu nǝ mus nǝn dlǝm shilǝn ki Lya ɗa u an ya kan unǝ si ɗa u.” <verse eid="ACT 15:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 15:37" />Balnabas ɗǝ lyamti sǝ' zǝga nǝ Yahaya, gunǝ ɗǝ mbetti ki Malkus, ne'si. <verse eid="ACT 15:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 15:38" />Amma Bulus yeni a mbuni sǝ' zǝga ne'twai, gaki ta za'si a Bampiliya i, ta ɓeukina ne'si ɗǝ kyautǝni wai. <verse eid="ACT 15:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 15:39" />I lǝshi manti tegge' dlomwasǝn, Hal is bwassi. I Balnabas kan Malkus is te'ge' kundǝlǝn ki mal is lǝ tya Kublus. <verse eid="ACT 15:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 15:40" />Amma i Bulus wol silas is zǝga, mi'bǝtl Yesu kal is shilǝn nǝ Lya gawasi tǝ alheli ki Lya bǝli nǝti. <verse eid="ACT 15:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 15:41" />Is du tya ge' atl ki Suliya nǝ ki Kilikiya, ti ndǝlli' Ikilisiya i mbadli.<verse eid="ACT 15:41" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="ACT 16" />
  <para style="s">Timothy bǝl ki Bulus kal isi Silas</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 16:1" />Bulus mbǝ a Dalba nǝ a Listila. Mul kushti wonɗa mul shin Timothy, dyawasi mul Yehudiya ni, ti mul bǝtl Yesu kal kǝnǝ amma bwasi mul Helinawa ni. <verse eid="ACT 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 16:2" />Mi' bǝtl Yesu kal ki Listila nǝ ki Ikoniya si dlǝb zo' shilǝn tǝnti. <verse eid="ACT 16:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 16:3" />Bulus ɗǝ lyamti sǝ' zǝga siti, is zǝga siti i' sǝlti ɗa gaki Yahudawa yi nǝɗǝ dǝb a lǝbi u, mus simani bwasi mul Helinawani. <verse eid="ACT 16:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 16:4" />Nǝsi bǝtl gatl nǝ gatl tya u, is gob dlimi' mbalǝn zhilu nǝ mi'kina ne' kolso ki Ikilisiya kǝndǝ a Ulshelima u, gaki tǝ mbalǝn shindǝl ga ɗa. <verse eid="ACT 16:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 16:5" />Nǝnǝgu i mi'bǝtl Yesu kal ndǝndǝl ge' la'ti mbadlwasǝn ɗa, hu gasi ukǝni si mbil tǝnki.<verse eid="ACT 16:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Tlu'ti ki Bulus tǝn mul ki Makidoniya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 16:6" />Bulus nǝ mbalǝnwasi is gadǝl atl ki Pilijiya nǝ Galatiya, gaki Yal ki mbatl ki Lya a ndǝgisi i sǝ'dlǝm shilǝn ki mulban age' atl ki Asiya wai. <verse eid="ACT 16:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 16:7" />Nǝsbǝ tǝn bisi ki atl ki Misiya u, is lyami sǝttege' atl ki Bitiniya, amma Yal ki mbatl ki Yesu a ndǝgisiwai. <verse eid="ACT 16:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 16:8" />Is bǝli malgǝn Misiya, is ɓeu swa Talwasa. <verse eid="ACT 16:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 16:9" />A gasi i Bulus tlu ki tǝn mul Makidoniya tikǝ dlǝlli ti ngepti, “Mbǝ a Makidoniya ki ɗǝlmi.” <verse eid="ACT 16:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 16:10" />Kal ki tlu'ti ki Bulus, in hilya ɗǝ lǝ' Makidoniya, ma mani i Lya kǝn taki mibi tǝn dlimisi shǝlǝn wasi.<verse eid="ACT 16:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Lidiya ta Ndǝnǝ Lya i</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 16:11" />In hilya ɗǝ Taluwasa in tege' kundǝlǝn ki mal illǝ tya Samutalas, lucili illǝ Niyabolis. <verse eid="ACT 16:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 16:12" />Te' lǝbi in zǝga tya Pilibi, gatlu nǝ Lomawa pǝlisi gunti bal gatl kǝnǝ Macidoniya. Illǝm mutti tyaka. <verse eid="ACT 16:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 16:13" />Gas cin shuti in pe' abidlabi gatli in su dlǝlka, ge'lu' u nǝmi la'ti mbadli mǝn mbi' lu shilǝn nǝ Lya u. In dǝm atli in gob dlǝmi' mudlǝ i nǝ domga lǝbi i shilǝn. <verse eid="ACT 16:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 16:14" />Nǝm ge' mi'gaki'mi kǝm kǝli ki ge' gatl ki Tayatila mul shin Lidiya, mul utl gou lulut taka, mul bǝtl Lya kǝni. I Lya ɓul mbadlwasi i' ga'kǝm tǝn shilǝn ki Bulus. <verse eid="ACT 16:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 16:15" />Kal ki pǝli' kǝliyi baptisma ne' mi' libiwasu, im mbemi bi a libi ɗa'ka. I' usu “Ən ka ndǝ' ni ami mul bǝtl Lya kal kǝn u,” “Nganni ki' dǝmni libi ɗaka.” I' shelmi.<verse eid="ACT 16:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kǝndǝ Mi'kina a Ge'lu Kǝnd Mbalǝn ki Pilibi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 16:16" />Gason mi zǝ'ga ge'lu shilǝn nǝ Lya, in ma ne' zheli yakǝn kǝli mul yallu, ti domi' mulbanwas lǝɓa nǝ yalluwasu. <verse eid="ACT 16:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 16:17" />Ibbǝl Bulus kal ne' mi, a ti la'ti Yal, “Mbalǝn gi mi' ki Lya kǝni, si dlimi' kin shitu ki pe'ti.” <verse eid="ACT 16:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 16:18" />Ip pǝtl gu mutti diɓǝli. Il le'ci Bulus lo'si i' yalu kal i' ul mul yallu isu, “Ge' shin ki Yesu ami bǝtl ki zhil pe' ɗǝge'ti!” Alǝbi i mi'gatli za'ti. <verse eid="ACT 16:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 16:19" />Nǝ mulban yeni shitu mbi' ulpwasǝn a caku, is gob Bulus nǝ Sila is dǝlsi swa bi lu dobga ki utl lǝɓa taka akina ɗǝ mi' pǝtl shilǝn. <verse eid="ACT 16:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 16:20" />Is tǝlasi kina ɗǝ mi'pǝtl shilǝn is usu, “Mbalǝngi Yahudawani, ko animi si tlǝli'mi gatl lya. <verse eid="ACT 16:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 16:21" />Si kulci' mi shilǝn u nǝ bǝ ambuni tǝn bǝliwai u tǝngaki mi Lomawa ni.” <verse eid="ACT 16:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 16:22" />I hwu mbalǝn dopga tǝn ki Bulus isǝ Silas, i mul pǝtl shilǝni laki tǝ tusisi lu' lǝgǝl a li'si nǝ kumbǝl ki dom. <verse eid="ACT 16:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 16:23" />Kal ki li'tisi iye, is la'si age'lu kǝndǝ' mbalǝn, i la'mul kǝndǝ' mbalǝni tǝp ɓu'si ki zoki. <verse eid="ACT 16:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 16:24" />Nǝ' kan zhilu u, is sulsi swa giɓi i' ki ndǝsi tǝn ancin ki ngapti asǝn. <verse eid="ACT 16:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 16:25" />Age' dlom gasi Bulus nǝ silas si shilǝn nǝ Lya asi utl ul ki natl Lya, nami' ki ge'lu kǝndǝ mbalǝn ɗǝ gakisi kǝm. <verse eid="ACT 16:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 16:26" />Nǝgu katl, i pǝl bal ukkǝ atli sai nǝ gǝsbi ki lu kǝndǝ mbalǝni uni. Alǝbi alǝbi i dlabi ki lu kǝndǝ mbalǝni ɓuli, i mus zhim dom ki kǝndǝ mi'ki kǝndǝyi ɓaɓatli. <verse eid="ACT 16:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 16:27" />Nǝ mul kǝndǝ' mbalǝni hilya u, nǝ' en dlabi ni ki ɓuli u, ittus bal pǝga tǝtl tlogawasi, gaki ti yenti mi'kǝ kǝndǝ i sa kitǝli. <verse eid="ACT 16:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 16:28" />I Bulus tlǝl Yal i usu, “Bǝ kumi gawa'! Ciwowai musinǝn miɗa!” <verse eid="ACT 16:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 16:29" />I mul kǝndǝ mbalǝni ta' bi tǝ mbǝlli' cilti, is su giɓi in nda kina ɗǝ Bulus nǝ Silas nǝ nepti ki dli. <verse eid="ACT 16:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 16:30" />I ki ippekkǝlsi totldla i' usu, “Mi'kina, ya tapǝli ta mbi pe'ti ɗa u?” <verse eid="ACT 16:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 16:31" />Is ndǝgi, “La'mbatl nǝ Yesu, kǝn mbi' pe'ti ki nǝ libiwagi.” <verse eid="ACT 16:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 16:32" />Iki is dlǝmi' shilǝn ki Lya ti mus ne' mi'libi wasi. <verse eid="ACT 16:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 16:33" />Age' gasu imul kǝndǝ mballǝni yemsi i' okkǝlisi usuwasǝn taka; Alǝbi ti mus ne' libiwasi i pǝlisi baptisma. <verse eid="ACT 16:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 16:34" />Im mbǝlsi libi ɗakka im mbǝllisi ulki ɗami; in njǝkǝn nǝ hwol mbadli gaki ta la'mbatl nǝ Lya i mus nǝ mi' libiwasi. <verse eid="ACT 16:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 16:35" />Nǝlu cilu, i mi' pǝtl shilǝni shin mil shinkǝn ki guu, summa mul kǝndǝ mbalǝni nǝ zhil: “Tǝ za' mbalǝn i.” <verse eid="ACT 16:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 16:36" />I mul kǝndǝ' mbalǝni ul Bulus su, “Mi'pǝtl shilǝn a bil zhili ki tǝ zakkini ki zǝnga. Nǝ guni kǝn ma'zǝgga. Zǝnga nǝ hwol tugi.” <verse eid="ACT 16:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 16:37" />Amma i Bulus ul mi'kina i su: “Age' mbalǝn kǝn sǝ li'mi bǝma pǝlisi ulǝnwai, mus nǝ mima Lomawa u, is la'mi ge'lu kǝndǝ mbalǝn. Nǝgun si lyap pe'kǝtl mi shota? Hwe sǝm mbǝ nǝgawasǝn sǝppekkǝlmi. <verse eid="ACT 16:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 16:38" />I mi' kǝndǝ dlom mi dlimi mi'pǝtl shilǝni, nǝs kumi Bulus nǝ Silas mi' Lomawa u, is kum ɓanti. <verse eid="ACT 16:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 16:39" />Is mbǝ ɗǝ ngep pashti ma'si, is pekǝlsi ɗǝ ge'lu kǝndǝ mbalǝni, ɗǝ ngepsi sǝ'za'gatli. <verse eid="ACT 16:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 16:40" />Kalki pe'ti ki Bulus nǝ Silas ɗǝge' lu kǝndǝ mbalǝn u, is lǝ libi ɗǝ Lidiya, lu unǝs ma ne' yelsǝni mil bǝtl Lya mwani nǝ mudli is ndillisi mbadli. Is zǝga.<verse eid="ACT 16:40" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 16" />
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="ACT 17" />
  <para style="s">Dlati a Tasalonika</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 17:1" />Bulus nǝ Sila is ɓeu tya Ampibolis nǝ Apolloniya, is mbǝ Tasalonika, lu u' nǝ lu dobga ki Yahudawa ɗa. <verse eid="ACT 17:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 17:2" />Kan unǝ kuɗa u, i Bulus te'ge' lu dobga, gas cin shuti maki ati shoti bi ne'si ge' lwabbati, <verse eid="ACT 17:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 17:3" />Ti dlimissi nǝ ndǝlti tǝn Almasihu nǝn tlebbǝna atl hiliya ɗǝge' mi'mǝshti. I' usu, “Yesu u nǝ ami dlǝmikini u tikǝ Almasihu.” <verse eid="ACT 17:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 17:4" />Genge' Yahudawa is dǝgi is maga nǝ Bulus isǝ Sila, nǝgu hwu' mi' Helinawa mi'ɓanti' Lya ne' bas mudli bǝ tengulen wai. <verse eid="ACT 17:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 17:5" />Amma na Yahudawa yen kum dutugi; is yem mi' ndǝtl ki ga tye' ge'lu utl lǝɓa taka, is dom mbalǝn is tlǝl dlati age' gatli. Is lǝ libi ki Yason, si ngau Bulus isǝ Silas gaki sǝppekkǝlsi to' kina ɗǝ hwu' mbalǝn. <verse eid="ACT 17:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 17:6" />Ama nǝbǝ sa mbisi wai u, is dǝl Yason ne' na mi'bǝdl Yesu kal te' akina ɗǝ mi'kǝndǝ' dlom kige' gatli, asi la'ti Yal si usu: “Mbalǝn i nǝ ɗǝ tlǝl gatllya i sinngi sa mbǝki i, <verse eid="ACT 17:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 17:7" />i Yason njesi libi ɗa'ka. Muswasǝn si nge' bǝtl zhil ki Kaisal, si usu, gu wonɗa, si mbeti ki Yesu.” <verse eid="ACT 17:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 17:8" />Nǝs kum gu u, i hwu' mbalǝn ne' mi' kǝndǝ' dlom kige gatli i mbadlwasǝn tlǝh. <verse eid="ACT 17:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 17:9" />Sa za'si pa is zǝgawai sai nǝs kan up ɓatlti ma' Yason ne' yelsǝniwasi.<verse eid="ACT 17:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mi' kina a Biliya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 17:10" />Nǝ gas pǝ u, i mi'bǝdl Yesu kal shin Bulus nǝ Silas Tya Biliya. Nǝs mbǝkǝci tya ka u, is tege' lu dobga ki Yahudawa. <verse eid="ACT 17:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 17:11" />Yahudawa ki Biliya ngǝtl ki Tasalonika nǝ zo' mbadli, gaki sa kan shilǝni nǝ lyamti, asi ya' lwabbati hu anǝmi sǝ' eni ko ulnǝ Bulus dlimi u balini. <verse eid="ACT 17:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 17:12" />Gaki gu, dǝɓǝli ge'si is la'mbadli, hal ne' bas mudli ki Helinawa ne' mwani Helinawa diɓǝli. <verse eid="ACT 17:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 17:13" />Amma nǝ Yahudawa ki Tasalonika kum Bulus ɗǝ dlib shilǝn ki Lya a Biliya u, i gen lǝ tyaka asi co'tisi asi tlǝl mbadlwasǝn. <verse eid="ACT 17:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 17:14" />Alǝbi alǝbi i mi'bǝtl Yesu kal shin Bulus tya dlǝlka, amma Silas nǝ Timoty is dlil a Biliya. <verse eid="ACT 17:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 17:15" />Gini la' Bulus shitu i is mbilti a Atina, i Bulus za'si nǝ zhil sǝppi Silas nǝ Timothy sǝ'su mbǝti.<verse eid="ACT 17:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Bulus a Atina</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 17:16" />Nǝ Bulus ɗǝ ɓuttisi a Atina u, i'kum dutugi gaki gatli a njikǝn i nǝ lya ki mi' pǝtl gonti. <verse eid="ACT 17:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 17:17" />I' gob shotti bi ne' Yahudawa nǝ Helinawa mi'ɓanti' Lya age' lu dobga ki Yahudawa, nǝ ge'lu dobga ki ulti nǝ ulti taka hu cin u kǝnǝ ginǝ ta mbisi lǝbi u. <verse eid="ACT 17:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 17:18" />I dobga ki Abikuliyawa nǝ Sitokiyawa mi' ma' lǝɓa is gob shotti bi ne'ti. Nami ge'si ngemi, “Ya mul shilǝn hutu ɗǝ lyap dlǝmti ngu?” I gen usu, “Ɗǝ yedli mul bǝtl lya ki Atlen kǝni.” Sǝ dlǝmǝn gu u gaki Bulus ɗǝ dlǝp shilǝn mul tǝmti tǝn Yesu nǝ hillya was ge' mi'mǝshti. <verse eid="ACT 17:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 17:19" />Is kanti is tolti tǝn ɗani ki Alasa, lu unǝ mil dlǝtl shilǝn ɗǝ dopga ɗa u alǝbi is ultisu, “Kǝn dlimimi yakǝn pyal kushti u ɗǝ mbillitiya? <verse eid="ACT 17:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 17:20" />Ki mbǝllimi sǝmbǝl shilǝn a kǝm ɗami, mi' lyamti tǝn man ulnǝ ɗǝ dlǝmti u.” <verse eid="ACT 17:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 17:21" />(Mus Atinawa ne' sǝmbǝlsi ginǝ ɗǝ dǝb Atina u, si dǝb katl ba pǝtl ulǝn, amma sai kub sǝmbǝl shilǝn, nǝ mbǝlti tǝnki.) <verse eid="ACT 17:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 17:22" />I Bulus hilya a dlom ki mi' dlǝtl shilǝn i' usu: “Mbalǝn ki Atina! Ayeni i hu tǝn shitu u kǝni kini mi' ngau ma' Lya kǝni. <verse eid="ACT 17:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 17:23" />Nǝ ami duttya u, ami ya' ulnǝ ki pǝli' mi'bǝtl Lya u, hal ya mbi bagadi ki kyetl lǝɓa nǝ lashti tǝnki ɗǝ usu: Tǝn Lya u nǝ bǝ mantwai u. To ulnǝ ki bǝtlti kalu ki manǝntwai gu a mbǝ ta dlimi kini. <verse eid="ACT 17:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 17:24" />“Lya unǝ pǝl dǝb lǝɓa nǝ mus ulnǝ giɓi u tikǝ Lya ki lya nǝ atli tiɗa dǝbge' lu dobga u nǝ mbalǝn kǝni nǝ toh uwai. <verse eid="ACT 17:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 17:25" />Nǝgu ni tiɗa ngau ɗǝtl ma' mbalǝnwai. Amma t inǝ gawas kǝn tibǝl mus mbalǝn dli nǝ shu'ti nǝ mus lǝɓa. <verse eid="ACT 17:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 17:26" />Tǝn mul nǝm kǝn tǝpǝl mus mbalǝn, gaki sǝ dǝb hu una adǝp lǝɓa ɗa; idlillisi dǝmtwasǝn nǝ bisi ki atlwasǝn. <verse eid="ACT 17:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 17:27" />Lya pǝlǝn gu u gaki sǝn ngauti ɗa agon as mbiti, ko nǝ bǝ tiɗa lolu nǝ nǝmi nǝn wai u. <verse eid="ACT 17:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 17:28" />‘Gaki tu' ma'ti mǝ mbi dli ɗa, ami mallǝd ɗa nǝ ndal lǝɓa inǝn ɗa.’ Kan unǝ na mi' utl ulwakǝn dlimi' u, ‘Mima u nduwas kǝni.’ <verse eid="ACT 17:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 17:29" />“Gaki nǝgu tun nǝ mini gǝski Lya kǝn u, mǝkǝn usu kǝnǝ zinaliya ko azulpa, ko yegǝn wai, ulnǝ mulǝn pǝli' nǝ manti wasi. <verse eid="ACT 17:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 17:30" />A te'ɓo Lya a zakǝn mbalǝn ge' lǝshi matiwasǝn, amma nǝguni ti bǝl mbalǝn zhil hu a una sǝppal tem ma' Lya. <verse eid="ACT 17:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 17:31" />Tun nǝ ta zi dǝblǝɓa cin ki zǝ' ɓatlti ki ci'gontu, tu' ma' mulnǝ' la'tu. Tǝn tlǝlti mulu ɗǝ ge' mi'mǝshti ila mbalǝn ɗǝ ndǝti.” <verse eid="ACT 17:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 17:32" />Nǝs kum shilǝn ki mi'tlǝllya ge' mi'mǝshtu, i nami la'ki'bi, amma i nami usu, “Mi lyab kub ki ɗaɗanu tǝn shilǝn u.” <verse eid="ACT 17:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 17:33" />Tǝn gu Bulus za'si. <verse eid="ACT 17:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 17:34" />Nami ge' mbalǝni is bǝl Bulus kal is la'mbadli. Age' si hal ni Diyonisiya, yakǝn majelisa ki Alasa, nǝ kǝlion mul shin Damalisa, ne'gen.<verse eid="ACT 17:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 17" />
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="ACT 18" />
  <para style="s">Bulus a Kolanti</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 18:1" />Kalkǝ gu, i Bulus za' Atina illǝ Kolanti. <verse eid="ACT 18:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 18:2" />Tyaka is ma isǝ mul Yahudu won mul shin Akila, atl zǝtti ki Pantas, ta lǝndǝb patl su' Italiya uwai nǝ kǝli wasi Biliskila, gaki Kalaudiyas bǝl zhil mus Yahudawa sǝ'za' Loma. I Bulus lǝɗǝ yas si. <verse eid="ACT 18:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 18:3" />Gaki kyautǝn wasǝn nǝm kǝni ki tlotlti tanti ni, iddǝmi ati kyautǝn ne'si. <verse eid="ACT 18:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 18:4" />Mus cin shuti ati shotti bi nesi a ge'lu dobga ki Yahudawa, ati tle ga ki Yahudawa ne' ginǝ bǝ Yahudawa wai u. <verse eid="ACT 18:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 18:5" />Nǝki Sila nǝ Timothy pe'te' Makidoniya, i Bulus gob mbǝtl dlǝb shilǝn ki Lya tǝnki, ati mboki Yahudawa toh Yesu tikǝ Almasihu. <verse eid="ACT 18:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 18:6" />Amma is nge dlǝmti ki Bulus asi byatlti, ibba bat lulutwas taka i' ulsisu, “Hwula wakǝn a ga wakǝn! Ulǝn alakǝn wai. Nǝguni an lǝti ma' ginǝ bǝ Yahudawai u. <verse eid="ACT 18:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 18:7" />I Bulus za'lu dobga ki Yahudawa illǝtǝn dlabi libi ki Titus Yustus, mul bǝdl Lya libi wasi nja nǝ lu dopga ki Yahudawa. <verse eid="ACT 18:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 18:8" />I Kilibus, mul kina ki lu dobga, ne' mus libi wasi is la' mbatl nǝ Lya; Kolantiyawa dǝɓǝli mi' kub Bulus is la' mbadlǝ i pǝlisi baptisma. <verse eid="ACT 18:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 18:9" />A ge' gason i Lya shilǝn nǝ Bulus ge' tlu'ti: “Bǝkum ɓantwai; gob shilǝn ki Lya, bi dǝm shotwai. <verse eid="ACT 18:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 18:10" />Gaki ami miki, mulǝn kǝn tile' ki dlati a' kumi' ciwowai, ami nǝ mbalǝn diɓǝli age' gatlu.” <verse eid="ACT 18:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 18:11" />I Bulus dǝm a Kolanti ti kulcissi shilǝn ki Lya, hwon nǝm nǝ bwasti dlom. <verse eid="ACT 18:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 18:12" />Amma nǝ Galiyo ɗǝ mul kina ki atl ki Akaya u, i Yahudawa ki Kolinti is maga is tlih Bulus nǝ mbatl nǝm is mbǝlti akina ɗǝ mi'pǝlt shilǝn. <verse eid="ACT 18:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 18:13" />“Mulgu,” si usu, “Ti tle ga ki mbalǝn sǝbbǝl Lya tǝn shitu u nǝ bǝ zhil kǝn wai u.” <verse eid="ACT 18:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 18:14" />Nǝ Bulus ɗǝ lyap shilǝn u, i Galiyo ulsisu, “Kini Yahudawa ki shilǝn tǝn lati asǝn giɓi u, tǝ kapbi pǝldli ma u, da an gaki' kin kǝm. <verse eid="ACT 18:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 18:15" />Amma tun nǝ shoti bi katl ki lǝntu, nǝ shin nǝ zhil lwakǝn u likǝnin nǝ gawakǝn. Akǝn shilǝnti tǝn undǝ giwai.” <verse eid="ACT 18:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 18:16" />Iki i' katsi taka ɗǝ bidla pǝtl shilǝn. <verse eid="ACT 18:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 18:17" />I mbalǝn ki lǝbi is gop Sastanisu mul kina ki lu dobga is li'ti a kina ɗǝ lu pǝtl shilǝn; amma Galiyo ta pǝl ulǝn tǝn kiwai.<verse eid="ACT 18:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">I Bulus pal tya Antakiya ki Suliya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 18:18" />I Bulus lǝm mutti a Kolinti. Is za' yelsǝni mudli nǝ mwanǝ it tege' kundǝlǝn ki mal illǝ Siliya, nǝ Biliskila nǝ Akila. Kapin tǝzzaga, i' utl ga taka a Kakiliya gaki dlǝtlti u nǝ' pǝli u. <verse eid="ACT 18:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 18:19" />Is mbǝkǝci Apisa, alǝbi Bulus za' Biliskila nǝ Akila. Tinǝ gawasi it te'ge' lu dobga ti shotti bi ne' Yahudawa. <verse eid="ACT 18:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 18:20" />Nǝs ngemti tǝl lǝm dǝp ne' si u, in nge. <verse eid="ACT 18:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 18:21" />Amma nǝ' pal bi ne' si u, i' usu, “Anpalti teɗi in Lya a ndǝgu.” Iki is za' Apisa i' tege' kundǝlǝn ki mal. <verse eid="ACT 18:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 18:22" />Nǝm mbǝkǝci a Kaisaliya u, illǝ Ulshelima it shin ni Ikilisiya iki illǝ Antakiya. <verse eid="ACT 18:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 18:23" />Kalki lǝb muttwas tya Antakiya, i Bulus hiliya ɗǝlǝbi i' gob lǝt tya ge' lu nǝ lu ge' atl ki Galatiya nǝ Palijiya, ati ndǝlli' mi' bǝtl Yesu kal mbadli. <verse eid="ACT 18:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 18:24" />Iki i mul Yahudiya won mul shin Apolos, atl ki zǝtti ki Iskandaliya, immbǝ Apisa. Mul mallǝɓa ni, tǝ man shilǝn ki Lya ki lwabbati iye. <verse eid="ACT 18:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 18:25" />A kulci' shitu ki mal Lya yi, ti shilǝn ki Lya nǝ mbotlti, ti dlib lǝɓa tin Yesu kǝnǝ kan unǝ ɗa u, amma baptisma ki Yahaya tǝ mani katl. <verse eid="ACT 18:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 18:26" />Iki gob dlib shilǝn ki Lya bǝ nǝ ɓultwai age' lu dobga ki yahudawa. Amma nǝki Bilkisu nǝ Akila kumtu, is mbebbi a libi ɗasi ka is mbǝl dlimitti shitu ki mal Lya ɗa iye. <verse eid="ACT 18:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 18:27" />Nǝ Apolos lyam ɗakǝshti tya Akaya u, i yalsǝni ɗǝlti is laci mi'bǝtl Yesu kal sǝn njeti in ta mbǝ u, Mbǝkǝshtwasi ma ginǝ lambatl nǝ Yesu tu tǝn zo' lǝɓa ki mulban i dǝm nǝ dǝlti iye tǝnsi. <verse eid="ACT 18:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 18:28" />Gaki ta la' Yahudawa nǝ shotti bi mul ndǝlti iye ge' mbalǝn i, ti dlimissi tu' ge' lwabbati Yesu tikǝ Almasihu.<verse eid="ACT 18:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 18" />
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="ACT 19" />
  <para style="s">Bulus a Apisa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 19:1" />Apolos a Kolanti, i Bulus gandǝli ge'atli immbǝkǝci Apisa. Alǝbi immbi mil kushti yen. <verse eid="ACT 19:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 19:2" />I' ul sisu, “Nǝ' lakǝn mbadlu ka mbi Yal ki mbatl ki Lya wa?” Is ndǝgi, “Is ultisu, ma kum mbǝkǝ Yal ki mbatl ki Lya wai.” <verse eid="ACT 19:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 19:3" />I Bulus ngemi, “To unndǝ baptisma ukǝn ki mbini?” Baptisma ki Yahaya ni is usu. <verse eid="ACT 19:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 19:4" />I Bulus usu, “Baptisma ki Yahaya ɓo baptisma ki za'ti bezǝn lǝɓa ti pǝlti. Ti dlǝmi' mbalǝn sǝlla' mbatl nǝ mul mbǝ ge' kalwasi, tiki Yesu.” <verse eid="ACT 19:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 19:5" />Nǝs kumi nǝ gu u, i pǝlisi baptisma ge' shin ki mulban Yesu. <verse eid="ACT 19:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 19:6" />Nǝ Bulus zisi toh u, i Yal ki mbatl ki Lya mbisi, is gob shilǝn nǝ biyen, asi dlǝb shilǝn tǝn lǝɓa ki Lya. <verse eid="ACT 19:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 19:7" />Si mus mbalǝn kutl nǝ lop kǝn katl. <verse eid="ACT 19:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 19:8" />I Bulus tegge lu dobga ki Yahudawa ti' dlǝb shilǝn ki Lya bǝnǝ ɓantwai lii maki, ati shotti bi ne' si ati patlsi tettǝn shitu guk ki Lya. <verse eid="ACT 19:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 19:9" />Amma i nami pǝl ndǝtl ki ga is nge la'ti mbadli, si byatl shitu i akina ɗǝ mbalǝn. I Bulus za'si. I' emmi' bǝtl Yesu kal ati shilǝn ne' si hu cin ukǝni age' lu kushti ki lashti a Tilanas. <verse eid="ACT 19:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 19:10" />Hwon lob aɗǝ pǝtl gu, hal i mus Yahudawa ne' ginǝ bǝ Yahudawa wai u, ginǝ ɗǝ dǝb ge' atl ki Asiya u, is kum shilǝn ki Lya. <verse eid="ACT 19:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 19:11" />Tu' ma' Bulus, i Lya pǝl gagashin gunǝ bǝ a ki ɗǝ pǝtl dliwai u <verse eid="ACT 19:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 19:12" />Hal hankicin ko lulutwasi in sa tile mi' gontu, as ndoki a du mi' gatli za'si. <verse eid="ACT 19:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 19:13" />Na Yahudawa yen ginǝ ɗǝ duti ɗǝ katti du mi' gatli is lyap pǝtl shilǝn nǝ shin ki Yesu tǝn mi' bǝna nǝ du mi' gatli. Si ussu, “Ge'shin ki Yesu unǝ Bulus ɗǝ dlib shilǝn wasu, ami bǝtl kin zhil ki pe' ni.” <verse eid="ACT 19:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 19:14" />Mil nin ngi ki Siba, bal lǝɓa ki Yahudawa, siɗǝ pǝtl gu. <verse eid="ACT 19:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 19:15" />Gason i du mi'gatli ulsisu, “Aman Yesu, a man Bulus, amma kini ki wokǝni?” <verse eid="ACT 19:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 19:16" />I mul du mi' gatli pe' lya inndesi ga inngǝtl si nǝ ndǝlti mus. Ippǝlisi li'ton hal is pe'ɗǝ libini nǝ kitǝl bǝ nǝ lulutwai nǝ hwula adli. <verse eid="ACT 19:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 19:17" />Nǝgu, man dli ge' Yahudawa u, ne' Helinawa mi' dǝp Apisa, i kummwasǝn ɓutl gobsi, i shin ki Yesu mbi nalti. <verse eid="ACT 19:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 19:18" />Diɓǝli ge' mi' la'ti mbadli is mbǝ bǝ ki hwuniwai a si dlǝb ulnǝs pǝli u. <verse eid="ACT 19:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 19:19" />Mbalǝn diɓǝli mi' pǝtl gonti is mbil ulpǝtl gontwasǝn ge' lu kǝnǝmi i kwetldli a kina ɗǝ mbalǝn. Nǝs cimbǝl natl ki lwabbatu is en nǝn pǝt up ki azulpa zangu kutl lǝbi nantam. <verse eid="ACT 19:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 19:20" />Tu' nǝgu i shilǝn ki Lya mbǝl tǝnki nǝ ndilti. <verse eid="ACT 19:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 19:21" />Kalki ndakkǝ mus usi, i Bulus kǝndi ge' mbadlwasi tǝs su' Ulshelima, abbǝli tu' Makidoniya nǝ a Akaya. I' usu, kal ki alǝ tya ka, nǝ ngessi kǝn ta suti Loma.” <verse eid="ACT 19:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 19:22" />I' shin lop mi' ɗǝtlti, Timothy nǝ Alastas, swa Makidoniya, tine inna' lǝmdǝp ge' atl ki Asiya. <verse eid="ACT 19:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 19:23" />Age' cin u ndǝl dlakǝn pǝl dli a tǝn shitu ki bǝtl Yesu. <verse eid="ACT 19:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 19:24" />Mul guptishugupon ɗa ti gubti palpalu mul shin Dimitiliyas, mul pǝtl Azulpa ki lu dobga ki Altimas, ɗǝ mbǝlli' mi' pǝtl ulti nǝ ultitaka lǝkkina alǝbi. <verse eid="ACT 19:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 19:25" />Immbe sibi ge' lu kǝnǝmi, ne' mi' kyautǝn ginǝ ɗǝ pǝtl undi ulti nǝ ulti taka u, i' usu: “Kini yelǝnsi, ini ki manini ma mbi lǝkkinaki zoki i tǝn ulti nǝ ultita gu i. <verse eid="ACT 19:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 19:26" />Ki yenti a ki kumti kan unǝ mi' bǝtl Bulus kal ɗǝ tle ga ki mbalǝn aki a Apisa, nǝ mus Atlki Asiya. Ti usu lya unǝ pǝldli nǝ toh u lya kǝn wai. <verse eid="ACT 19:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 19:27" />I ngu kuma bǝna ɗa kina kǝni, bǝ ulti nǝ ultitaka u ti hwol zo'shin wai, amma hal nǝ bal libi ki lya ki Altimas nǝn dǝmti kǝnǝ baliwai; ginǝ ɗǝ bǝtl lya a Asiya nǝ tǝn dib lǝɓa u, nǝn bwastiti nǝ naltwasi.” <verse eid="ACT 19:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 19:28" />Nǝs kum gu u, i mbatl lewisi is tlǝl yal lya: “Natl tǝn Altimas ki Apisawa!” <verse eid="ACT 19:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 19:29" />Lǝbdǝb ten i gatli hwodǝli. Imbalǝn gob dǝtl Gayus nǝ Alistalkus, yelǝnsi dukkǝ Bulus su' Makidoniya, muswasǝn is dlewsi tya lu dopga. <verse eid="ACT 19:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 19:30" />Bulus lyam lǝ' kina ɗǝ hwu mbalǝn, amma imil kushtiwas haneti. <verse eid="ACT 19:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 19:31" />Hal ne' na bas mbalǝn ki atl ki Asiya, yelǝnsi ki Bulus, is taki' shinkǝn tǝn bǝga shelti tǝppe' dlawai. <verse eid="ACT 19:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 19:32" />Mbalǝn i nǝ dom ga u is hwodǝli: Nami ɗǝ tlǝl Yal ɗǝ dlǝb gwasǝn a gen ɗǝ dlǝb gwasǝn. Na mbalǝni sǝman ulnǝ lakiɗa is domga uwai. <verse eid="ACT 19:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 19:33" />I Yahudawa kǝge mbalǝni is jakǝn Iskanadali tya kina, is tlǝl Yal si pǝtl shilǝn tǝnti. I' uu toh tǝ dǝm shot gaki ɓulti' dlati. <verse eid="ACT 19:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 19:34" />Amma nǝs mani mul Yahudiya u, i mus sǝ tlǝl yel lya ki dom lop: asi usu, “Natl tǝn Altimas ki Apisawa!” <verse eid="ACT 19:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 19:35" />Nǝ mul kina ki Lashti lwabbat kǝge' gatli shel mbalǝn u, i' usu: “Kini Apisawa, okǝn mani ki gatl ki Apisawa ɗǝ ɓutti bal libi nǝ shishipti ki Altimas swai, nǝ yegǝn u nǝ nda sul lya uwaiya? <verse eid="ACT 19:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 19:36" />Tun nǝ bǝkǝn ma'shot tibi tǝn usi wai u, nǝn mbunti ki muɗǝlǝn mbadlwakǝn bǝ' pǝlǝn ulǝn nǝ kitilwai. <verse eid="ACT 19:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 19:37" />I ngu ka mbǝllǝn mbalǝn i ki i, si kuma sa mǝgǝl age' libi niwai bǝ sa pǝl bezǝn ulǝn alǝbi wai. <verse eid="ACT 19:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 19:38" />In Dimitiliyas ne' yelǝnsi ultitakawasi shilǝn nisiɗa ne' mulǝn u, lu pǝtl shilǝn kǝnngu ki ɓuli mi' dlǝtl shilǝn kǝnngi. A' tǝla dlǝmti. <verse eid="ACT 19:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 19:39" />Amma in ulǝn ki lyab mbǝlliti u, to a' telen kina ɗǝ mi' dlǝtl shilǝn. <verse eid="ACT 19:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 19:40" />Nǝguɗa mige' bǝna ki, pǝtl shilǝn ki nditl kiga ki ulnǝ nda sǝti u. Tǝn shilǝn gu mǝkǝn ma' dlib ulǝn tǝnkiwai, tun nǝ bǝ shutu was ɗawai u.” <verse eid="ACT 19:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 19:41" />Kal ki dlǝb gu, ippalli mbalǝn bi.<verse eid="ACT 19:41" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 19" />
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="ACT 20" />
  <para style="s">Bulus a paltya Makidoniya nǝ Hellas</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 20:1" />Kal ki mutti ki mbatl ki mbalǝn, i Bulus mbe milkushti was bi kal ki ndǝllissi mbadlǝ, ippallisi bi illǝ tya Makidoniya. <verse eid="ACT 20:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 20:2" />Iddu tya ge' lǝbǝ, ti dlǝmi' mbalǝn dǝɓǝli shilǝn ki ndǝtlki mbadlǝ, ngwaltwasi immbǝ'ci ge' atl ki Hellas, <verse eid="ACT 20:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 20:3" />akikǝn tǝ dǝmmi li maki. Nǝ na Yahudawa yen akǝndǝ biwasu, nǝ' ɓal nja ki tǝ' tege' kundǝlǝn ki malu tǝllǝ Suluya, i' kǝndi tǝ patl tya tu' Makidoniya. <verse eid="ACT 20:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 20:4" />Ti isǝ' Sopata yakǝnkǝ Palus te' Beleya, Alistalkus nǝ Sakundas mbalǝn ki Tasalonika, nǝ Gayus mul Dalbe, Timoti nǝ Tikikus nǝ Talopimas, mbalǝn ki atl ki Asiya. <verse eid="ACT 20:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 20:5" />Mbalǝn ginǝs zǝga kina u is ɓummi a Taluwasa. <verse eid="ACT 20:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 20:6" />Amma in za' Pilibi ge' kundǝlǝn ki mal kal daddaɓǝl gunǝ bǝ yisti nit ɗawai u, in mbisi a Taluwasa kalki mutti nantam. In dǝm lǝbi mutti ningi.<verse eid="ACT 20:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Dopga ki patl bi a Taluwasa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 20:7" />Ge' cin ki nǝm ki mutti ningi in mbǝ ɗǝ ɗamti ki catl bǝledi. I Bulus dlǝmi mbalǝn shilǝn, gaki ti lyab zǝ'ga lucili, i' gob dlǝb shilǝni hal a dlom gasi. <verse eid="ACT 20:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 20:8" />Cilti ɗa dǝɓǝli ge' libi ki lya u nǝn domga ɗa u. <verse eid="ACT 20:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 20:9" />Yakǝn gidǝnsi won ti ki dǝmi tǝn dlabi ko' yetil mulshin Aptikos, i yemmbu' kanti nǝ Bulus lǝndǝp ɗǝ shilǝn u. Nǝ yemmbu' kantu, tikǝ dǝmi ge' kǝps ki lya mul lu tom maki innda su'atli i kanti hwuni. <verse eid="ACT 20:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 20:10" />I Bulus pe'su' atli, im muttwatǝn yakǝn giɗǝnsi isi it kucenti, i'usu. “Bǝ hwok kiniwai,” “Ti kami!” <verse eid="ACT 20:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 20:11" />I ki ippal twage' kǝps ki lya ni ɗaɗanu itcel biledi it ɗami. I' gob shilǝn halcitlkǝlu izza' lǝbǝ. <verse eid="ACT 20:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 20:12" />I mbalǝn kan yakǝn giɗinsi i tya libi kahmi, is kum hwoltugi iye.<verse eid="ACT 20:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Bulus palli Kolsi ki Apisawa bi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 20:13" />Mine in ndakina in tege' kundǝlǝn ki mali illǝ tya Asus, ge'lu unǝ tǝn kan Bulus ɗa u. Nǝgu tǝ kǝndini tǝn tǝllǝ tyaka tǝn asǝn. <verse eid="ACT 20:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 20:14" />Nǝm mbimi a Asus u, inkanti ge' kundǝlǝn ki mal in mbǝ a Mitilini. <verse eid="ACT 20:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 20:15" />Lucili in tege' kundǝlǝn ki mal tekka in mbǝ'ci a Kiyos. Lucili ɗanu in ɗakǝci tya Samas, lucili ɗanu in mbǝkǝci a Militas. <verse eid="ACT 20:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 20:16" />Bulus kǝndi tǝd ɗakǝsh Apisa ge' kundǝlǝn ki mal gaki kitǝli' dlǝtl a Asiya, gaki ti dleuti tǝm mbǝkǝci Ulshelima ɗa, in nǝn pǝtu, tǝn cinkǝ pentikos. <verse eid="ACT 20:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 20:17" />Te' a Milita, i Bulus shinshin kǝn tya Apisa tǝn kolsi ki ge'lu dobga ki shilǝn ki Lya. <verse eid="ACT 20:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 20:18" />Nǝs mbǝci matu, i' ulsisu: “Ki manǝn kan u nadǝm ge' kini u, tun ga siu na mbǝ ge' atlki Asiya u. <verse eid="ACT 20:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 20:19" />Ami bǝtl' Lya nǝ zo' mbadli hal nǝ luu, nǝ bǝna diɓǝli na tle gaki ɗashti ki tu' ki na Yahudawa. <verse eid="ACT 20:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 20:20" />Ki manǝn kan u nǝ bǝ a kum ɓakkǝ dlib ulnǝ nǝn ɗǝtl kini uwai u, ya dlimikini ge' mbalǝn nǝ libi libi bǝkǝ hwuniwai. <verse eid="ACT 20:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 20:21" />Ami dlimi' Yahudawa ne' mi' ginǝ bǝ Yahudawa wai u sǝppal ma' Lya nǝ ngesi as dlim bezǝn lǝɓawasǝn as la'mbatl tǝn Yesu. <verse eid="ACT 20:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 20:22" />In ngu Yal ki mbatl ki Lya, ɗǝ tǝntǝni talǝ Ulshelima, aman ulnǝ tǝ ndani ami uwai. <verse eid="ACT 20:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 20:23" />Amani katl hu gatlu kǝni Yal ki mbatl ki Lya ɗǝ dlimitǝni kǝndǝti nǝ tle' bǝna ɗǝ ɓuttǝni. <verse eid="ACT 20:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 20:24" />Ngo' nǝnǝgu, a pal gayi ulǝnwai; Lyamti ki mbadlini iki ta pa' taltu a njikǝn ulnǝ Yesu bǝlǝn u, dlǝb zo shilǝn tǝmi ki Lya. <verse eid="ACT 20:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 20:25" />Nǝguni a mani muswakǝn kǝkǝn yentǝn nǝwai, kini u na bǝlkin tyai ɗǝ dlǝb shilǝn ki guk ki Lya u. <verse eid="ACT 20:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 20:26" />Gaki nǝgu, ami dlǝmikkin asǝti, ape' ɗǝge' alhaki ki hwula wakǝn i. <verse eid="ACT 20:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 20:27" />Gaki a kum ɓakkǝ dlimikkin mus ngati ki Lya wai. <verse eid="ACT 20:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 20:28" />Ɓutǝn gawakǝn, nǝ kuma mus hwu mbalǝn nǝ Yal ki mbatl ki Lya pǝli kini, dǝmni mi'zǝ' dwaɗǝn tǝnsi u, dǝmni mi' byatl mi'bǝtl Yesu kal ginǝ' ulsi nǝ hwulawasu. <verse eid="ACT 20:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 20:29" />Amani kal ki zǝgga ini, mi'ɗashti ki tugen nǝn teti ge' kini, sǝkǝn kub ciggokǝ hwu mbalan i wai. <verse eid="ACT 20:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 20:30" />Age' kini ma mbalǝn yen nǝn tlǝttoɗi, as gǝl bali gaki sǝddǝli gawasǝn mi'bǝtlsi kal ɗa. <verse eid="ACT 20:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 20:31" />Gaki nǝgu dlilni gal! Dambilini, hwon maki ngu aza' pikkin shilǝn wai gasi nǝ dloncin, hal nǝ lu. <verse eid="ACT 20:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 20:32" />Nǝguni ami za'tikin toh ɗǝ Lya, nǝ zo shilǝn wasi, i likǝ' kini abbǝlkin gado ne' mus mi'zo' mbadli. <verse eid="ACT 20:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 20:33" />Azi dwaɗǝn tǝn upki ko lulut ki mulǝnwai. <verse eid="ACT 20:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 20:34" />Kini nǝgawakǝn ki manini toh i kǝn ɗǝ bǝltǝn ulnǝ ami lyamti u, nǝ ki mi'ginǝ ami ne'si u. <verse eid="ACT 20:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 20:35" />Age' mus ulna pǝli u, ami nune' kini, tu'tǝn ɓotlti kyautǝn hwel kǝn tǝ ɗǝlǝn mi'lǝshi ndǝtl ɗa, aki dambǝtl shilǝn ki Yesu nǝ usu: “Bǝlti ngǝtl kanti nǝ albalka.’ ” <verse eid="ACT 20:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 20:36" />Nǝ Bulus ngwatl shilǝn wasu, in ngus atl mus ne'si is shilǝn nǝ Lya. <verse eid="ACT 20:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 20:37" />I muswasǝn is go' kulu, is kucen Bulus asi swattiti. <verse eid="ACT 20:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 20:38" />Ulnǝ mbǝllisi du mbadlu iki shilǝn wasu nǝ' usu sǝkǝn yetti nuwai u. Iki is la'ti shitu tyama' kundǝlǝn ki mal.<verse eid="ACT 20:38" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 20" />
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="ACT 21" />
  <para style="s">Lǝkkǝ Bulus Swa Ulshelima</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 21:1" />Kal ki bwastimi ne'si, inte ge' kundǝlǝn inta'mi swa Kos, lucili insu Lodas nǝ Patala. <verse eid="ACT 21:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 21:2" />Nǝm mbi kundǝlǝn mul ɗakǝshti tya ge' atli ki Pinikiya u, inte giɓi inziga. <verse eid="ACT 21:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 21:3" />Nǝn yen Saipulus te'ka u inpalti tǝn tona, in ɓew kina ɗǝlǝ' ge atl ki Suliya, in shiti a Taya, alǝbi tǝ kundǝlǝn ki mali shi' kayawasi. <verse eid="ACT 21:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 21:4" />Nǝn mbi lu u nǝ milkushti ɗa u in dǝm ne'si mutti ningi. Tǝn ndǝtl ki Yal ki mbatl is pi Bulus bǝllǝ Ulshelima wai. <verse eid="ACT 21:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 21:5" />Amma nǝ cin tlǝti nǝn pǝ u, in hilya in ɓew kina ɗǝ lǝti. Muswasǝn, mudli nǝ mil, is la'mi shitu tya kal gatli, iki ingus a tǝn bǝgasi in shilǝn nǝ Lya. <verse eid="ACT 21:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 21:6" />Kal ki palli' yelsǝni bi inǝn, inte ge' kundǝlǝn, sine ispal tya libi. <verse eid="ACT 21:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 21:7" />In gop lǝti nǝn a Taya u in mbǝci Talamayas, inshinni yelsǝni, in mun nǝm ma'si. <verse eid="ACT 21:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 21:8" />Lucili in hilya inmbǝ Kaisaliya, in tye libi ki Pilibus mul dlǝp shilǝn ki Lya, gunǝ nǝmkǝni ge' ningi i' u. <verse eid="ACT 21:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 21:9" />Tinǝ mil mudli upsi, ginǝ bǝ apǝl ki nditi wai u ginǝ ɗǝ dlǝb lǝɓa ki Lya. <verse eid="ACT 21:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 21:10" />Kal ki mutti ten alǝbi, i mul njeshinkǝn ki Lya won mbǝ, shinwasi Agabus immbǝ te' atl Yahudiya. <verse eid="ACT 21:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 21:11" />Nǝmmbǝ ma'mi u, i' kan ul kǝndǝ dlom ki Bulus i' kǝndǝ toh nǝ asǝnwasi, i' usu “Ulnǝ Yal ki mbatl ki Lya dlǝmi u ngu, ‘Nǝgu Yahudawa ki Ulshelima sǝn kǝndǝ mul ul kǝndǝ dlom u a bǝtlti atoh ɗǝ ginǝ bǝ Yahudawa wai u.’ ” <verse eid="ACT 21:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 21:12" />Nǝn kumi nǝgu u, mi ne' mbalǝn i nǝ lǝbi u in bǝl Bulus bi bǝ su Ulshelima wai. <verse eid="ACT 21:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 21:13" />I Bulus usu, I' usu “Yakǝn ki kulu aki calitǝn mbatl ɗa? A miɓo galkǝn aminɗa, amiɗa ɓultti' kǝndǝ twai sǝ lyami as tlo a Ulshelima tǝn shin ki mulban Yesu.” <verse eid="ACT 21:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 21:14" />Nǝ bǝta kum sheltwai u, indǝm shot, in usu “Tǝ Lya pǝl ulnǝ mbunitu.” <verse eid="ACT 21:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 21:15" />Kal ki gu, in kan shitu ki su' Ulshelima. <verse eid="ACT 21:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 21:16" />Na milkushti yen te' Kaisaliya is la'mi shitu is mbǝlmi libi ki mulshin Manason, lu unǝtǝn dlǝlɗa u. Mul ki Saipulus mul bǝl Lya hwon di ɓǝli.<verse eid="ACT 21:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Bǝ'citi ki Bulu a Ulshelima</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 21:17" />Nǝm mbǝ Ulshelima u, Yelsǝni inǝn njemi nǝ hwol tugi. <verse eid="ACT 21:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 21:18" />Nǝ cilt kǝlu i Bulus ziga ne'mi swa ma' Yakubu, kolsi Ki Ikilisiya mus asi ɗa. <verse eid="ACT 21:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 21:19" />Nǝ Bulus shinnissi u, itl' dlǝmisi shilǝn bi nǝ bi kǝ ulnǝ Lya pǝllitu age' mi'ginǝ bǝ Yahudawa wai u atǝn kyautǝn wasi. <verse eid="ACT 21:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 21:20" />Nǝs kumi nǝgu u, is nalt Lya. Is ul Bulus su: “Yani, zangu nǝmi Yelsǝni, Yahudawa bǝl mbadlwasǝn, ma' Lya singu mi'ndǝtl kǝ'mbatl kǝni ge' bǝtl zhil ki Musa. <verse eid="ACT 21:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 21:21" />Mbalǝn tle kup su usu tǝnki ɗǝ kulci' mus Yahudwa ginǝ bǝɗa ge' mbalan ki Musa wai u sǝ'dlat zhil ki Musa taka, ki dlǝmmisi bǝst sǝl millwasǝn ko as bǝl Lǝɓa ki kolsi inǝn wai. <verse eid="ACT 21:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 21:22" />Yakǝn tǝm pǝlini ngǝ? Katlti ɗawai sǝn kub mbǝtwa gi. <verse eid="ACT 21:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 21:23" />Gaki nǝgu pǝl ulnǝ tǝn piku. Mbalǝn upsi ni miɗa ginǝ kan dlǝlliti u. <verse eid="ACT 21:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 21:24" />Kan mbalǝn i, a bǝlǝn zhil ki kushti ki zo'ki mus, a' ɓatl mus ulpi sǝmbi sǝ' utl gaɗa. Tu' tǝn shitu gu, mus nǝn ma'dli ulnǝs dlǝmisi tǝnku, bali ɗa giɓiwai, amma ki gawagi ki bǝtl zhil ki Musa. <verse eid="ACT 21:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 21:25" />Tǝn ginǝ bǝ Yahudawa wai u mi'bǝtl Yesu kal, mashin lwabbat swai i tǝngaki bǝs ɗam ulki ɗami ki lya ki mi' pǝtl gontwai, bǝs pǝl kontwai bǝs ɗam tlu u nǝs ceti' yalu wai nǝ ɗap tlu nǝ hwula wai <verse eid="ACT 21:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 21:26" />Nǝlu cilu i Bulus kan mbalǝni asa likǝn gawasǝn i. I ki i' tege' libi ki Lya tǝ' dlǝmisi cin ngatlti ki likǝ' gawasǝn, nǝ bǝtl Lya lǝɓa ki ulkǝ okǝtl bezǝn lǝɓa ki ko wonngi wasǝn.<verse eid="ACT 21:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">A gop Bulus si</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 21:27" />Nǝ mutti ningi ɓal nja nǝpa'tu, gen ge' Yahudawa te'ge atl ki Asiya is yen Bulus ge' libi ki Lya. Is cokǝl hwu mbalǝn is gobti, <verse eid="ACT 21:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 21:28" />asi dulle asi ussu Yelsǝni inǝn Isla'ilawa, ɗǝlǝn mi! Mulgu ti ɗǝ kushti mbalǝn sǝ mbǝl mbalǝn inǝn nǝ zhilin nǝn nǝ lu u ɗaɗanu, immbǝl Helenawa yen i kon nǝ lu bǝlt Lya.” <verse eid="ACT 21:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 21:29" />(Gaki teɗi sa yen Bulus isǝ Tulopimus, mul Apisa, age' gatli, is eni kǝnǝ Bulus mbǝllǝnti ge' libi ki Lya.) <verse eid="ACT 21:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 21:30" />Mus gatli is hwodǝli mbalǝn is tlǝlte' nǝ kitǝl is gob Bulus is dǝlti twa dla ɗǝ ge' libi ki Lya, is dleusi ɗǝ le'dlabiyi. <verse eid="ACT 21:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 21:31" />Si ge' ngau shitu ki tlotti gu' u, i shilǝn lǝkina ɗǝ bali ki mi' ki ndǝ dlom ki Loman kise mus gatl ki Ulshelima ɗǝ dlati. <verse eid="ACT 21:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 21:32" />Alǝbi i' em mi'kǝ ndǝ'dlom ki Loma nǝ na ki bazi ki mi'kǝ ndǝ'dlom is tlǝ swa ge' hwu mbalǝn. Nǝ mbalǝni yen ki bali ki mi'kǝ ndǝ dlom nǝ mi'kǝ ndǝ' dlomwasu, is za' liti Bulus. <verse eid="ACT 21:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 21:33" />I bal mulkina ki ndǝ dlomi hilya i' gobti, i' laki sǝ'kǝndǝti nǝ zhim dom lob. Iki in gyem mi tikǝ on ngi ya tǝ pǝli. <verse eid="ACT 21:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 21:34" />Nami ge' hwu mbalǝn ni si la'ti yali gi ɗǝ dlǝp shilǝnwasi gen ɗǝ dlǝb gwasǝn. Gaki o'tilu diɓǝli hal bali i' ambi gǝs ki bal shilǝni wai, il laki sǝ'tǝla Bulus ge'lu dǝb kǝmi' kǝndǝ'dlom. <verse eid="ACT 21:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 21:35" />Nǝ Bulus mbǝ tǝn lu dǝkǝsti u, sai nǝ mi'kǝndǝ'dlom kanti ki kami gaki tlǝl mi'gatl ki mbalǝn. <verse eid="ACT 21:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 21:36" />Dopga ki mbalǝn i nǝ bǝlsi teɗu asi la'ti yali asi ussu, “Mi tloti!”<verse eid="ACT 21:36" /></para>
  <para style="s">Bulus Shilǝn nǝ mbalǝn</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 21:37" />Nǝ ɓal ki mi'kǝndǝ'dlom tǝla Bulus a ge'lu dǝb ki mi'kǝndǝ dlomu, i' ul mulkina ki mi'kǝndǝ'dlomi su, “Kǝn ndǝti ta shilǝn mika?” “Ki manǝn shilǝn “Nǝbi ki Hellenanci ɓo?” <verse eid="ACT 21:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 21:38" />“Kikǝ’ mul masal mulu wai wa? Gunǝ hwon ki te'kal nǝ ɓye u, i' tlǝlli mbalǝn ndǝlt Kǝga, hal it dǝl mbalǝn za'ngu upsi mi'tlwam mbalǝn a ge' delgǝn u” <verse eid="ACT 21:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 21:39" />I Bulus ndǝgi, Ami mul Yahudiya ni, te' Talsus age' atl Ki Kilikiya, ami Yakan gatl kǝni gatlu nǝ si kumti nǝ nali u. Mmi bǝtl ki bi zakǝni tapi Mbalǝn i shilǝn.” <verse eid="ACT 21:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 21:40" />Nǝmul kina ki mi'kǝndǝ dlom bǝlti shilǝn u, i Bulus dlǝltǝn gǝbsi i' ta'ki hwu' mbalǝn toh lya is dǝm shot, muswasǝn ishinnisi nǝ bikǝ Alamaya.<verse eid="ACT 21:40" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 21" />
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="ACT 22" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 22:1" />“Yelsǝni nemi' zǝ'mini, kumǝn nǝ ni ta dlǝmikin ulnǝ nda u, gaki ta pikini a pǝl bezǝn ulǝn wai.” <verse eid="ACT 22:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 22:2" />Nǝs kummi tashin nisi nǝ biki Alamaya u, is dǝmciw. I Bulus usu <verse eid="ACT 22:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 22:3" />“Ami mul Yahudiyani, zǝkkǝ Talsus ki Kilikiya, age' gatlu anali. Ami mul kushtini amalgǝn ɗǝ Gamaliel gunǝ kulci zhil ki mi'zǝ'mi'zǝm mini u. Ami nǝ ɓotlti ki bǝlt Lya kǝnǝ kan unǝ muswakǝn ki pǝltin sǝ'ti u. <verse eid="ACT 22:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 22:4" />Hal a la ki mbalǝn ɓutl ki bǝtl shitu u i, ami gobti mwani nǝ mudli a kǝndǝsi a atlosi. <verse eid="ACT 22:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 22:5" />Bal lǝɓa nǝ mus mi' dlǝtl shilǝnwasi nǝn ziti nǝ dwaɗǝn. Ama'si akan shinkǝn ki elsǝni ini Yahudawa yasuli swa Dimascus, Ya ɓeu ɗǝ gopti mbalǝn ta sulsi ge' lu kǝnndǝ' mbalǝn ki Ulshelima as pǝlisi bezǝn'lǝɓa.<verse eid="ACT 22:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Bulus dlǝm u ndi patltem ma' Lya wasi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 22:6" />“Amige' lǝti a bal dloncin na ɓal nja nǝ Dimashku u, bǝnǝ mantiwai i bal ciltton pe'sul lya i ga ndǝlǝni. <verse eid="ACT 22:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 22:7" />Ya nda atli yakum ya lon ɗǝ ultǝnsu, Shawulu! Shawulu! Yaki pǝlitǝn bezǝn lǝɓaɗa?’<verse eid="ACT 22:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 22:8" />“Yandǝgi ‘Ki wokǝni, mul ban?’ I' ulǝnsu. ‘Amiki Yesu mul Nazaleh, mulnǝ ki pǝllitti ngashtu.’ <verse eid="ACT 22:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 22:9" />To, ginǝ ne' kǝn i yen ciltisi, amma sakum yal ki mul shilǝn nǝ amiwai. <verse eid="ACT 22:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 22:10" />Ya usu ‘To, ya tapǝli, mulban?’ I mul ban ulǝnsu “ ‘hilya, ki'lǝ Dimascus, tyaka sǝ' dlǝmi' ulnǝ' ki' pǝli u.’ <verse eid="ACT 22:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 22:11" />Na dǝm dwa u gaki ciltu. Mbalǝn i nǝ' ne' kǝn u is goppi toh is sullǝn swa Damascus, <verse eid="ACT 22:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 22:12" />“Mulǝn ɗa mulshin Hananiyi immbǝ makǝni. Ti mul bǝtl zhil ki musa mulnǝ mus Yahudawa ki dǝmi alǝbi ɗǝ ndwatiti u. <verse eid="ACT 22:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 22:13" />Nǝ' dlǝl malgǝn ɗa kǝn u, i' ulǝnsu, Yelse ini Shawulu, tǝ Yelluwa' pali!’ A lǝbi a lǝbi idwaɗǝn i ɓuli Ya yenti. <verse eid="ACT 22:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 22:14" />I' usu, ‘Lya ki kolsi inǝn a olki gaki ki man ulnǝ ge' mbadlwasu, Kin ye' mul zoki mbatlu, kǝn kub shilǝn abiwasi. <verse eid="ACT 22:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 22:15" />Kǝn dǝp mul pǝtl yenti ki dwaɗǝn wasi ma' mus mbalǝn tǝn ulnǝ' enini nǝ ulnǝ kumini u. <verse eid="ACT 22:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 22:16" />To nǝgun u yaki ɓutti? Hilya, tǝ pǝli' Baptisma a o'kǝli' Bezǝn lǝɓawa' taka, tu' ma' mbe' shinwasi.’<verse eid="ACT 22:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 22:17" />“Na patl te' Ulshelima a ami shilǝn nǝ Lya age' libi ki Lya, i tlu'ti mbini. <verse eid="ACT 22:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 22:18" />Ya yen mulban ɗǝ shilǝn nǝ ami. I' usu, dlewki! Ki'za' Ulshelima, gaki mbalǝn aki sǝkǝn ndǝ'ti nǝ pǝtl yenti ki dwaɗǝn u nǝ ki dlǝmti tǝn kǝn uwai.’ <verse eid="ACT 22:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 22:19" />“ ‘Amine ya usu, mulban, ‘Sima gawasǝn sǝmani hu lu dobga ukǝni a kǝndǝ mbalǝn ginǝ la'mbatl tǝnku ya li'li'si. <verse eid="ACT 22:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 22:20" />Gasi unǝs bǝna hwula ki Istipanusu, mul pǝtl enti ki dwaɗinwagu, a ami lǝbi ki dlǝli, ami bǝlt kal ki ulnǝs pǝli u, amine ya ɓu' lulu' kǝmi' tlotti.’ <verse eid="ACT 22:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 22:21" />“I mulban ulǝnsu, ‘Hilya; ta shinki tya lolu ma' ginǝ bǝ Yahudawa wai u.’ ”<verse eid="ACT 22:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 22:22" />I mbalǝn dobga ɗǝ ga'ti kǝm tǝn shilǝn ki Bulus hal immbǝ tǝn shilǝn u ɗa, is tlǝl yal is usu “Tloti! Tǝ bwas undi mulu nǝ dǝb lǝɓa a mbuni tǝt dǝm tǝn lǝɓa wai!”<verse eid="ACT 22:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 22:23" />Asi matlti asi pe'ti lya nǝ dla'ti lulutwasǝn asi tlǝl kushka lya.<verse eid="ACT 22:23" /></para>
  <para style="s">Bulus a Loma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 22:24" />Imul kina wasǝn bǝl zhil ki sutl Bulus ge'lu dǝb ki mi'kǝndǝ' dlom. A gyemti nǝ dlamtǝl, gaki tǝn man shitu u nǝ laki i mbalǝn ɗǝ lakitti Yal ɗa nǝgu u. <verse eid="ACT 22:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 22:25" />Amma nǝ kǝndǝtti nǝ zhimu, i Bulus ul balmul kǝndǝ dlomu nǝ nja nǝti usu “A mbunni ki pǝli mul alt ki Loma dlamtǝlla, bǝka mbiti nǝ lati asǝn gimbi waiya?” <verse eid="ACT 22:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 22:26" />Nǝ bal mul kǝndǝ dlom ki Loma kumi nǝgu u, illǝmak mul bǝtl zhil ki kǝndǝ dlom i' ultisu, “Yaki lyab pǝltini? Mulu mul Loma ni.” <verse eid="ACT 22:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 22:27" />Imul bǝtl zhil ki kǝndǝ dlomi' ul Bulus su, “Dlǝmini ki mul Loma kǝma?” I' usu, “E.’’ <verse eid="ACT 22:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 22:28" />Imul bǝtl zhil ki kǝndǝ dlom, i' usu, amiciɓo sai na ɓatl bal ulpi ya mbi dǝb yakǝn atlɗa.” I Bulus usu, amiɓo nǝ nali sǝ zǝnni.” <verse eid="ACT 22:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 22:29" />Gaki nǝgu, ginǝ ɗǝ lyab gyebti u, is mbǝ gi nǝ kali alǝbi alǝbi. Mul bǝtl zhil ki kǝndǝ dlomi nǝm mani, ti gawasi ta kǝndǝ Bulus mul Loma u, i bult gopti, in ngu talǝge ta kǝndǝti.<verse eid="ACT 22:29" /></para>
  <para style="s">Bulus akina dǝ mi'dlǝl Shilǝn</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 22:30" />Nǝ lucilu mul bǝtl zhil ki kǝndǝ dlomi illyami tǝm man ulnǝ Yahudawa tǝla shilǝn tǝn Bulus ɗa u, ittǝngǝlti, idlǝllisi zhil nǝ bas lǝɓasi nǝ mik attli sǝddomga, apa immbǝl Bulus idl dlǝlti a kina wasǝn.<verse eid="ACT 22:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 22" />
  <chapter number="23" style="c" sid="ACT 23" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 23:1" />I Bulus uti mi'dlǝl shilǝn ki atl dwaɗǝn i' usu, “Yelsǝni ini, bǝtl Lya kǝn amiɗa nǝ mbatl ki zoki hal i mbǝl cin ki sǝti ɗa.” <verse eid="ACT 23:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 23:2" />Ananiya bal lǝɓa ki Lya ul ginǝ ki dlǝli nja ma' Bulus su sǝ'op biwasi. <verse eid="ACT 23:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 23:3" />I Bulus ultisu, “Ki mul ngashtu, “Lya nǝn litiki, ase, ki dǝmni ki u ɓo zitǝn zhil kǝn ki ɗaya, ki ngu ɗǝ usu tǝ duni, gu shot nǝ zhil ki Musa <verse eid="ACT 23:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 23:4" />Ginǝ ki dlǝli nja nǝ Bulus su is usu, “Bal lǝɓa ki Lya kǝn ki byel twa?” <verse eid="ACT 23:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 23:5" />I Bulus ulsisu, “Yelse ini, amani ti bal lǝɓa ki Lya kǝn wai, Ki laciɗa: ‘Bǝ'dlǝm bezen lǝɓa tǝn mul kina ki mbalǝn wai.’ ” <verse eid="ACT 23:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 23:6" />Nǝ Bulus yeni, nami Sadukiyawa ni nǝ gen Palisiyawa u, itltlǝl yal age' lu domga i' usu “Yelsǝni ini, A mi' mul palisiyawani, yakǝn Palisiyawa. Tǝn a dlil mbadli i tǝn tlǝl lya ki mi' mǝshti i ami tleb bǝna ɗa.” <verse eid="ACT 23:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 23:7" />Nǝ' dlǝmi nǝgu u, i dlan nda ge' dlom ki palisiyawa nǝ sadukiyawa, i dob gani bwǝsi. <verse eid="ACT 23:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 23:8" />(Amma Sadukiyawa sa ndǝ nǝ hillya gǝ' ki mi'mǝshti twai, bǝ mi'shinkǝn ki Lya ɗawai, bǝ yal ki mbatl ki Lya ɗawai, amma mus palisiyawa is ndǝ' nǝ nali.) <verse eid="ACT 23:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 23:9" />I bal dla' hillya, gen ge' mi'lashti ki ɗalika ki palisiyawa is tlǝlyal asi shottibi. Asi ussu “Miɓo mambi mulu nǝ bezen ulǝn wai,” is ussu. “Ko yalkǝ mbatl ki Lya ko mulshinkǝn ki Lya kǝn shilǝn nǝti u pa?” <verse eid="ACT 23:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 23:10" />Nǝ shotti bi i ndǝndǝlu i mul kǝndǝdlom kum mɓulti ɓas kyakkyash Bulus. I' bǝlsi zhil tǝ mi' kǝndǝdlom susuɗi sǝ' kanti ɗǝ ma'si nǝ ndǝlti sǝ' tǝlati ge'lu dobga ki mi' kǝndǝdlom. <verse eid="ACT 23:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 23:11" />Nǝ gas pǝ u i mulban dlǝl nja Nǝ Bulus i' ultisu, “Ndǝl mbadli kan u nǝ'pǝl enti nǝ dwaɗǝn a tǝnkǝn a Ulshelima u, nǝgu ki' pǝl enti nǝ dwaɗǝn ini ɗaɗanu a Loma.”<verse eid="ACT 23:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Sa Kǝndǝ i sǝ' tlo Bulus</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 23:12" />Nǝ lucilu i Yahudawa mabi is usu nǝ ndaltannaca sǝ' kǝn ɗamti nǝ tletiwai sai nǝ sa tlo Bulus. <verse eid="ACT 23:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 23:13" />Ginǝ kǝndǝ shilǝn u sǝ'ngǝtl mbalǝn kǝtl lǝbi upsi. <verse eid="ACT 23:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 23:14" />Is lǝ ma' bas lǝɓasi ki Lya nǝ mi'kina is usu, ma dlil bal tannaca i mǝkǝn ɗamtiwai nǝ tletiwai sai nǝ ma' tlo Bulus. <verse eid="ACT 23:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 23:15" />Gaki nǝgu kini nǝ mi'dlǝtl shilǝn dlǝmi mul'kina ki kǝndǝdlom sǝ' mbǝlli kinti, kǝnǝ ki' mbǝlǝn ngep gǝs ki shilǝn was tǝn kini iye mi kuma ki dlǝli tǝn asǝn kǝn mi'ɗa tǝn tloti nǝ mbǝtwasi. <verse eid="ACT 23:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 23:16" />Nǝ yakǝn ki yelse ki Bulus kumi nǝgu u i' suge' lukǝndǝ mbalǝnisi idlǝmi Bulus. <verse eid="ACT 23:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 23:17" />Iki Bulus taki bal mulkina ki kǝndǝ dlom gudǝl nǝm bi i' usu, “Kan yakǝn giɗǝnsi u ki tǝlati ma' mulkina; tinǝ shilǝn u nǝ tǝtl dlǝmi tu.” <verse eid="ACT 23:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 23:18" />I' kanti it tǝlati ma'mulkina, i' usu, “Bulus, ki lu ki kǝndǝn mbalǝn, shinǝni takami' yakǝn giɗǝsi u teɗi tǝn gaki ulki dlǝmi ni' ɗa.” <verse eid="ACT 23:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 23:19" />I mulkina ki kǝndǝ dlom goppi yakan giɗǝsi i' toh teɗi, amalgǝni in gyemti, “Yaki lyamti ki' dlǝmini?” <verse eid="ACT 23:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 23:20" />I usu: Yahudawa sa kǝndǝ i sǝ' gyemki ki mbǝlisi Bulus ma mi'dlǝl shilǝn akyau kǝnǝ sǝ' gyemti ki zokini tǝn shilǝnwasi. <verse eid="ACT 23:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 23:21" />Amma bǝ ndǝgisiwai, gaki mbalan ginǝ ngǝtl kutl lǝbi upsi siɓuttiti age' dǝlgǝn. Sa dlil bal ndaltannaca i sǝkǝn ɗamtiwai nǝ tletiwai sai nǝ sa tloti ɓutti sǝɗa katl ki ndǝgisi.” <verse eid="ACT 23:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 23:22" />I mul ki ndǝdlomi dǝlli' kǝmu i' za' yakǝngiɗǝnsi isi is zǝga nǝ: “Bǝ' dlǝmi mullǝn shilǝn u nǝ' dlǝmi uwai.”<verse eid="ACT 23:22" /></para>
  <para style="s">Is pal Bulus tya Kaisaliya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 23:23" />I mulkina mbe bas mi' kǝndǝdlom was gudǝli lob bi i' ulsisu, “Gadlǝn mi' kǝndǝ dlom kutlt cen lob nǝ mi' kǝndǝ dlom mi'to'tǝn bǝtsi, kult lǝbi ninngi, nǝ mi' dlati nǝ zo kult cen lob sǝ'su Kaisaliya nǝ dom nǝtapsi ki gasi. <verse eid="ACT 23:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 23:24" />Ngayi Bulus bǝtsi tǝto' tǝnki asulǝnti ma' gobna ki Pelis.” <verse eid="ACT 23:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 23:25" />I mulkina ki mi' kǝndǝ dlom lash lwabati kǝnǝ nǝgu: <verse eid="ACT 23:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 23:26" />Te'ma' Kaldiwus Lisiyas, tu Ma'mulnalti, Gobna Pelis. Shilniti mul nalti.<verse eid="ACT 23:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 23:27" />Mulgu Yahudawa si lyam tloti, amma yalǝ nǝ mi' kǝndǝ dlommini yakwacati, a kumi timul dǝm ki pit a Loman kǝni. <verse eid="ACT 23:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 23:28" />Ami lyamti taman yakǝn laki singettiɗa, ya mbǝlti ma' mi'dlǝtl shilǝnwasǝn ɗa. <verse eid="ACT 23:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 23:29" />Yambi si dakǝtti tǝn shilǝn ki kushtiwasǝn, amma bezǝn lǝɓa u nǝs zitu atala ki kǝndǝti ko tlotwai. <verse eid="ACT 23:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 23:30" />“Nakumi sa kǝndi bezǝ' ulǝntintu, iki ya shini sǝ'talati maki. Ya ul mi' pǝtlti nǝ shilǝn ni su sǝ' dlǝm ulnǝ pǝli u akina wagi. <verse eid="ACT 23:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 23:31" />Tǝn gaki nǝgu imi' kǝndǝ dlom kan Bulus ne'si a gasi is talati Antipatlis. <verse eid="ACT 23:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 23:32" />Nǝ lucilu is za' mi'kǝndǝ dlom mi'tottǝn bǝtsi sǝ'zǝgane'ti, is paltya gelu dǝmtwasan. <verse eid="ACT 23:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 23:33" />Nǝ mi'kǝndǝ dlom mi'tottǝn bǝtsi mbǝci Kaisaliya u, is bǝl Gobna i lwabati is za' Bulus atoh wasi. <verse eid="ACT 23:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 23:34" />Nǝ gobna ya lwabatisi u, i' gyem Bulus kiɓo age'lu u kǝnkiɗa. Nǝ'kumi a Kilikiya u, <verse eid="ACT 23:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 23:35" />i' usu, “Anga'kiki kǝm ǝn mi' pǝtl ki nǝ shilǝn sa mbǝ u.” I gobna i bǝl zhil sǝ', dlǝl Bulus a bidla ki Hilidus.<verse eid="ACT 23:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 23" />
  <chapter number="24" style="c" sid="ACT 24" />
  <para style="s">Sa tǝla Bulus akina ɗǝ Bilatus si</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 24:1" />Kal ki mutti nantam i bal lǝɓa, Ananiyas, is su Kaisaliya nǝ mi'kinayen nǝ lauya mulshin Taltulus, is tǝla shilǝn ki Bulus akina ɗǝ gobna. <verse eid="ACT 24:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 24:2" />Nǝ sul Bulus giɓi u, i Taltulus mbǝl shilǝn akina ɗǝ Apilikus: “Mul nalti tu'maki mbalǝn mbi dǝp kizoki mul mbunti, tu'ma' yellu loluwa' kǝn likǝn dǝb ki mbalǝn inǝn ɗa. <verse eid="ACT 24:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 24:3" />Ko a nǝmi, mbalǝn inǝn si godeki ko a una. <verse eid="ACT 24:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 24:4" />Amma gaki ɓa dǝmbǝl ki, Ami ngepki nǝ zo' mbadlwa gu ga' kimi kǝm tǝn ndo'lǝs ulnǝ tǝn dlǝmiku. <verse eid="ACT 24:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 24:5" />“Mǝ mbi mulu mul ngaushilǝn kǝni, mul mbǝlt dlatl kǝni adlom ki Yahudawa nǝ ko a u nǝ age' dǝb lǝɓa, kuma tikǝ mulkina ki ɗalika ki Nazalawa. <verse eid="ACT 24:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 24:6" />Hal ti lyap kon nǝ libi ki Lya; in gobti. Nǝ lati mbatl ki tǝn pǝli' shilǝn tǝn zhillinǝn. <verse eid="ACT 24:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 24:7" />Amma mul kina Lisiyas kǝm shilǝni u i' mbǝ i' kanti ɗǝ mami nǝdǝlti. <verse eid="ACT 24:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 24:8" />In ka cetti nǝ gawagu, kǝn ma' bali tǝn mus ulnǝ mi dlǝmti tǝntu.”<verse eid="ACT 24:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 24:9" />I na Yahudawa yen pǝ kal ki shilǝnisi, is ndǝgi shilǝni nǝguɗa. <verse eid="ACT 24:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 24:10" />Nǝ gobnayi ndǝgiti tǝ' shilǝn u, “I Bulus usu, amani hwon dimbǝlli ka tle pǝli' mbalǝn i shilǝn i. Nǝ hwol mbatl kǝn ta pal shilǝn ini. <verse eid="ACT 24:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 24:11" />Kimanini a ngǝl muttu kult nǝ lob nǝ patl tai ini a Ulshelima ɗǝ shilǝn nǝ Lya wai. <verse eid="ACT 24:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 24:12" />Mi' mbǝtl shilǝn i sa mbi ɗǝ shot bi nǝ tlilt gatl lya nǝ mbalǝn age' libi ki Lya wai, nǝ age lu dopga ki Yahudawa nǝ age' gatli. <verse eid="ACT 24:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 24:13" />Sǝ'kǝn ma' dlǝmi'ki ulnǝ lakiɗa is mbǝllǝn ɗa makuwai. <verse eid="ACT 24:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 24:14" />Amma a ndǝgi, nǝ shitu u nǝsi mbeti ki ‘Dalika u, nǝ ami bǝtl Lya ki kolsi i nǝn ɗa u, ami lati mbatl nǝ mus ulnǝ ki laci ge zhil ki Musa nǝ ge lwatbat ki mi' nje shinkǝn ki Lya u. <verse eid="ACT 24:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 24:15" />Ami la'ti mbatl nǝ Lya, kan u nǝ gi ɗǝ La'ti mbadlu, nǝn tlǝtl mi'mǝshti, mi'zo'mbadli nǝ mi'besǝn mbadli. <verse eid="ACT 24:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 24:16" />Gaki nǝgu, ko a nǝmi ami ɗǝtl mbadli gaki ɓadǝm ulkǝ dlǝmi ma' mbalǝn nǝ ma' Lya. <verse eid="ACT 24:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 24:17" />“Kal ki zati Ulshelima nǝ hwon ten ngulen, Ya paltya ta ɗǝtl mbalǝn inǝn, a bǝlsi ulki toh ini nǝ ulki keli' Lya. <verse eid="ACT 24:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 24:18" />A mi ge' pǝlti nǝgu is mbi nǝ ki peshti age' libi ki Lya. Bǝ ami ɗa ne' hwu' mbalǝn wai bǝ a tlili mbalǝn mbadlwai. <verse eid="ACT 24:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 24:19" />Amma Yahudawa yen ɗa tye'ge' atl ki Asiya, ginǝ a mbuni asi ki a kina ɗa'ka, si tǝlla shilǝn i ma'ki ǝn shilǝn won nisiɗa tǝnkǝn u. <verse eid="ACT 24:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 24:20" />Ko aza Mbalǝni sǝ' dlǝb lati asǝn giɓi u nǝs mbi nǝ nali u, gasi u nǝ a dlǝl kina ki mi'dlǝtl shilǝn u, <verse eid="ACT 24:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 24:21" />Atǝn shilǝn nǝmon kǝn katl na tlǝl yali a ami ki dlili akina ɗa si, ya usu ‘Gaki tlǝtl lya ki mi' mǝshti si pǝlitǝn shilǝnɗa akina wakǝn a sǝtti.’ ” <verse eid="ACT 24:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 24:22" />Pilikus nǝ dǝm niki timul ma'lǝɓa a tǝn shitu u, i' dlǝtlsi. I' usu, “In Lisiya mulkina a mbǝ u,” “An poci'kin shilǝni.” <verse eid="ACT 24:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 24:23" />Ibbǝl bal mul kǝndǝ'dlom bǝl zhil tǝl le Bulus, amma ibbǝltti mbul ki tǝza' yelǝnsi wasi sǝmɓǝ sǝ ngawi' wunnǝ ti lyamti u.<verse eid="ACT 24:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 24:24" />Kalkǝ lǝb mutti i Pilikiya mbǝnǝ kǝliwasi Dulisila, yakǝn Yahudiya. I' shin shin kǝn sǝ'mbǝlli' Bulus i' gakki' kǝm tǝn la'ti mbatl nǝ Almasihu Yesu wasu. <verse eid="ACT 24:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 24:25" />Nǝ Bulus ɗǝ dlǝb ulkǝ zoki, nǝ ngapti ga nǝ zǝ' ɓatltu nǝɗǝ bǝtu, I Pelikus kum ɓulti i' usu, “Nǝ guni apǝ i! Kǝn ma'zǝ'ga. In a mbi mbulu an ta'ki ki bi.” <verse eid="ACT 24:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 24:26" />Gaki ti la'ti mbadli ɗǝgon a Bulus bǝlti ulpi, i lakiɗa i' gob takinti biɗa ati shilǝn siti. <verse eid="ACT 24:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 24:27" />Kalki hown lob, Bolkiyes pestas nje Pilikus. Pilikus ne gaki ngau holhuwla ma' Yahudawa i'za' Bulus age' lukǝndǝn mbalǝn.<verse eid="ACT 24:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 24" />
  <chapter number="25" style="c" sid="ACT 25" />
  <para style="s">Bulus Tǝla Shilǝn kina ɗǝ Kaisal</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 25:1" />Nǝ Pestus mbǝ'ci ge' atlwasu, Kal ki mutti maki i' za' Kaisaliya illǝ Ulshelima, <verse eid="ACT 25:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 25:2" />Iki i bas lǝɓasi nǝ mi'kina ki Yahudawa is tǝla shilǝn ki Bulus ma'ti. Is bǝl Pestus bi <verse eid="ACT 25:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 25:3" />tǝ' ɗǝlsi, sǝm mbǝl Bulus a Ulshelima, amma is kǝndi tǝ gen hwun tǝn shitu gaki sǝ' tloti. <verse eid="ACT 25:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 25:4" />Amma i Pestus ndǝgi i' usu, “Bulus ki i dle Akaisaliya, ami nǝ gayini ami lyab lǝti tyaka ge' muttuni. <verse eid="ACT 25:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 25:5" />Hwe tǝ na mi'kina wakǝn mbǝ ne' kǝni, in a mbi mullisi nǝ lati asǝn giɓi u as mbǝl shilǝn wasi.” <verse eid="ACT 25:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 25:6" />Pestus a ngǝtl mutti usǝpsi ko kutl a tine'siwai, i lǝ Kaisaliya. Lucili i' totǝn kundǝn guntwasi, illaki sǝm mbǝl Bulus a kina ɗa'ka. <verse eid="ACT 25:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 25:7" />Nǝ Bulus tette' giɓi u, I Yahudwa ginǝ mbǝ te' Ulshelima i is gadǝl ti galgal. Asi mbǝtl shilǝn dimɓǝli tǝnti besni, gini sima bǝs Mani wai u. <verse eid="ACT 25:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 25:8" />I Bulus dlǝli gawasi: i' usu “Amiɓo a lew nǝ zhil ki Yahudawa wai ko libi ki Lya ko Kaisallwai.” <verse eid="ACT 25:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 25:9" />Pestus, ne gaki ngau hwol hwula ma' Yahudawa, i' ul Bulus su, kǝn ndǝ'ti ki'su Ulshelima sǝp pǝli shilǝn a kina ɗaka tǝn usi nǝsi zi'ki gawa?” <verse eid="ACT 25:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 25:10" />I Bulus usu: “Nǝgun u ki dlǝli ami ɗa abidla shilǝn ki Kaisal, a ge'lu unǝ mbuni tǝ pǝli shilǝn ɗa u. A pǝli Yahudawa ulǝn wai, ki gawagi ki mani nǝguɗa. <verse eid="ACT 25:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 25:11" />In lati asǝn gibi i u atala tlotu, ai, a kǝn dlali mǝshtwai. Amma in bal shilǝn nisi ɗa tǝn ulnǝ si ngauti tǝn kǝn u wai u, to mul bǝtl Yahudawa ami ɗawai. Ya ngayi tǝ mbǝl' shilǝn ini a kina ɗǝ Kaisal!” <verse eid="ACT 25:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 25:12" />Kalkǝ shilǝn ki Pestus ne' mi'dlǝdl shilǝn wasi, indǝgi i' usu, “To ka ngayi tǝ tala shilǝn wa' kina ɗǝ Kaisal. To ma' Kaisal kǝn ki'lǝ!”<verse eid="ACT 25:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Bulus akina ki Agalipa nǝ Banis</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 25:13" />Nǝ tlǝp mutti tenngulen u, i Guu Agaliba nǝ Banis is mbǝ Kaisaliya gaki sǝ' uli Pestus ɗem. <verse eid="ACT 25:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 25:14" />Is lǝm mutti tyaka diɓǝlu, iki i Pestus dlǝm shilǝn tǝn Bulus isǝ Guu. I' usu: “Mulǝn aki gunǝ Pelis za'ti ge'lu ki ndǝ mbalǝn. <verse eid="ACT 25:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 25:15" />Na lǝ Ulshelima u, i bas laɓasi nǝ kolsisi ki Yahudawa is mbǝl shilǝn tǝnti, is usu ta poci' shilǝn. <verse eid="ACT 25:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 25:16" />“Amne ya ulsisu Lomawa aku ɗǝ pǝlt guwai, tǝ'zi mul lati asǝn giɓi ɓatltwai, gaki tǝla' mulǝn ɗǝ hwol tugwai, sai nǝti nǝ mi'pǝlti nǝ shilǝn sa mbǝ sa makina ɗǝ pǝtl shilǝn, ammbi abmbun gawas tǝn shilǝn u nǝs mbǝli tǝntu. <verse eid="ACT 25:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 25:17" />Nǝs mbǝ kummwasǝn u, a dǝmbǝl shilǝni wai, citl ki lu ya totǝn kundǝn guntini ya bǝl zhil sǝm mbǝli mulisi. <verse eid="ACT 25:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 25:18" />Nǝ mi'ship shilǝn hilya u, a kum bezǝn shilǝn u nǝ a la'mbadli sǝn dlǝmti tǝn tuwai. <verse eid="ACT 25:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 25:19" />Sai hwu'shilǝn yen kǝn sǝ mbǝlli tǝnti tǝn bǝtl Lya wasǝn, nǝ mulǝn kise Yesu, gunǝ mǝcu, amma i Bulus dlǝl katl tǝn ta mǝcuwai. <verse eid="ACT 25:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 25:20" />Amine a hol kan unǝ ta bǝl gǝs ki shilǝn u ɗa u i: Ya usu ko tǝn suti Ulshelima gaki sǝ' pǝllit shilǝn swaka. <verse eid="ACT 25:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 25:21" />Amma i Bulus ngayi sǝ' dlǝl shilǝn wasi, i Augustas ya shilǝn nisi, iki ya bǝl zhil sǝ' idlati sai gasi u nǝ a taki Kaisal ti u.” <verse eid="ACT 25:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 25:22" />I Agilipa ul Pestus su, “Ami gayi ma ami lyap kup ulnǝ tǝ mulu dlǝmi u.” I Pestus usu Akyeu kǝn kubti.”<verse eid="ACT 25:22" /></para>
  <para style="s">Bulus akina ki Agilipa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 25:23" />Nǝ citl kǝlu Agilipa nǝ Balniki is mbǝ age' naltwasǝn ki gunti is te'ge' kǝs ki dlǝl shilǝn ne' mi'kina ki dlati nǝ bas mbalǝn kige' gatli. I Pestus, bǝlsi zhil sǝn mbǝl Bulus. <verse eid="ACT 25:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 25:24" />I Pestus usu, “Guu Agilipa, nǝ mus mbalǝn i nǝ ne' mini u, kǝn ɗǝ ye' muluwa gunǝ Yahudawa mbǝl shilǝn was a Ulshelima nǝ a ki a Kiasaliya, asi matltti ambuni tǝzati tǝ' dǝm tǝn diwai. <verse eid="ACT 25:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 25:25" />A yen ulnǝ' pǝli i a kǝmmǝsh tuwai, tun nǝ ti nǝ gawas kǝn tǝ ngauyi sǝ' palshilǝni akina ki Augustas, ya usu an takkitki tiswai. <verse eid="ACT 25:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 25:26" />Amma ulǝn niɗa gunǝ ta laci mul ban ini gawa suwai. Tǝn gaki nǝgu ambǝlti kina wakǝn ɗa, nǝ akina ɗa'ka Guu Agilipa, ko gaki kal ki gyepti an ammbi ulnǝ talaci u. <verse eid="ACT 25:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 25:27" />Tǝn yati ini, ndokkǝkkǝni tǝta' mul ki kǝndi bǝnǝ mbitti nǝ ulnǝ' pǝli uwai.”<verse eid="ACT 25:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 25" />
  <chapter number="26" style="c" sid="ACT 26" />
  <para style="s">Bulus Dlǝli Gawasi Akina ki Aglibas</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 26:1" />Iki i Aglippa ul Bulus su, “A ndǝgi ki'shilǝni a'dlǝli gawagi.” I Bulus ta'toh lya I'gob shilǝn I'usu: <verse eid="ACT 26:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 26:2" />“A mbi zo' asǝn i Guu Aglippa, nǝ dǝmniki akina ɗa'ka ta dlǝli ta shilǝn asǝti u tǝn mus ship shilǝn u nǝ Yahudawa pǝli u, <verse eid="ACT 26:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 26:3" />Nǝ dǝm niki Ki mul ma' lǝɓani ge'dǝb ki Yahudawa u nǝ shilǝn wasǝn u. Ami ngepki ki' ga'ki kǝm nǝ ngaptibi. <verse eid="ACT 26:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 26:4" />“Mus mbalǝn ki Yahudawa sǝman dǝmtini a ɗǝ ya'ni, tun tlǝ tini age atlini, nǝ a Ulshelima. <verse eid="ACT 26:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 26:5" />Sǝman nǝni tun teɗe ǝn sǝn dlǝb ulnǝs mani tǝnkǝn u, Sǝmani ami mul bǝtl ɗalika mul ndǝl tuni ge' bǝtl Lya inǝn, a pǝlǝn dǝpkǝ mul palisa. <verse eid="ACT 26:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 26:6" />Nǝguni tǝn gaki la'tti mbadlǝ tǝn dlǝlliti u nǝ Lya pǝli mi'zǝ' mi'zǝm mini u i lakiɗa ami ki dlǝli tǝ pǝli shilǝn ɗa asǝti. <verse eid="ACT 26:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 26:7" />Guki dlǝlliti ki bi inǝn kutl nǝ lop ginǝ ɗǝ la'ti mbatl nǝ bǝtl Lya gasi nǝ dloncin si la'ti mbadli sǝ'en njikǝn twasi. Guu Aglippa, gaki la'ti mbaldlu Yahudwa ɗǝ pǝltǝn nǝ shilǝn ɗa. <verse eid="ACT 26:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 26:8" />Yalaki ɗa tǝn yenti wakǝn Lya kǝn ma'tlil mi'mǝshtwaiya? <verse eid="ACT 26:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 26:9" />“Teɗi ammi gayi ni ya yeni kǝnǝ mbunni tapǝl lǝɓa iye' ki kon nǝshin ki Yesu mul nazalat. <verse eid="ACT 26:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 26:10" />Nǝgu apǝli a Ulshelima. Tǝn ndǝ'ti ki bas lǝɓasi ala' mbalǝn mi'bǝtl Yesu kal dimbǝli age'lu kǝndǝ' mbalǝn, hal ɓal tlwassi u, ami pǝ' kal ki nǝgu. <verse eid="ACT 26:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 26:11" />Cin diɓǝli atle bǝtl lu dobga ki Yahudawa a ami pǝlissi ngashti, ami la'tisi sǝn nge Lya. Gaki kub dutugwasǝn, a ami bǝtlsi kali hal tyage' atlen a ami pǝli'si ngashti. <verse eid="ACT 26:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 26:12" />“Age' nǝguni, ami lǝ' Dimaskus nǝ ndǝ'ti ki bas lǝɓasi nǝ shinkǝn wasǝn. <verse eid="ACT 26:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 26:13" />Adlocin, Guu Aglippa, ami tǝn shitu nǝgu, yayen chilti sul lya, ngǝtl chin, nǝ chilti, ɗǝ chitl a malgǝn ini ne' elsǝni dutini. <verse eid="ACT 26:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 26:14" />Musi nǝn in nda atli, yakum yalon ɗǝ ussu nǝbi ki Alamai, ‘shaulu, shaulu, Yaki pǝlitǝn besǝn lǝɓaɗa? Bǝna ki ɗa katl nǝki nge tǝn u.’ <verse eid="ACT 26:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 26:15" />“Ya usu ki okǝni, mul nalti?’ I mul ban usu. “Amiki Yesu, gunǝ ki pǝlitǝn ngashtu,’ <verse eid="ACT 26:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 26:16" />Hilya ki' dlǝl tǝn Asǝn wagi. A mbǝn ma'ku ki'dǝm mul kyautǝn i ɗani, a' dlǝm ulnǝ' eni tǝnkǝn u ɗa, nǝ ulnǝ ta dlǝmi' a kina ki u. <verse eid="ACT 26:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 26:17" />An pekǝtl ki ɗǝge' mbalǝn wagi nǝ ginǝ bǝ Yahudawa wai u, ginǝ tashin ki swa ma si u. <verse eid="ACT 26:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 26:18" />Gaki ki' ɓulisi dwaɗǝn, sǝppete ɗǝge' dǝmshal, as paltya' tǝn chilti, as pe'ɗǝge' gukki shedan as paltǝn guk ki Lya, nǝnǝgu nǝn pacisi besǝn laɓa wasǝn ɗa sǝn dǝm ne' mus nǝginǝ peshsi u, tǝn gaki sa la'mbatl nǝ ami i.’ <verse eid="ACT 26:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 26:19" />“Gaki nǝgu, Guu Aglippa, a nge ndǝ'ti nǝ tlu'tu nǝ pe'sul lya uwai. <verse eid="ACT 26:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 26:20" />A Damascu a pisi shilǝn ki Lya pa, nǝ a Ulshelima nǝ mus alt ki Yahudiya, a pa ya pǝli mi'ginǝ bǝ Yahudawa wai u, shilǝn ki Lya sǝ'za'pǝtl bezǝn lǝɓawasǝn sǝ' palte' ma' Lya aspǝl kyautǝn u nǝ mbo'totin patl te ma' Lya wasǝn u. <verse eid="ACT 26:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 26:21" />Gaki nǝgu Yahudawa goppǝn ɗa a ge'libi ki Lya is ngayi sǝ'tloɗa. <verse eid="ACT 26:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 26:22" />Amma i Lya ɗǝlǝni hal i mbǝl nǝguni; i laki ɗa ami dlǝmi' mbalǝn shilǝn ki Lya bazi nǝ mil a ami dlǝb ulnǝ bǝ a shoti nǝ mi'nje'shinkǝn ki Lya nǝ Musa dlǝmi nǝn ndatu. <verse eid="ACT 26:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 26:23" />Sǝ usu Almasihu nǝn tle' bǝna ti hilya ɗǝ ge'mi'mǝshti pa, atl dlǝmi Yahudawa cilti ki pe'ti nǝ ginǝ bǝ Yahudawa wai u.” <verse eid="ACT 26:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 26:24" />Bulus age' shilǝn kǝn ngu, i Pestus tlǝl yali nǝ ndǝlti i ultisu! “Ki Bulus ga a gǝliki, “Pǝtl lashtiwa' eye u ɗǝ gǝlli'ga.” <verse eid="ACT 26:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 26:25" />Amma i Bulus usu. “Mulnalti Pestus,” Ga a gǝliwai, “Balini ami dlǝmti nǝ mbatl nǝm. <verse eid="ACT 26:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 26:26" />Guu Aglippa amma' shilǝn nǝki nǝ mbatl nǝm. A mani ka zi mus usi nǝ dwaɗǝ, pǝlin dli ki hwundǝliwai. <verse eid="ACT 26:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 26:27" />Guu Agilipa, ka ndǝ' ni nǝmi' nje shinkǝn ki Lyawa? Amani ka ndǝgi.” <verse eid="ACT 26:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 26:28" />I Agilipa ul Bulus su, “Kǝn ɗǝ yenti ge' yakǝn cin u kǝn la'tǝni adǝm Kilista ya?” <verse eid="ACT 26:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 26:29" />I Bulus usu, “Ko ge' yakǝn cin, koge' pya'si, ami shilǝn nǝ Lya bǝ ki nǝmwai nǝ mus ginǝ ɗǝ gakti kǝm asǝti u, sǝn dǝmti kǝnǝ ami, kidai bannǝ zhim domu.” <verse eid="ACT 26:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 26:30" />I Guu hilya, nǝ mul kina Pestus nǝ Balniki, nǝ ginǝ ki dǝmi ne'tu. <verse eid="ACT 26:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 26:31" />Kalkǝ za'ti kǝb swasǝn, is pal shilǝn ne'elsǝni, “Mulgu tapǝl ulnǝ tǝ mbalǝn tloti ko kǝndǝ'twai. <verse eid="ACT 26:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 26:32" />Agilipa ul Pestus su, “Tǝ gaki tǝ ɓewlǝn shilǝn u kina ma' Kaisal lwai u, a ndali tǝ za' mulu.”<verse eid="ACT 26:32" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 26" />
  <chapter number="27" style="c" sid="ACT 27" />
  <para style="s">Bulus te ge' Kundǝlǝn ki Mal is su Loma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 27:1" />Nǝ kǝndi ɗǝ hilya ɗǝ su' Italiya ge' kundǝlǝn ki malu, is ta' Bulus a toh ɗǝ bal mul kǝndǝ' dlom ne' na mi' ginǝ ge' kǝs kǝndǝ' mbalen u, mulshin Yuliyas, nǝm age' mi' kǝndǝ' dlom ki domga ki Agusta. <verse eid="ACT 27:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 27:2" />Nǝn te ge' kundǝlǝn te' Adalamatiya mul lyap su'ge' gatlen a malgǝn Asiya u, in gob lǝti, a Alistalkus mul Tasolonika won ki atl ki Makidoniya, tine' mi. <verse eid="ACT 27:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 27:3" />Nǝ lucilu in mbǝci a Sidom. Yuliyas ne ippǝli Bulus ulki zoki, is za'ti tǝs su ma yelǝnsi wasi gaki sǝ' ɗǝlti ɗa. <verse eid="ACT 27:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 27:4" />Nǝn tlǝ aki age' kundǝllǝn ki mallu gaki ki etǝl tlǝtl tetǝn kina inǝn, in gandǝl tu kal calgatl ki Kublus. <verse eid="ACT 27:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 27:5" />Nǝn peɗǝ ge bal mallu nǝ nja nǝ atl ki Kilikiya nǝki Bampiliya u, in mbǝ'ci Mila a ge' atl ki Likiya. <verse eid="ACT 27:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 27:6" />Bal mul kǝndǝ' dlom mbi kundǝlǝn ki Iskandaliya mul lǝ' ge' altki Italiya, illa'mi a giɓi. <verse eid="ACT 27:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 27:7" />In lǝm mutti ami lǝti' ten ten, nǝ ngeskǝn mǝ mbǝci nja nǝ Kinidas. Nǝ bǝ yetǝl a zamiwai u, in gandǝli akal calgatl ki Kalita nja nǝ Salmoni. <verse eid="ACT 27:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 27:8" />Nǝ nges kǝn mǝ ɓew nja nǝ bǝgasi in mbǝci ge' lu u nǝ ɗǝ mbeti hwu' ki zoki, nja nǝ gatlt ki Lisiya. <verse eid="ACT 27:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 27:9" />Nǝ dǝmniki lǝtisi a dlewtwai u, lǝti sima i' dǝm ulki ci' ɓanti, cinkǝ ngaptibima a ɓewyi, i Bulus dǝlisi kǝm, <verse eid="ACT 27:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 27:10" />I' ulsisu, “Ami yenti lǝtinǝn u nǝn dǝmti ulki ki ci' bulti, bǝ hwotl lǝɓa nǝ kundǝlǝn ki malu katlwai, nǝ dli inǝn ma.” <verse eid="ACT 27:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 27:11" />Amma bal mul ki ndǝ'dlom a ndǝ' nǝ ulnǝ Bulus dlǝmi u wai, tǝ gǝtli nǝ kub shilǝn ki mul kundǝlǝni nǝ mul dǝtl kundǝlǝn u. <verse eid="ACT 27:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 27:12" />Nǝ dǝm niki lu hwuntu a mbuni kundǝlǝn i' sǝ' ci watlǝn agimbi wai u, mbalǝn diɓǝli is mbǝl shilǝn sǝ'tlǝ ɗǝki, kowongi si ngashti bi mbǝci tya Ponokiya sǝ'dǝm tya ka. Age' lu hwu ki calgalt ki Kalita, gunǝ ɗǝya' bǝgasi ki alewa nǝ kudu u.<verse eid="ACT 27:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Bundǝlǝn a dlǝlka</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 27:13" />Nǝ yetǝlu gop hotti te'ɗi ten ten u, tǝn lati mbadl ki mbalǝnisi sambi ulnǝ si lyamti u i; is dǝl kundǝlǝn ki mali nǝ kali nǝ zhim dom is bǝli tya malgǝn calgalt ki Kalita nja nǝ bigasi. <verse eid="ACT 27:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 27:14" />Alǝm dǝmtwai, i bal etǝl tlǝtoh ge' calgatli gunǝ ɗǝ mbeti ki Yulokilidon. <verse eid="ACT 27:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 27:15" />Nǝ etǝl li' ku ndǝllǝn ki malisi u, hal taman nga'ti etǝli ndan wai, in zaki katl i etǝlli si go' jakǝnmi. <verse eid="ACT 27:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 27:16" />Nǝn bǝli kal yakǝn calgatlon u mulshin Kauda, lu unǝ etǝl bosɗa u, nǝngeskǝn mi dlǝl ya kǝn kundǝllǝni. <verse eid="ACT 27:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 27:17" />Is sul yakǝn kundǝllǝnni swa ge' bali u, si kupɓanti is kǝ'kǝndǝ zhim is gandǝl bal kundǝllǝni ɗa, gaki ɓa suge tisǝn ki bǝgasi ki Siltis mul sǝga' mus lǝɓa, iki is shit luluti ki tǝn kǝndǝlǝnnisikǝ tǝn gaki tǝ yetǝl jakǝn kundǝlǝni siɗa. <verse eid="ACT 27:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 27:18" />Gaki bundǝlǝn mul ndǝlti ɗǝ kundǝlǝnni eye', nǝ citlkǝlu i mi' ndǝtl kundǝllǝni gop utti kaya taka swage'mal. <verse eid="ACT 27:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 27:19" />Nǝ mutti maki nǝ toh wasan kǝn sǝdla' ul kyautǝn ki kundǝllǝni taka. <verse eid="ACT 27:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 27:20" />Mutti di ɓǝli mayen cin nǝ cadlǝllwai, sai bal yetǝlon kǝn ɗǝ li'ti mi, in pe'kǝl mbadl ki pe'ti. <verse eid="ACT 27:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 27:21" />Nǝ dǝm niki alǝm mutti ba ɗap ulki ɗami, i Bulus hilya gal adlom ɗa si i'usu: “Mbalǝn, tǝ'ka kumǝn shilǝn i u tǝn bǝ zakǝn calgatl ki Kalita wai u, da kǝ'kǝn ndati ge' ulkǝ ci' bultuwai nǝ hwol lǝɓa u wai. <verse eid="ACT 27:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 27:22" />Ammi ndǝllǝn mbadli, gaki nǝgu mullǝn gudǝl nǝm kǝn gǝtl age' kini wai, sai dai tǝ hwol ku ndǝlǝni. <verse eid="ACT 27:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 27:23" />Age' gaski hwuɗi mul shikǝn ki Lya shilǝn nǝ ami. Ami zheli ki Lya kǝni, ti ami pǝlitti bǝna. I' shin mul shinkǝ wassuɗi tǝm mbǝ makǝni. <verse eid="ACT 27:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 27:24" />I usu, ‘Bǝkum ɓantwai Bulus. Kǝn dlǝlti kina ɗǝ Kaisal, i ngu Lya a kumki ta ndǝgi mus yelǝnsi lǝtwagi sǝn pe'ti.’ <verse eid="ACT 27:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 27:25" />Gaki nǝgu ndǝllǝn mbadlwakǝn, kini mbalǝn, a la' mbatl nǝ Lya tǝn ussu, kan u nǝs dlǝmi u, nǝgu tǝ pǝldli. <verse eid="ACT 27:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 27:26" />Amma nǝ ngeti etǝl nǝn la'timin tya tǝn bǝgasi.”<verse eid="ACT 27:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 27:27" />Age' gas ki mutti kutl nǝ upsi asi dǝtl mi age' dlǝlka ki Adaliya, abal gasi mi'dǝtl kundǝlǝni siyenti mǝ ɓal nja nǝ bǝgasi i. <verse eid="ACT 27:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 27:28" />Is cimbǝl lolu' ki mali is mbi asan kutl cen nǝm nǝ kutl lǝbi lop. Nǝn lǝ kina ten ngulen u is cimbǝli ɗaɗanu is mbi lolu tisi asan kutl lǝbi nǝtapsi. <verse eid="ACT 27:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 27:29" />Gaki kitǝli' li'ti zǝnga, is la' dom gudǝl upsi ki kal kundǝlǝni, is shilǝn nǝ Lya tǝ lu dlewti ɗǝ cilti. <verse eid="ACT 27:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 27:30" />Mi'dǝtl kundǝlǝni is ngau kitǝl ɗǝ ge' kundǝlǝni, hal sashi' yakǝn kundǝlǝn age' mali, gaki tǝ yen dli kǝnǝ sǝ shit dom ki bikina ki kundǝlǝni ni is za'si. <verse eid="ACT 27:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 27:31" />I Bulus ul bal mul kǝndǝ dlom ki Loma su nǝ mi'kǝndǝ dlom, in mbalǝn i adlǝl ge' kundǝlǝn uwai u, ka mbǝ'cini ki' pe' twai.” <verse eid="ACT 27:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 27:32" />I mi'kǝndǝ dlomi is ɓaɓatl zhim ki tǝn yakǝn kundǝlǝni is za' kundǝlǝni i mal kami. <verse eid="ACT 27:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 27:33" />Nǝ lu ɓal nja tǝ cilu. I Bulus ulsisu sǝn na'ɗam ulǝn, “A sǝti mutti kutl nǝ upsi ngu, aki dǝp ki ɓutti, bǝ ka ɗamǝn ulǝn wai.” <verse eid="ACT 27:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 27:34" />Gaki nǝgu ami shetl kini ki'ɗamini, gaki dliwakǝn, gaki nǝgu mulǝn gudǝl nǝm medlǝn ki gawakǝn kǝn gǝltwai. <verse eid="ACT 27:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 27:35" />Nǝtl dlǝmi nǝgu u, i' kan biledi i' shilǝn nǝ Lya akina wasan, i' chali it gop ɗamti. <verse eid="ACT 27:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 27:36" />Musswasǝn is kum ndǝlti, sima is ɗam ulki ɗami. <verse eid="ACT 27:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 27:37" />Musi nǝn age' kundǝlǝni mi kutl cen lop nǝ kutl lǝbi ningi nǝ mǝ'ka ni. <verse eid="ACT 27:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 27:38" />Nǝs ɗami nǝ kǝmsi u, is gop bosi' kundǝlǝni di ɓǝtl taka, is gop utti alkama swa ge' mali. <verse eid="ACT 27:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 27:39" />Nǝlucilu, saman atlu nǝsi lǝbi uwai, amma is yen luwon multisǝn is kǝndǝ shilǝn is ussu in mul pǝkkǝn u as tǝla kundǝlǝni atǝn tisǝni. <verse eid="ACT 27:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 27:40" />Is ɓaɓatl zhim domi taka is zaki age' mali, age' cini a si tǝngǝl ul jakkǝ kundǝlǝni, is tlǝl lulut ki tǝn kina ki kundǝlǝni tǝn kina yetǝl. Is nga bigasi tya. <verse eid="ACT 27:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 27:41" />Amma nǝm mbǝci gelu unǝ dlǝlka pǝl dandle u, is jakǝn kundǝlǝni i gami te'ge' tisǝn, hal kundǝlǝni taman utti nuwai i kal kundǝlǝni kan tatlti gaki tlitti ki bǝs ki mal. <verse eid="ACT 27:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="ACT 27:42" />Amma mi'kǝndǝ dlomi lyami sǝ'tlwa mi' ginǝ ge'lu kǝndǝ mbalǝn i, ɓas pe' ge' mali as kitǝli. <verse eid="ACT 27:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="ACT 27:43" />Amma nǝ bal mul kǝndǝ dlom ki Loma lyami tǝ pekǝl Bulus su, in nge. I' balsi zhil i' ulsisu mulnǝ man malu as ndaswa ge' malu as lǝ tǝn bigasi, <verse eid="ACT 27:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="ACT 27:44" />Gen ne is to'tǝn ancin ki kunɗǝlǝn genne tǝn use ki kundǝlǝnisi. Nǝnǝgu is mbǝci lau.<verse eid="ACT 27:44" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 27" />
  <chapter number="28" style="c" sid="ACT 28" />
  <para style="s">Bulus tǝn Bigasi ki Malta</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 28:1" />Kal ki ma pe'ti nǝn in kumi shin ki ɗani i ki Malta. <verse eid="ACT 28:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 28:2" />Mbalǝn ki lǝbi is pǝlimi ulkǝ zoki is njemi mus, is hwotimi utu gaki mal ɗǝ mbǝti a etǝtl kǝn ngu. <verse eid="ACT 28:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 28:3" />Bulus dwam ancin te'ɗi ti utti utu ngu, i uci won pe'toɗi nǝn kum utu i' gobpi Bulus toh. <verse eid="ACT 28:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 28:4" />Nǝ mbalǝn ki lǝbi yen uci a sǝnkǝli Bulus toh u, is ul elsǝnisu, “Mulu mul tlo' mbalǝn kǝni; ko nǝ' ta pe' ki bal malu, ngonǝnagu ngashtwas ɗǝ bǝtlti kali sai nǝ ta mǝci.” <verse eid="ACT 28:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 28:5" />Amma I Bulus dladla'toh wasi idldla'uci i swa utu amma ulǝn a mbitwai. <verse eid="ACT 28:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 28:6" />Mbalǝn ni ɗǝ yenti lǝbi nǝn kǝtti ko anda ammǝci, amma kalkǝ lǝb dǝmti nǝbǝ sa yen ulǝn a mbitwai u, is shilǝn ɗaɗanu is usu ti lya won kǝni. <verse eid="ACT 28:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 28:7" />Nja nǝ Lǝbi, lu ki mul kina ki ɗani i, mul shin Pubilus. Ti njemi a libi ɗakka, i' shimmi ge' nalti hal mutti maki. <verse eid="ACT 28:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 28:8" />Mulzǝ' Babiliyas tǝ ki muɗi atli ti gonti. I Bulus su mati, i' shilǝn nǝ Lya i' zi' toh ga i muli ndokki. <verse eid="ACT 28:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 28:9" />Nǝ nda nǝgu u, i mus ginǝ ɗǝ gonti kitǝn ɗa ni, is gop mbǝti asi mbi' ndo'ti. <verse eid="ACT 28:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 28:10" />Is nalmi tǝn shitu dimbǝli; nǝtǝn tlǝ ge' kundǝlǝn ki malu, is domimi mus ulnǝ mi lyamti u.<verse eid="ACT 28:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Bulus Mbǝkǝci a Loma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 28:11" />Kal ki limaki in tlǝ ge' kundǝlǝn ki mali ki Iskandaliya, gunǝ ci watlǝn atǝn ɗani u. A pǝli' lwaɗi kǝnǝ ngugǝs ki lyayen. <verse eid="ACT 28:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 28:12" />Nǝm mbǝci silakusu in mu'maki alǝbi. <verse eid="ACT 28:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 28:13" />Nǝn za'lǝbǝ u in gandǝli mingu sai a Lhegium. Nǝm muɗu, i etǝl tlǝte'kudu Nǝ lucilu in mbǝ'ci a puteoli. <verse eid="ACT 28:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 28:14" />A kikǝn mǝma ne'elsǝni mi'bǝlti, is ngyemmi tǝn pǝl mutti ningi ne'si. Nǝnǝgu immbǝci Loma. <verse eid="ACT 28:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 28:15" />Nǝ elsǝni inǝn mi' bǝlti ki Lom kum mbǝtinǝn u, is mbǝ sǝ ullimi ɗem hal Age'lu dobga ki Abiyus, gu nǝ si mbetti ki maciya maki. Nǝ Bulus ma ne'mbalǝ ni u, i'gode Lya i ndǝtl mbiti. <verse eid="ACT 28:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 28:16" />Nǝn tye Loma u, i ndǝgi Bulus tǝ'dǝm tǝn gawasi nǝ mul kǝndǝ'dlom mul ɓuttiti u.<verse eid="ACT 28:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Bulus ɗǝ Dlǝp Shilǝn ki Lya a Lom a ɗǝ Buttiti</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 28:17" />Kalkǝ mutti maki, i Bulus taki bas mi' kina ki Yahudawa bi. Nǝs domga u, I Bulus ulsisu: “Yelsǝni ini, ko nǝbǝ aleu wi mbalǝn inǝn mbadlwai u, ko pǝtl gokkǝ mi'zǝ'mini, ngonǝ nǝgu is goppǝni a Ulshelima is bǝl ami ki kǝndi a toh ɗǝ Lomawa. <verse eid="ACT 28:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 28:18" />Nǝs ngyemǝn u si' lyamti sǝ za kǝni, gaki a pǝl bezǝn ulnǝ tǝla tlotu wai. <verse eid="ACT 28:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 28:19" />Nǝ Yahudawa nge' ndǝtu, i dǝmi hwel ta tǝla shilǝn u a kina ɗǝ Kaisal. Gaki mbalǝn i kǝn ta tǝla shilǝni ɗawai. <verse eid="ACT 28:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 28:20" />I laki ya lyam shilǝn ne ki ɗa, gaki zǝ' mbatl ki Isla ilawa i ami ki ki kǝndi nǝ zhim dom ɗa.” <verse eid="ACT 28:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 28:21" />Is ndǝgiti, “Miɓo ma mbi lwabbaton ma' Yahudawa gawagwai, mulǝn a mbǝl shilǝn wa' gi ge elsǝni inǝn wai, ko idlǝm besǝn shilǝn won tǝn kwai. <verse eid="ACT 28:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 28:22" />Amma mi lyamti tǝn kum shilǝn a bi wagi, mǝ mani mbalǝn hu a una si dlǝb bezǝn shilǝn tǝn pyal kushti kǝlagatu.” <verse eid="ACT 28:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 28:23" />Nǝs zǝ cin ki ma' ne' Bulus, sǝ' en Bulus age' cin u nǝs dlǝlli u, Is mbǝ nǝ mbalǝn diɓǝli age' lu unǝ tiɗa nǝ dǝmtu. I' pallisi shilǝn daga nǝ kyau hal a su'ti, ati dlǝmissi shilǝn atǝn gu' ki Lya, ati lyap shetlsi tǝ ndǝlsi te' ma' Yesu tǝn shitu zhil ki Musa nǝ lwabat ki mi'nje' shin kǝn ki Lya. <verse eid="ACT 28:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 28:24" />Gen is ndǝ nǝ shilǝn wasi gen ne is nge'ndǝtti. <verse eid="ACT 28:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 28:25" />Nǝs nge ndǝtti nǝ elsǝni ɗaɗɗasi u, nǝs ɓalkǝ sǝ'za' lǝbi u i Bulus dlǝmisi shilǝn nǝm i'usu, “Ase yal ki mbatl ki Lya a dlǝm bali, nǝ' dlǝmi mi'zǝ'mi zǝ'kini tu'bi ɗǝ Ishaya mul nje'shinkǝn ki Lya ɗǝ usu, <verse eid="ACT 28:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 28:26" />“ ‘Lǝma' mbalǝn i ki' usu, “Kǝn kumtini amma kǝkǝn mantini wai; kǝn yentini amma kǝkǝn mantini wai.” <verse eid="ACT 28:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 28:27" />Gaki mbatl ki mbalǝn i a ndǝndǝli, sa cak kǝmwa sǝn i sa idla dwaɗǝn wasǝn i. Gaki ɓas yeni nǝ dwaɗǝn wasǝn as kumi nǝ kǝmmwasǝn. Gaki sǝp mani nǝ' mbadlwasǝn as palte' makǝni a ndokǝlsi.” <verse eid="ACT 28:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 28:28" />“To manin ca, Lya shinkǝn ki pekǝtl mbalǝn, hal ginǝ bǝ Yahudawa wai u, sikuma sǝn ga'ti kǝm!” <verse eid="ACT 28:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 28:29" />(Nǝdlǝmi nǝgu u, i Yahuawa hilya is gob shotibi ne' elsǝni.) <verse eid="ACT 28:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 28:30" />Hal hwon lop a Bulus ki dǝmi age' libi ki ɓatlti, ti nje'mus ginǝ mbǝ ma'ti sǝ' entu. <verse eid="ACT 28:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 28:31" />A ti dlǝb shilǝn ki te' ge' gugkǝ Lya ati kulci' mbǝlǝn lǝɓa ki mulban Yesu Almasihu nǝ ndǝtl ki mbadli bǝnǝ ɓultwai!<verse eid="ACT 28:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 28" />
</usx>